(4409123, 632921, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning action photograph.  Wonderful sharpness and tremendous plumes of soil.  Shame that the tip of the rear wheel is missing, but what can you do...Hardly something that you can say, "Sorry can you do that again for me"<br/> <br/>Timing may be everything but you also need the skill to be able to capture this sort of opportunity when it arises....And you have certainly got that - 9</td>', 'Stunning action photograph.  Wonderful sharpness and tremendous plumes of soil.  Shame that the tip of the rear wheel is missing, but what can you do...Hardly something that you can say, "Sorry can you do that again for me" Timing may be everything but you also need the skill to be able to capture this sort of opportunity when it arises....And you have certainly got that - 9', '2008-01-21 05:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
