(4409929, 634432, 2553, '<td valign="top">While I am not entirely crazy about this image, I do love the "look" of the kind of fantasy sparkles that is going on.  This does give it a certain quality as eluded to in the title.  I think the positioning of the model feels awkward to me; it just doesn''t enhance the composition for me.</td>', 'While I am not entirely crazy about this image, I do love the "look" of the kind of fantasy sparkles that is going on.  This does give it a certain quality as eluded to in the title.  I think the positioning of the model feels awkward to me; it just doesn''t enhance the composition for me.', '2008-01-21 11:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4409931, 634385, 2764, '<td valign="top">I love a photo that tells a story.  I love how the focus extenda all the way to the mountain across the ocean.  On the 20th of some month in 1988 something profound happened here.  it wasn''t a death because the image extends so far outward into distance and time.  It contrasts the small safe home with the allures of the wide wide world.  The boy left home and went out to seek his fortune fairy tale style?  Someone was hurt by the leaving and waits by the window for a return.  You could write a whole novel based on this one image.  Wonderful.</td>', 'I love a photo that tells a story.  I love how the focus extenda all the way to the mountain across the ocean.  On the 20th of some month in 1988 something profound happened here.  it wasn''t a death because the image extends so far outward into distance and time.  It contrasts the small safe home with the allures of the wide wide world.  The boy left home and went out to seek his fortune fairy tale style?  Someone was hurt by the leaving and waits by the window for a return.  You could write a whole novel based on this one image.  Wonderful.', '2008-01-21 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
