(4409951, 634462, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh - Razzle dazzle - the Buzby Berkeley of the animal world.  Soon the camera will pan outwards to a chorus line of lovely peacock dancers in white feathers and this one will begin her solo song.  Look she has a tiara with her fancy costume. She''s the loveliest bird on stage. (Unfortunately for my daydream, she is a HE and the peacock song sounds like someone screaming Help Help.)</td>', 'ooh - Razzle dazzle - the Buzby Berkeley of the animal world.  Soon the camera will pan outwards to a chorus line of lovely peacock dancers in white feathers and this one will begin her solo song.  Look she has a tiara with her fancy costume. She''s the loveliest bird on stage. (Unfortunately for my daydream, she is a HE and the peacock song sounds like someone screaming Help Help.)', '2008-01-21 11:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
