(4410186, 634430, 27562, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2008-01-21 12:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410192, 634686, 82088, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has a lot of potential, but it looks overprocessed to me. The man in front has some black stuff on his face?  Im not sure what that is, but his suit and hat look fake as well.  I like the b&amp;w conversion a lot though, just a little less post processing.</td>', 'I think this photo has a lot of potential, but it looks overprocessed to me. The man in front has some black stuff on his face?  Im not sure what that is, but his suit and hat look fake as well.  I like the b&w conversion a lot though, just a little less post processing.', '2008-01-21 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410199, 635156, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh geez.  That is too wonderful for words.</td>', 'Oh geez.  That is too wonderful for words.', '2008-01-21 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410200, 635635, 82088, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo, with everyone looking out the window.  I think it just needs a bit more contrast or curves, and I also think it would have more impact if the photo were straightened.</td>', 'This is a cool photo, with everyone looking out the window.  I think it just needs a bit more contrast or curves, and I also think it would have more impact if the photo were straightened.', '2008-01-21 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410203, 634733, 82088, '<td valign="top">I love, love, love this photo.  Are her eyes really that color?  Either way, her face tells a story, with or without the blue eyes.  Great contrast here.</td>', 'I love, love, love this photo.  Are her eyes really that color?  Either way, her face tells a story, with or without the blue eyes.  Great contrast here.', '2008-01-21 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410210, 635794, 82088, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool photo.  I love that even through the fog, you were still able to capture the reflection of the building on the water.  The focus on the bird is perfect.  Really cool!</td>', 'This is such a cool photo.  I love that even through the fog, you were still able to capture the reflection of the building on the water.  The focus on the bird is perfect.  Really cool!', '2008-01-21 12:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410214, 633442, 15711, '<td valign="top">ooh dreamy!!!!!  Very nice.</td>', 'ooh dreamy!!!!!  Very nice.', '2008-01-21 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410217, 633779, 82088, '<td valign="top">I am such a sucker for sun rays in photos.  The colors here a beautiful, and the detail on the stones is really good.</td>', 'I am such a sucker for sun rays in photos.  The colors here a beautiful, and the detail on the stones is really good.', '2008-01-21 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410226, 633378, 15711, '<td valign="top">The profile makes me think of Ben Affleck. ;~)</td>', 'The profile makes me think of Ben Affleck. ;~)', '2008-01-21 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410231, 635529, 82088, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a bad photo, for me it doesn''t scream "best of".  Some contrast, and a little bit more color would help this photo a lot.  The detail of their fur is really nice though, and it makes me want to know what it is on the left that captured their attention.</td>', 'While this isn''t a bad photo, for me it doesn''t scream "best of".  Some contrast, and a little bit more color would help this photo a lot.  The detail of their fur is really nice though, and it makes me want to know what it is on the left that captured their attention.', '2008-01-21 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410237, 635667, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the blur on this. Beautiful vintage look</td>', 'I love the blur on this. Beautiful vintage look', '2008-01-21 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410238, 634703, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you are kicking butt with this, Neil. It shows beautifully. Nice frame choice, too, BTW.</td>', 'I''ll bet you are kicking butt with this, Neil. It shows beautifully. Nice frame choice, too, BTW.', '2008-01-21 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410241, 634638, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, I''m glad you went with a shot you like and that is interesting. This would look extremely cool blown up on a canvas.</td>', 'Jeffrey, I''m glad you went with a shot you like and that is interesting. This would look extremely cool blown up on a canvas.', '2008-01-21 12:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410242, 635783, 66597, '<td valign="top">Steve, this shows really well. I hope it is scoring well for you!</td>', 'Steve, this shows really well. I hope it is scoring well for you!', '2008-01-21 12:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410243, 634701, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb, this looks awesome! I''m sure your score has been climbing. As my husband said, "why can''t you take stuff like that instead of white peacock photos?" Imagine this as a large print. Wonderful work.</td>', 'Deb, this looks awesome! I''m sure your score has been climbing. As my husband said, "why can''t you take stuff like that instead of white peacock photos?" Imagine this as a large print. Wonderful work.', '2008-01-21 12:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410245, 635866, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love Watkins Glen!  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love Watkins Glen!  Nicely done.', '2008-01-21 12:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410246, 636054, 66597, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this, one of my few 10''s in this challenge. The lines, interaction and scene are wonderful. You should enter this in a travel photo contest.</td>', 'I absolutely love this, one of my few 10''s in this challenge. The lines, interaction and scene are wonderful. You should enter this in a travel photo contest.', '2008-01-21 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410247, 633315, 66597, '<td valign="top">Okay, my first 10. This is spectacular.</td>', 'Okay, my first 10. This is spectacular.', '2008-01-21 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410248, 636146, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the mood and expressions here. Wonderful composition, too. 10.</td>', 'I love the mood and expressions here. Wonderful composition, too. 10.', '2008-01-21 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410249, 636023, 70000, '<td valign="top">beautiful closeup and wonderful texture in her skin!</td>', 'beautiful closeup and wonderful texture in her skin!', '2008-01-21 12:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410252, 633717, 66597, '<td valign="top">MAK, I''m pretty sure this is yours (if I remember correctly you had a similar photo earlier). Anyway, doesn''t matter, it''s absolutely beautiful. One of my few 10''s of the challenge.</td>', 'MAK, I''m pretty sure this is yours (if I remember correctly you had a similar photo earlier). Anyway, doesn''t matter, it''s absolutely beautiful. One of my few 10''s of the challenge.', '2008-01-21 12:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410254, 636046, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Where is this? I think I might recognize the location, great bridal shot</td>', 'This is beautiful! Where is this? I think I might recognize the location, great bridal shot', '2008-01-21 12:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410256, 635696, 29477, '<td valign="top">Cute Image...Decent lighting...I may have tried to change the angle to get some facial expression on the the one getting adjusted.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Cute Image...Decent lighting...I may have tried to change the angle to get some facial expression on the the one getting adjusted.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-21 12:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410262, 634672, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great Image, Well processed.  At the bottom in the center, looks like your shadow...I may have tried to clean that up a bit.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Great Image, Well processed.  At the bottom in the center, looks like your shadow...I may have tried to clean that up a bit.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-21 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410264, 633533, 29477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective.  Image is a little flat on focus and grainy for my liking.  Would have liked to see this sharp and crisp with some punch on the red/yellow on the snow.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Beautiful perspective.  Image is a little flat on focus and grainy for my liking.  Would have liked to see this sharp and crisp with some punch on the red/yellow on the snow.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-21 12:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410269, 636187, 29477, '<td valign="top">Although there is a lot going on here, I do like the way you processed this image and the depth of the detail in the trees.  Will definately get a wide range of votes.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Although there is a lot going on here, I do like the way you processed this image and the depth of the detail in the trees.  Will definately get a wide range of votes.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-21 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410281, 633984, 29477, '<td valign="top">Simple image that needs to be a lot sharper for my liking.  I would have adjusted the curves in photoshop and try to add a little more contrast/depth and focus. Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'Simple image that needs to be a lot sharper for my liking.  I would have adjusted the curves in photoshop and try to add a little more contrast/depth and focus. Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-21 12:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410283, 634433, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...Since there is nothing happening in the water, I may have tried to lower the horizon a little and focus on the colours in the sky.  Still an image I would be proud of. Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Nice capture...Since there is nothing happening in the water, I may have tried to lower the horizon a little and focus on the colours in the sky.  Still an image I would be proud of. Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-21 12:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410286, 635508, 15407, '<td valign="top">Quite nice ~ a shame though with the need for the tight crop on the trees going out of the frame at the top of the picture.</td>', 'Quite nice ~ a shame though with the need for the tight crop on the trees going out of the frame at the top of the picture.', '2008-01-21 12:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410291, 632900, 75585, '<td valign="top">NO WAY!!  Okay - this is a great capture but also disgusting all at the same time... way to evoke a response from someone viewing your shot - you surely grabbed my attention!</td>', 'NO WAY!!  Okay - this is a great capture but also disgusting all at the same time... way to evoke a response from someone viewing your shot - you surely grabbed my attention!', '2008-01-21 12:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410295, 634184, 29477, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Very simple and well executed.  The B&amp;W emphasizes the silhouettes.  I am also not a big fan of borders, however yours is realy good here.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Well done.  Very simple and well executed.  The B&W emphasizes the silhouettes.  I am also not a big fan of borders, however yours is realy good here.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-21 12:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410304, 633837, 29477, '<td valign="top">Excellent image here.  Great sharpness and result.  However, I really much prefer these images in colour with the contrast between the sand and the sky.  Still an image I would love to have in my collection. Good Luck. 8.</td>', 'Excellent image here.  Great sharpness and result.  However, I really much prefer these images in colour with the contrast between the sand and the sky.  Still an image I would love to have in my collection. Good Luck. 8.', '2008-01-21 12:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410310, 634871, 29477, '<td valign="top">Really like the processing, cropping, title and result.  This is an image that would also have looked great in B&amp;W.  Good Luck. 8.</td>', 'Really like the processing, cropping, title and result.  This is an image that would also have looked great in B&W.  Good Luck. 8.', '2008-01-21 12:46:40.000000', NULL, 1);
