(4410426, 635488, 2764, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether this is the big bang exploding outwards or I am being sucked in towards that dock super fast.  Either way the powerful leading lines create a strong sense of motion.  I can FEEL the storm front moving to the right as the waves move to the left.</td>', 'I can''t decide whether this is the big bang exploding outwards or I am being sucked in towards that dock super fast.  Either way the powerful leading lines create a strong sense of motion.  I can FEEL the storm front moving to the right as the waves move to the left.', '2008-01-21 13:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
