(4410538, 636187, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ah - I bet this image suffered from getting squashed into a 640 pix format.  I can imagine it huge on the wall of a bank.   The dark and light play here is wonderful, especially where the small bright dots of leaves meet the more linear stripes of shadow on the ground.  The darker sweeping lines of the branches look lovely in the impressionistic scatter of light.  There is one spot in the distance where my eyes tell me to enter and feel the shade, a space on the right where the heat of the day contrasts.</td>', 'Ah - I bet this image suffered from getting squashed into a 640 pix format.  I can imagine it huge on the wall of a bank.   The dark and light play here is wonderful, especially where the small bright dots of leaves meet the more linear stripes of shadow on the ground.  The darker sweeping lines of the branches look lovely in the impressionistic scatter of light.  There is one spot in the distance where my eyes tell me to enter and feel the shade, a space on the right where the heat of the day contrasts.', '2008-01-21 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410539, 636135, 15407, '<td valign="top">Desat/sepia helps this photo...</td>', 'Desat/sepia helps this photo...', '2008-01-21 13:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
