(4410555, 634501, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh that belt is just perfect!  It divides the picture in half, separating naked from clothed, public from private, the individual from the culture.  See how the checkerboard of the belt mimics the checkerboard of life.  The half that belongs to hher alone and the half that belongs to her world.  I like!</td>', 'Oh that belt is just perfect!  It divides the picture in half, separating naked from clothed, public from private, the individual from the culture.  See how the checkerboard of the belt mimics the checkerboard of life.  The half that belongs to hher alone and the half that belongs to her world.  I like!', '2008-01-21 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
