(4410579, 635857, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this a lot, but the image fails to fully deliver for me.  The colors seem a bit washed out, and though the lights seem to indicate that it is evening, the overall lighting almost looks like daylight.  I''d really like to see more of an ambient-light look, and more contrast in the image.</td>', 'I really like the concept of this a lot, but the image fails to fully deliver for me.  The colors seem a bit washed out, and though the lights seem to indicate that it is evening, the overall lighting almost looks like daylight.  I''d really like to see more of an ambient-light look, and more contrast in the image.', '2008-01-21 13:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410581, 635697, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow. Astounding colors without looking oversaturated. I like how you create a natural frame for the picture. If you could get up a little high it would be nice but that''s being nitpicky.</td>', 'Wow. Astounding colors without looking oversaturated. I like how you create a natural frame for the picture. If you could get up a little high it would be nice but that''s being nitpicky.', '2008-01-21 13:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
