(4410609, 635171, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really great subject to shoot and well handled. I would have considered cloning out the light post in the background. The sepia works well here. A little underexposed however going any brighter would overexpose the snow. Not sure how to handle this situation in post but it would be nice to add a bit more light to everything but the snow. (A levels adjustment layer maybe and erase out the mountain?)</td>', 'Really great subject to shoot and well handled. I would have considered cloning out the light post in the background. The sepia works well here. A little underexposed however going any brighter would overexpose the snow. Not sure how to handle this situation in post but it would be nice to add a bit more light to everything but the snow. (A levels adjustment layer maybe and erase out the mountain?)', '2008-01-21 13:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
