(4410633, 634709, 2764, '<td valign="top">Happy?  Well then, this is certainly a social statement.  He''s wearing a coat made out of some kind of sack.  The way the light on his face is repeated in the house in the background is a wonderful link between the two. All the buildings lean in towards that welcoming light.  Even the clouds (and their matching cobblestones) are pointing the way.  That must be where he lives, maybe he''s happy to be going home for supper?  One could construct all sorts of stories about this guy from the visual clues you give us.  Does he grow coffee?  is that a coffee tree branch in the left corner?  There is a logo on his hat, is that a clue?  Maybe that isn''t a bean sack but a fishing net he wears.  Wonderful face!  He''s just asking me to come home with him and listen to his story.</td>', 'Happy?  Well then, this is certainly a social statement.  He''s wearing a coat made out of some kind of sack.  The way the light on his face is repeated in the house in the background is a wonderful link between the two. All the buildings lean in towards that welcoming light.  Even the clouds (and their matching cobblestones) are pointing the way.  That must be where he lives, maybe he''s happy to be going home for supper?  One could construct all sorts of stories about this guy from the visual clues you give us.  Does he grow coffee?  is that a coffee tree branch in the left corner?  There is a logo on his hat, is that a clue?  Maybe that isn''t a bean sack but a fishing net he wears.  Wonderful face!  He''s just asking me to come home with him and listen to his story.', '2008-01-21 13:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410634, 635622, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2008-01-21 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410637, 634710, 29477, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful image, however, way too grainy and focus is weak. I am sure that the lighting was extremely low and you had to use a 1600 ISO, which I have done in similar instances at the Gorilla exhibit at the Toronto Zoo. Your scores will be hurt by that.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful image, however, way too grainy and focus is weak. I am sure that the lighting was extremely low and you had to use a 1600 ISO, which I have done in similar instances at the Gorilla exhibit at the Toronto Zoo. Your scores will be hurt by that.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-21 13:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
