(4410897, 634670, 22538, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections...</td>', 'Nice reflections...', '2008-01-21 15:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410901, 635636, 22538, '<td valign="top">Lovely moment. Do you have shots with wider crop, to let the surroundings speak too?</td>', 'Lovely moment. Do you have shots with wider crop, to let the surroundings speak too?', '2008-01-21 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410909, 635954, 35602, '<td valign="top">Well, I like the idea.  However, the detail is really soft and very noisy.  I am sure you probably were seeing some nice ripples of light when you took the image, but it is totally lost in the exposure you chose to use.  I do like the desat and the black and white treatment.  To get better clarity you might need a closer vantage point.  If this was an extreme crop, that may be where you lost a lot of detail and clarity.</td>', 'Well, I like the idea.  However, the detail is really soft and very noisy.  I am sure you probably were seeing some nice ripples of light when you took the image, but it is totally lost in the exposure you chose to use.  I do like the desat and the black and white treatment.  To get better clarity you might need a closer vantage point.  If this was an extreme crop, that may be where you lost a lot of detail and clarity.', '2008-01-21 15:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410926, 633443, 22538, '<td valign="top">Lizard head from the other side?? Lovely spot, shadows and highlights</td>', 'Lizard head from the other side?? Lovely spot, shadows and highlights', '2008-01-21 15:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410950, 634959, 41794, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo - the colors are just right - not too bright and not too dark.</td>', 'Lovely photo - the colors are just right - not too bright and not too dark.', '2008-01-21 15:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410953, 633415, 62787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love those thoughtful eyes, and there''s a lovely softness about the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love those thoughtful eyes, and there''s a lovely softness about the picture.', '2008-01-21 15:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410954, 635664, 62787, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the lighting could be better.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the lighting could be better.', '2008-01-21 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410959, 636014, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, and cool sky. However, I can see signs of oversharpening, and the cactus sort of blends into the hills and makes the scene look quite busy and crowded.</td>', 'Nice landscape, and cool sky. However, I can see signs of oversharpening, and the cactus sort of blends into the hills and makes the scene look quite busy and crowded.', '2008-01-21 15:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410961, 632923, 62787, '<td valign="top">Ah, the great horse heaven in the sky :)<br/>Very interesting image, and I love the post-processing on this one. There''s something almost mystical about it.</td>', 'Ah, the great horse heaven in the sky :)Very interesting image, and I love the post-processing on this one. There''s something almost mystical about it.', '2008-01-21 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410965, 635267, 56658, '<td valign="top">very nice eye. I love it.</td>', 'very nice eye. I love it.', '2008-01-21 15:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410967, 635984, 62787, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait. I love the composition (exciting, but not too busy), and the subject is most interesting :) Great work.</td>', 'Fantastic portrait. I love the composition (exciting, but not too busy), and the subject is most interesting :) Great work.', '2008-01-21 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410970, 633077, 22538, '<td valign="top">mesmerizing</td>', 'mesmerizing', '2008-01-21 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410972, 635931, 62787, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes. And the fluffy fur gives a nice contrast to the smoothness of the skin. Bits of the picture seem oversharpened though.</td>', 'Lovely eyes. And the fluffy fur gives a nice contrast to the smoothness of the skin. Bits of the picture seem oversharpened though.', '2008-01-21 15:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410978, 634264, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, great expression, and amazing eyes.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, great expression, and amazing eyes.', '2008-01-21 15:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410979, 635731, 62787, '<td valign="top">The colours seem almost too warm to really be desolate :) I love that fence-line disappearing off into the distance. Interesting image.</td>', 'The colours seem almost too warm to really be desolate :) I love that fence-line disappearing off into the distance. Interesting image.', '2008-01-21 15:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410981, 635555, 62787, '<td valign="top">Sweet :) There''s something so lovely and genuine about this picture, really beautiful work.</td>', 'Sweet :) There''s something so lovely and genuine about this picture, really beautiful work.', '2008-01-21 15:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410984, 634899, 62787, '<td valign="top">Aww, cute :) I like that gentle, protective expression the horse seems to have.</td>', 'Aww, cute :) I like that gentle, protective expression the horse seems to have.', '2008-01-21 15:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410985, 636146, 68980, '<td valign="top">ah! This is stunning. What a great moment you captured.. I completely love it! Good luck!</td>', 'ah! This is stunning. What a great moment you captured.. I completely love it! Good luck!', '2008-01-21 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410990, 634279, 62787, '<td valign="top">Ah, my favourite galaxy :) <br/> <br/>Beautiful image. I wonder if a bit more post-processing could have made it pop even more though?</td>', 'Ah, my favourite galaxy :)  Beautiful image. I wonder if a bit more post-processing could have made it pop even more though?', '2008-01-21 15:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410995, 635783, 62787, '<td valign="top">Striking picture, with a very interesting composition. Bits of it strike me as overprocessed though - the clouds lack detail (maybe too much neat image? blur?), and bits of the picture are oversharpened. Still a great shot though.</td>', 'Striking picture, with a very interesting composition. Bits of it strike me as overprocessed though - the clouds lack detail (maybe too much neat image? blur?), and bits of the picture are oversharpened. Still a great shot though.', '2008-01-21 15:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4410997, 635178, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, and lovely vivid colours. Looks quite busy overall though.</td>', 'Nice textures, and lovely vivid colours. Looks quite busy overall though.', '2008-01-21 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411003, 635721, 62787, '<td valign="top">Interesting... My first reaction was "Shame about the burnt highlights", but actually, that combined with the post-processing turns it into a rather intriguing impressionistic work of art. Not sure I''m too keen on the composition, but overall it certainly stands out.</td>', 'Interesting... My first reaction was "Shame about the burnt highlights", but actually, that combined with the post-processing turns it into a rather intriguing impressionistic work of art. Not sure I''m too keen on the composition, but overall it certainly stands out.', '2008-01-21 15:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411011, 634432, 62787, '<td valign="top">Wow. Just magic.</td>', 'Wow. Just magic.', '2008-01-21 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411012, 633314, 62787, '<td valign="top">I love that golden light! And the sky is very dramatic. The highlights look a bit blown though.</td>', 'I love that golden light! And the sky is very dramatic. The highlights look a bit blown though.', '2008-01-21 15:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411014, 635958, 62787, '<td valign="top">Dyed hair? Surely not. I do love those eyes though.</td>', 'Dyed hair? Surely not. I do love those eyes though.', '2008-01-21 15:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411015, 635833, 56658, '<td valign="top">Quite striking. can''t help bu wanting more sky but nice shot as is though.</td>', 'Quite striking. can''t help bu wanting more sky but nice shot as is though.', '2008-01-21 15:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411018, 636155, 62787, '<td valign="top">lol I feel that way so often... Great image. I can almost hear it sizzle out.</td>', 'lol I feel that way so often... Great image. I can almost hear it sizzle out.', '2008-01-21 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
