(4411142, 633871, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the building without the tree in front of it. That''s not to say you couldn''t use the branch to help frame the shot but to me this feels like a picture of a tree with a building in front of it. (As opposed to a picture of building in the fog with a tree in front of it).</td>', 'I''d like to see the building without the tree in front of it. That''s not to say you couldn''t use the branch to help frame the shot but to me this feels like a picture of a tree with a building in front of it. (As opposed to a picture of building in the fog with a tree in front of it).', '2008-01-21 16:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
