(4411958, 635840, 29477, '<td valign="top">Not a lot happening in this image.  My preference when taking these shots is to try and ensure that the horizon does not cross in the middle of the image and try to make it a little more dynamic with the focus being on the water or sky, depending on what I am going for or that provides the best "draw" the the viewers eye.  I do like the colours in the sky and may have tried to capture 2/3 to 3/4 sky and played with the processing. Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Not a lot happening in this image.  My preference when taking these shots is to try and ensure that the horizon does not cross in the middle of the image and try to make it a little more dynamic with the focus being on the water or sky, depending on what I am going for or that provides the best "draw" the the viewers eye.  I do like the colours in the sky and may have tried to capture 2/3 to 3/4 sky and played with the processing. Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-21 20:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
