(4411973, 634600, 29477, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W does not work for me.  Also the blurring effect (I am assuming) is distracting my focus away from the subject. Colour may have provided a better contrast and depth.  Also, the processing has bleached out the area around his mouth (a problem I always have when I take lion shots).  Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'The B&W does not work for me.  Also the blurring effect (I am assuming) is distracting my focus away from the subject. Colour may have provided a better contrast and depth.  Also, the processing has bleached out the area around his mouth (a problem I always have when I take lion shots).  Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-21 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
