(4412005, 636177, 29477, '<td valign="top">My beloved Packers...Tough loss...WHY! WHY! WHY! did they lose...I''ll tell you...Al Harris, that''s who.  Just like the Dallas game in the regular season, they exploited him and Mike didn''t give him the support he needed.  Al, a veteran, always seems to play below par in big games...wait...where am I???  <br/> <br/>Great capture, focus is off and cropping could be a lot tighter.  If you can get me to a game next season, I will rate this image a 10, however until then I have to rate it a 4. Sorry.<br/> <br/>Favre will return for 1 more season (I hope)!!!</td>', 'My beloved Packers...Tough loss...WHY! WHY! WHY! did they lose...I''ll tell you...Al Harris, that''s who.  Just like the Dallas game in the regular season, they exploited him and Mike didn''t give him the support he needed.  Al, a veteran, always seems to play below par in big games...wait...where am I???   Great capture, focus is off and cropping could be a lot tighter.  If you can get me to a game next season, I will rate this image a 10, however until then I have to rate it a 4. Sorry. Favre will return for 1 more season (I hope)!!!', '2008-01-21 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
