(4412596, 634119, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and sharpness of the bug''s head.  I would prefer a little more DOF though so the bug is entirely in focus.</td>', 'I like the colours and sharpness of the bug''s head.  I would prefer a little more DOF though so the bug is entirely in focus.', '2008-01-22 00:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
