(4412715, 636031, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective and good use of wide angle.  The large negative spaces of the outfield and sky contrast well with the busy infield and crowd.<br/> <br/>One issue I have with the image is that it gives everything away.  I''m not left wondering or piecing together aspects of what "could have been there".  Much like comparing reading a book to watching a movie, there''s little left to the imagination.  It''s still a good image from a technical aspect.</td>', 'Very cool perspective and good use of wide angle.  The large negative spaces of the outfield and sky contrast well with the busy infield and crowd. One issue I have with the image is that it gives everything away.  I''m not left wondering or piecing together aspects of what "could have been there".  Much like comparing reading a book to watching a movie, there''s little left to the imagination.  It''s still a good image from a technical aspect.', '2008-01-22 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
