(4412848, 636177, 66616, '<td valign="top">boring IMO, updated.<br/>Im sorry about that comment, but I did find the image boring (is that a non comment?)and I did qualify it with thats only my opinion. It Was a little blurry and the action was right in the middle of the picture, I think it would look better if it was off centre. The persons legs in the top right hand corner also spoils the photo. But these are only my opinions. I didnt vote on this image as I dont vote in any challenges in which I take part.<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 22:25:33.</i></td>', 'boring IMO, updated.Im sorry about that comment, but I did find the image boring (is that a non comment?)and I did qualify it with thats only my opinion. It Was a little blurry and the action was right in the middle of the picture, I think it would look better if it was off centre. The persons legs in the top right hand corner also spoils the photo. But these are only my opinions. I didnt vote on this image as I dont vote in any challenges in which I take part. ', '2008-01-22 05:02:00.000000', '2008-01-28 22:25:33.000000', 1),
