(4412854, 634501, 25890, '<td valign="top">A familiar style; I think I can correctly guess who the photographer might be. While the photograph is technically competent enough, I fail to see what exactly its point is. Well, not that I think that every photograph has to have a point. Moreover, not knowing anything about the context in which the work was produced, I know I should not be too concerned about that anyway. Even then, I can''t help but remain indifferent to it and see it as nothing more than a studio lighting exercise.</td>', 'A familiar style; I think I can correctly guess who the photographer might be. While the photograph is technically competent enough, I fail to see what exactly its point is. Well, not that I think that every photograph has to have a point. Moreover, not knowing anything about the context in which the work was produced, I know I should not be too concerned about that anyway. Even then, I can''t help but remain indifferent to it and see it as nothing more than a studio lighting exercise.', '2008-01-22 05:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
