(4413115, 634148, 77192, '<td valign="top">A very wise old lady. I think it''s a bit oversharpened for me though</td>', 'A very wise old lady. I think it''s a bit oversharpened for me though', '2008-01-22 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413116, 633098, 77192, '<td valign="top">interesting orientation. Balck and white really brings out this shot.</td>', 'interesting orientation. Balck and white really brings out this shot.', '2008-01-22 08:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413117, 635813, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice capture, love the expression on her face</td>', 'nice capture, love the expression on her face', '2008-01-22 08:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413168, 634920, 21816, '<td valign="top">I saw this in your portfolio earlier and thought what a fantastic gift for your husband! I''m sure he would of loved it! The lighting and skin tone are fantastic. Well done &amp; best of luck!</td>', 'I saw this in your portfolio earlier and thought what a fantastic gift for your husband! I''m sure he would of loved it! The lighting and skin tone are fantastic. Well done & best of luck!', '2008-01-22 08:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413187, 634206, 55956, '<td valign="top">another fantastic landscape from iceland I suppose :)</td>', 'another fantastic landscape from iceland I suppose :)', '2008-01-22 09:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413196, 634148, 55956, '<td valign="top">fantastic portrait</td>', 'fantastic portrait', '2008-01-22 09:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413212, 633717, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s terrific. Must be the same pair <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20608" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MAK</a> won a ribbon with.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'That''s terrific. Must be the same pair  MAK won a ribbon with.  Nice perspective.', '2008-01-22 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413214, 634298, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice honest portrait. the red really enhances her light skin and beautiful dark hair and eyes.</td>', 'Nice honest portrait. the red really enhances her light skin and beautiful dark hair and eyes.', '2008-01-22 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413215, 633224, 51538, '<td valign="top">Grand scenery.  The processing feels jagged to me - as in sharpening jagged.  Possibly HDR work?  I reckon HDR is going to look passe quickly. 6.</td>', 'Grand scenery.  The processing feels jagged to me - as in sharpening jagged.  Possibly HDR work?  I reckon HDR is going to look passe quickly. 6.', '2008-01-22 09:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413217, 632955, 15711, '<td valign="top">Crop is a touch tight. I love his red legs and beak.</td>', 'Crop is a touch tight. I love his red legs and beak.', '2008-01-22 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413219, 635151, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely part of the planet earth.  Looks nice and windy. 7</td>', 'Lovely part of the planet earth.  Looks nice and windy. 7', '2008-01-22 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413221, 633698, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sheen and composition.</td>', 'Lovely sheen and composition.', '2008-01-22 09:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413224, 634882, 51538, '<td valign="top">She is rather consumed by the dark tone of the road.  Nice part of the country and vanishing point.</td>', 'She is rather consumed by the dark tone of the road.  Nice part of the country and vanishing point.', '2008-01-22 09:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413230, 634733, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think the texture of age and the eye contact was more than enough to attract.  The almost over-lookable desaturation to show off the eye colour did not work for me.  But I will grade your photo not on that processing which failed for me but the overall pose and model which seem good. 7.</td>', 'I think the texture of age and the eye contact was more than enough to attract.  The almost over-lookable desaturation to show off the eye colour did not work for me.  But I will grade your photo not on that processing which failed for me but the overall pose and model which seem good. 7.', '2008-01-22 09:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413232, 635512, 51538, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating photo and event.  Just wish the lighting was better and the focus.  But in such die or shoot occasions, it''s hard to get perfection....</td>', 'What a fascinating photo and event.  Just wish the lighting was better and the focus.  But in such die or shoot occasions, it''s hard to get perfection....', '2008-01-22 09:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413237, 636146, 75386, '<td valign="top">Badda Bing! Great photo!</td>', 'Badda Bing! Great photo!', '2008-01-22 09:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413240, 634033, 75386, '<td valign="top">GReat concept and excecution</td>', 'GReat concept and excecution', '2008-01-22 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413241, 633315, 51538, '<td valign="top">Dramatis personæ under the influence of camera obscura.  Dramatic it is.</td>', 'Dramatis personæ under the influence of camera obscura.  Dramatic it is.', '2008-01-22 09:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413242, 635229, 51538, '<td valign="top">Fine colours and nice focus.</td>', 'Fine colours and nice focus.', '2008-01-22 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413286, 635622, 16392, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one thing that I disliked however was the toning, would''ve loved to see it in b/w or colour.</td>', 'Very nice, one thing that I disliked however was the toning, would''ve loved to see it in b/w or colour.', '2008-01-22 09:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413288, 636230, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is really a road story.  Inviting, pack the bag and go, inspiration.  Thanks.  The colours are acrylic like.</td>', 'That is really a road story.  Inviting, pack the bag and go, inspiration.  Thanks.  The colours are acrylic like.', '2008-01-22 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413290, 633157, 51538, '<td valign="top">Soothing (after so many HDR images in this challenge).  Thanks for the visual aspirin. 7.</td>', 'Soothing (after so many HDR images in this challenge).  Thanks for the visual aspirin. 7.', '2008-01-22 09:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413294, 636005, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the processing.  The final effect is very pleasant. 7</td>', 'I like the processing.  The final effect is very pleasant. 7', '2008-01-22 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413298, 635663, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like your photo very much.  The topography is perfect.  I might have turned down the saturation a little bit. 8</td>', 'I like your photo very much.  The topography is perfect.  I might have turned down the saturation a little bit. 8', '2008-01-22 09:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413299, 635508, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely textural enhancement with IR. 7</td>', 'Lovely textural enhancement with IR. 7', '2008-01-22 09:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413302, 635306, 51538, '<td valign="top">Dubious patriotism perhaps.  It is an interesting photojournalists moment. 7</td>', 'Dubious patriotism perhaps.  It is an interesting photojournalists moment. 7', '2008-01-22 09:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413303, 633443, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well I didn''t enter my previously posted images because I thought they might be recognized... but that does not prevent me appreciating yours! 7.</td>', 'Well I didn''t enter my previously posted images because I thought they might be recognized... but that does not prevent me appreciating yours! 7.', '2008-01-22 09:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413305, 633273, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perfectly commercial image and well done too. 7</td>', 'Perfectly commercial image and well done too. 7', '2008-01-22 09:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413307, 633703, 51538, '<td valign="top">Faery water.  It''s a nice unreal effect. 6</td>', 'Faery water.  It''s a nice unreal effect. 6', '2008-01-22 09:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413310, 634973, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the gentle exposure on your photo.  It is a pleasant viewing experience. 7</td>', 'I like the gentle exposure on your photo.  It is a pleasant viewing experience. 7', '2008-01-22 09:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413311, 633001, 3102, '<td valign="top">Way overboard on the HDR.  Sorry... that''s a big pet peeve of mine nowadays.  That takes a shot that would have probably been a 6 or 7 down to a 3 for me.</td>', 'Way overboard on the HDR.  Sorry... that''s a big pet peeve of mine nowadays.  That takes a shot that would have probably been a 6 or 7 down to a 3 for me.', '2008-01-22 09:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413314, 635699, 3102, '<td valign="top">The border really detracts from this one.</td>', 'The border really detracts from this one.', '2008-01-22 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413317, 634298, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the word.  The focus feels a tiny bit off.  The light patches in the background could go too.  I think the reflector gives strange catchlights and brings the neck into too much prominence.  A nice model.</td>', 'Nice use of the word.  The focus feels a tiny bit off.  The light patches in the background could go too.  I think the reflector gives strange catchlights and brings the neck into too much prominence.  A nice model.', '2008-01-22 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413322, 633167, 16392, '<td valign="top">Very tranquil... like it.</td>', 'Very tranquil... like it.', '2008-01-22 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413328, 634121, 51538, '<td valign="top">A sight that should bring armistice and peace.  Yet it is at such a young age, especially in boys, that thoughts of war are born.  There is no glory in war. 8.</td>', 'A sight that should bring armistice and peace.  Yet it is at such a young age, especially in boys, that thoughts of war are born.  There is no glory in war. 8.', '2008-01-22 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413333, 635178, 16392, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but the composition feels somewhat awkward. A 6.</td>', 'Nice colours, but the composition feels somewhat awkward. A 6.', '2008-01-22 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413336, 635420, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely misty view. 8</td>', 'Lovely misty view. 8', '2008-01-22 10:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413337, 636228, 16392, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, only thing I dislike is the wall to the left, crop it out and it''d be a 10.</td>', 'Brilliant, only thing I dislike is the wall to the left, crop it out and it''d be a 10.', '2008-01-22 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413343, 634232, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding.</td>', 'This is outstanding.', '2008-01-22 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413349, 634232, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  Lots to see therein and stories to dream. 10.</td>', 'Very lovely.  Lots to see therein and stories to dream. 10.', '2008-01-22 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413360, 635274, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean image and colours.  Certainly commercial in aspect.  If only there was a little profile on the horse''s head.</td>', 'Lovely clean image and colours.  Certainly commercial in aspect.  If only there was a little profile on the horse''s head.', '2008-01-22 10:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413365, 635993, 16392, '<td valign="top">It''s far too pixelly, and I don''t get the border, but nice contrast..</td>', 'It''s far too pixelly, and I don''t get the border, but nice contrast..', '2008-01-22 10:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413368, 635988, 51538, '<td valign="top">Exotic and attractive image.  Seems antique. 9</td>', 'Exotic and attractive image.  Seems antique. 9', '2008-01-22 10:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413372, 635420, 16392, '<td valign="top">Holy crap, wow! It''s a shame about the image quality though :\</td>', 'Holy crap, wow! It''s a shame about the image quality though :\', '2008-01-22 10:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413375, 635309, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo and subject. The colors and composition are very good. Overall the image suffers from lack of size. For this challenge, we were able to size a photo up to 720 pixels per side. This is one of those cases where bigger is really better.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo and subject. The colors and composition are very good. Overall the image suffers from lack of size. For this challenge, we were able to size a photo up to 720 pixels per side. This is one of those cases where bigger is really better.', '2008-01-22 10:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413380, 634186, 43410, '<td valign="top">this looks just like a place in magnolia arkansas that i shoot frequently, beautiful shot</td>', 'this looks just like a place in magnolia arkansas that i shoot frequently, beautiful shot', '2008-01-22 10:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413381, 636040, 16392, '<td valign="top">Scenery''s beautiful, but the halo''s really distracting.</td>', 'Scenery''s beautiful, but the halo''s really distracting.', '2008-01-22 10:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413382, 632900, 16392, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHahhaaha, awesome..</td>', 'HAHAHAHahhaaha, awesome..', '2008-01-22 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413383, 634375, 16392, '<td valign="top">It looks as if she''s lying down, nice.</td>', 'It looks as if she''s lying down, nice.', '2008-01-22 10:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413384, 634929, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - what an amazing photo. Great title, too.</td>', 'Wow - what an amazing photo. Great title, too.', '2008-01-22 10:26:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4413387, 635229, 43410, '<td valign="top">SandyP?  Great shot!  The editing style really stands out as Sandy''s, but if it''s not her, huge compliments to you!  Beautiful shot :)  good luck</td>', 'SandyP?  Great shot!  The editing style really stands out as Sandy''s, but if it''s not her, huge compliments to you!  Beautiful shot :)  good luck', '2008-01-22 10:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413391, 633533, 44877, '<td valign="top">So beautiful. It must have been thrilling to see that yourself. Thanks for not putting a frame on this outstanding image.</td>', 'So beautiful. It must have been thrilling to see that yourself. Thanks for not putting a frame on this outstanding image.', '2008-01-22 10:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413394, 634367, 44877, '<td valign="top">I like the name on the helmet - I mean, in case he needs to be identified - hahaha!! Great image  - vibrant colors.</td>', 'I like the name on the helmet - I mean, in case he needs to be identified - hahaha!! Great image  - vibrant colors.', '2008-01-22 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413404, 633194, 66348, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot, from the stars to the colors from white, to green, to redish orange it all works. I guess my only beef would be those pesky power lines from the left to right. Other than that, its flawless. Nice work.</td>', 'Incredible shot, from the stars to the colors from white, to green, to redish orange it all works. I guess my only beef would be those pesky power lines from the left to right. Other than that, its flawless. Nice work.', '2008-01-22 10:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413421, 634491, 51538, '<td valign="top">You did very well there.  Nice viewpoint. 8</td>', 'You did very well there.  Nice viewpoint. 8', '2008-01-22 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413422, 635505, 70103, '<td valign="top">hmm.... can''t make anything out of it. What is it???</td>', 'hmm.... can''t make anything out of it. What is it???', '2008-01-22 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413451, 634206, 36606, '<td valign="top">this is my pick for ribbon. Stnning so clear, surreal and amazing. 10</td>', 'this is my pick for ribbon. Stnning so clear, surreal and amazing. 10', '2008-01-22 11:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413486, 636073, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is such a gorgeous photo - just look at those eyes! Was this taken with a wide angle? I really like it.</td>', 'This is such a gorgeous photo - just look at those eyes! Was this taken with a wide angle? I really like it.', '2008-01-22 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413487, 636014, 31133, '<td valign="top">Sooo pretty. I wish the halos weren''t around the top of the rocks and cactus (probably from sharpening), but everything else about this is great. It is a beautiful scene.</td>', 'Sooo pretty. I wish the halos weren''t around the top of the rocks and cactus (probably from sharpening), but everything else about this is great. It is a beautiful scene.', '2008-01-22 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413489, 636086, 31133, '<td valign="top">Really nice portrait, very good composition. I don''t know, but maybe a little sharpening in the eyes would be a good thing, at least for web. But it''s one of the nicest kid portraits I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Really nice portrait, very good composition. I don''t know, but maybe a little sharpening in the eyes would be a good thing, at least for web. But it''s one of the nicest kid portraits I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2008-01-22 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413493, 635874, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the colors a lot. For me, this kind of HDR or whatever it is that brings out such surreal detail isn''t my favorite though. I''d like to see the same picture with the processing toned down a bit, even though it is interesting as it is. Looks like a beautiful spot.</td>', 'I like the colors a lot. For me, this kind of HDR or whatever it is that brings out such surreal detail isn''t my favorite though. I''d like to see the same picture with the processing toned down a bit, even though it is interesting as it is. Looks like a beautiful spot.', '2008-01-22 11:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413495, 634973, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the kind of thing I''d love to see when we visit Utah this summer!  Hopefully someone will be able to give me some directions to help find incredible features like this!</td>', 'This is exactly the kind of thing I''d love to see when we visit Utah this summer!  Hopefully someone will be able to give me some directions to help find incredible features like this!', '2008-01-22 11:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413497, 635923, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! What an expression you''ve managed to capture.</td>', 'Fantastic! What an expression you''ve managed to capture.', '2008-01-22 11:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413499, 636200, 31133, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool old place. A little dark on my monitor and a bit out of focus on the City Garage sign, but maybe you intended the darkness. I like how everything here is old. There''s nothing out of place. The truck tops it all off nicely.</td>', 'Looks like a cool old place. A little dark on my monitor and a bit out of focus on the City Garage sign, but maybe you intended the darkness. I like how everything here is old. There''s nothing out of place. The truck tops it all off nicely.', '2008-01-22 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413500, 634959, 31133, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! The black background is perfect. Bet you do well with this. If not, I will think the voters are all crazy (except me of course :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous! The black background is perfect. Bet you do well with this. If not, I will think the voters are all crazy (except me of course :-)', '2008-01-22 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413503, 634670, 31133, '<td valign="top">Although the colors and the reflections are nothing short of spectacular, I would like to see it sharper, but maybe you intended to have a dreamy feeling.</td>', 'Although the colors and the reflections are nothing short of spectacular, I would like to see it sharper, but maybe you intended to have a dreamy feeling.', '2008-01-22 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413504, 636053, 16392, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the fake out-of-focus background is really distracting, considering there are small, blurry artifacts around the birds, especially around their heads, would eb nicer if you just left the background as it originally was.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the fake out-of-focus background is really distracting, considering there are small, blurry artifacts around the birds, especially around their heads, would eb nicer if you just left the background as it originally was.', '2008-01-22 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413506, 634899, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, so sweet. Really great that you got the horse posed this way so everyone''s touching. Wonder how this would be with either an increase in saturation or complete b&amp;w. Wonderful expression on the child!</td>', 'Ah, so sweet. Really great that you got the horse posed this way so everyone''s touching. Wonder how this would be with either an increase in saturation or complete b&w. Wonderful expression on the child!', '2008-01-22 11:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413509, 634278, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s so great to see something a little abstract! Great colors and "runny" effect.</td>', 'It''s so great to see something a little abstract! Great colors and "runny" effect.', '2008-01-22 11:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413510, 635327, 80435, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of this composition, but what stands out to me is the phallic tower engulfed in the dark womanly "V". Very erotic. The tree tops add to the allusion. Great shot.</td>', 'I like the symmetry of this composition, but what stands out to me is the phallic tower engulfed in the dark womanly "V". Very erotic. The tree tops add to the allusion. Great shot.', '2008-01-22 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413513, 635993, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites so far. I love the grain and the perspective! Well, I guess I''ll just make it a favorite now (first one for this challenge). Wonderful image.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites so far. I love the grain and the perspective! Well, I guess I''ll just make it a favorite now (first one for this challenge). Wonderful image.', '2008-01-22 11:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413515, 634686, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the HDR (if that is what has made the tones this way) and the bride''s dress in the background are a little distracting for me. I like the big guy on the right :-) and I know I would''ve loved to be there!</td>', 'I like the idea, but the HDR (if that is what has made the tones this way) and the bride''s dress in the background are a little distracting for me. I like the big guy on the right :-) and I know I would''ve loved to be there!', '2008-01-22 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
