(4413794, 634368, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, very detailed, especially in the feathers. Did you blur the background? The eagle certainly stands out against it.</td>', 'Very sharp, very detailed, especially in the feathers. Did you blur the background? The eagle certainly stands out against it.', '2008-01-22 13:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
