(4413801, 634196, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Too bad the lighting wasn''t a bit more even, then you wouldn''t have the shadow of the nose. Of course you can''t do much about the sun!</td>', 'Beautiful! Too bad the lighting wasn''t a bit more even, then you wouldn''t have the shadow of the nose. Of course you can''t do much about the sun!', '2008-01-22 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
