(4413852, 635964, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool angle.   Good choice of black and white to focus on the subject.</td>', 'Cool angle.   Good choice of black and white to focus on the subject.', '2008-01-22 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413853, 634871, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect that this is one of those photos that would be best viewed as a large print.  Aside from the figure at the window, with his pose and expression deep in thought, there is a huge amount to view - the bottles at the slightly open upper window, the patterns provided by the architectural details which provides a structure to the photo, the decayed splendour marked by the graffiti and the missing metal plate or bell-pull. A very pleasing and interesting photo, just wish I could see at a size that would do it justice!</td>', 'I suspect that this is one of those photos that would be best viewed as a large print.  Aside from the figure at the window, with his pose and expression deep in thought, there is a huge amount to view - the bottles at the slightly open upper window, the patterns provided by the architectural details which provides a structure to the photo, the decayed splendour marked by the graffiti and the missing metal plate or bell-pull. A very pleasing and interesting photo, just wish I could see at a size that would do it justice!', '2008-01-22 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413854, 636215, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love the illusion of the water looking like glass.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love the illusion of the water looking like glass.', '2008-01-22 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413855, 635487, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like it! Split the frame then place the interest in ROT. The touch of light hitting the tree branches really adds to the photo as do the ripples in the water. Is this Skiff v.2007?</td>', 'I like it! Split the frame then place the interest in ROT. The touch of light hitting the tree branches really adds to the photo as do the ripples in the water. Is this Skiff v.2007?', '2008-01-22 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413856, 634973, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow excellent shot, I just can''t wait to go here one day.  You did an great job capturing the light.</td>', 'Wow excellent shot, I just can''t wait to go here one day.  You did an great job capturing the light.', '2008-01-22 13:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4413858, 635289, 41802, '<td valign="top">How weird to see a firework in such a green sky.  Nice contrast.</td>', 'How weird to see a firework in such a green sky.  Nice contrast.', '2008-01-22 13:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
