(4414643, 633194, 54878, '<td valign="top">I would of said 10, but then realised that I had to dock 5 points to negate your unfair location advantage.  ;)<br/> <br/>Great shot, the colours in the sky and reflected on the snow are fantastic.  The broken up snow on the mountain gives a great texture too.</td>', 'I would of said 10, but then realised that I had to dock 5 points to negate your unfair location advantage.  ;) Great shot, the colours in the sky and reflected on the snow are fantastic.  The broken up snow on the mountain gives a great texture too.', '2008-01-22 17:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
