(4414653, 635984, 56658, '<td valign="top">very nice. I like the idea of the mesh in front of the left half. especially since that is the half she is trying to hide with her hair. It seems to symbolise (sp?) even further her unwillingness to share her entire self with the world. BTW I like this one better than your challenge entry.</td>', 'very nice. I like the idea of the mesh in front of the left half. especially since that is the half she is trying to hide with her hair. It seems to symbolise (sp?) even further her unwillingness to share her entire self with the world. BTW I like this one better than your challenge entry.', '2008-01-22 17:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414660, 633378, 54878, '<td valign="top">Would of been better if he had been completely silhouetted.</td>', 'Would of been better if he had been completely silhouetted.', '2008-01-22 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414679, 633442, 62895, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, amazing color and texture in the rock, definately my favorite of the ones I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, amazing color and texture in the rock, definately my favorite of the ones I''ve seen so far.', '2008-01-22 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414699, 632966, 54878, '<td valign="top">The border is a bit too big and does detract from what is otherwise a great photo.</td>', 'The border is a bit too big and does detract from what is otherwise a great photo.', '2008-01-22 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414700, 635503, 2764, '<td valign="top">Nice - great eyes!!  She must love this portrait.  I think perhaps you dont need all the hat, if you crop some off the top it puts her eyes in a more interesting place, not dead center.  If you look at model shots, a surprising number have half the hair on top cropped out of the picture.  I love all the textures here, her smooth white face, the knitted hat and the fine detail of her hair.</td>', 'Nice - great eyes!!  She must love this portrait.  I think perhaps you dont need all the hat, if you crop some off the top it puts her eyes in a more interesting place, not dead center.  If you look at model shots, a surprising number have half the hair on top cropped out of the picture.  I love all the textures here, her smooth white face, the knitted hat and the fine detail of her hair.', '2008-01-22 17:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414713, 634920, 75034, '<td valign="top">You rock Jojo, five children and still smok''n hot. Not only do I like the pose I like the lighting and the focus, nice and crisp. Old Santa''s ticker would stop dead finding you under the tree. Great work with this shot Jojo.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'You rock Jojo, five children and still smok''n hot. Not only do I like the pose I like the lighting and the focus, nice and crisp. Old Santa''s ticker would stop dead finding you under the tree. Great work with this shot Jojo. MAX!', '2008-01-22 18:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414726, 634148, 75034, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Beautiful. I love everything about your shot. This works great in B&amp;W and the DoF is amazing. Fantastic shot, I sure hope to see this one in the top 3. It would be a crime if it didn''t make atleast the top 10. Best of luck with this one you have done well.</td>', 'Absolutely Beautiful. I love everything about your shot. This works great in B&W and the DoF is amazing. Fantastic shot, I sure hope to see this one in the top 3. It would be a crime if it didn''t make atleast the top 10. Best of luck with this one you have done well.', '2008-01-22 18:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414743, 635578, 67258, '<td valign="top">there is only one person this could belong to...</td>', 'there is only one person this could belong to...', '2008-01-22 18:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414758, 633001, 67258, '<td valign="top">i think you may have slightly over-done the saturation on the sky.</td>', 'i think you may have slightly over-done the saturation on the sky.', '2008-01-22 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414766, 634709, 75034, '<td valign="top">Your best of 2005 shot of this man was fantastic as well (boy I hope this is the same person) I know I''ve seen him before and he still looks happy.</td>', 'Your best of 2005 shot of this man was fantastic as well (boy I hope this is the same person) I know I''ve seen him before and he still looks happy.', '2008-01-22 18:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414782, 633001, 66515, '<td valign="top">Ow ow ow! Way over processed. The objects in the picture have terrible haloing. I like the color in the shot but they are oversaturated. <br/> <br/>Sorry :(</td>', 'Ow ow ow! Way over processed. The objects in the picture have terrible haloing. I like the color in the shot but they are oversaturated.  Sorry :(', '2008-01-22 18:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414820, 634320, 66616, '<td valign="top">Not the best image of the bridge that I have seen. I think it would have been improved IMO if you had taken this from a position closer to the bridge giving a different point of view. Also I think it would improve if the top of the water was not in the middle of the picture. The light and colours is very nice.</td>', 'Not the best image of the bridge that I have seen. I think it would have been improved IMO if you had taken this from a position closer to the bridge giving a different point of view. Also I think it would improve if the top of the water was not in the middle of the picture. The light and colours is very nice.', '2008-01-22 18:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414855, 636096, 37965, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!.. I think it may already be in my favorites</td>', 'This is awesome!.. I think it may already be in my favorites', '2008-01-22 19:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414883, 633560, 53316, '<td valign="top">Only thing I could see to improve would be if the sky were very subtly/lightly tinted a medium blue. I''m still giving you a 10. The greens are fantastic, the house is sharp and detailed but not over-processed looking, and the composition and perspective are STELLAR.  Great job.</td>', 'Only thing I could see to improve would be if the sky were very subtly/lightly tinted a medium blue. I''m still giving you a 10. The greens are fantastic, the house is sharp and detailed but not over-processed looking, and the composition and perspective are STELLAR.  Great job.', '2008-01-22 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414884, 635473, 23053, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective...that horse is totally huge, man.</td>', 'Lovely perspective...that horse is totally huge, man.', '2008-01-22 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414886, 634121, 89281, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful expression the girl in the middle has on her face. Lovely shot. One of my favorites on this site by far.</td>', 'What a beautiful expression the girl in the middle has on her face. Lovely shot. One of my favorites on this site by far.', '2008-01-22 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414888, 635816, 53316, '<td valign="top">Amazing!!!!</td>', 'Amazing!!!!', '2008-01-22 19:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414895, 636148, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot, but I feel it would be better if you either cropped the bottom a bit or cloned out the telephone-pole-looking things, or titled it something different, because the technology that is implied by that little bit at the bottom doesn''t go very well with a fantasy theme.  However, it is a very, very great picture.  I love the colors - bright and bold without feeling oversaturated to me.</td>', 'I like it a lot, but I feel it would be better if you either cropped the bottom a bit or cloned out the telephone-pole-looking things, or titled it something different, because the technology that is implied by that little bit at the bottom doesn''t go very well with a fantasy theme.  However, it is a very, very great picture.  I love the colors - bright and bold without feeling oversaturated to me.', '2008-01-22 19:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414901, 636088, 12998, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen more of the horse.  The dirt flying off the hoolves might have added to the impact.  It is a very good image though, 8.</td>', 'Would like to have seen more of the horse.  The dirt flying off the hoolves might have added to the impact.  It is a very good image though, 8.', '2008-01-22 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4414918, 634501, 87538, '<td valign="top">This is your best shot?</td>', 'This is your best shot?', '2008-01-22 19:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
