(4415106, 634880, 29477, '<td valign="top">Not a great entry for the "Best of" challenge.  The direct flash doesn''t work here nor does the composition.  My family does a lot of camping in Central Ontario and one of the highlights for the kids is feeding the chipmunks.  When capturing those images, I like to use a narrow DoF as well as include the expression of the kids as the chipmunk takes the peanut (or whatever) from their hand.  <br/> <br/>The image is well focused, but unforetunately, I do not see this scoring very well.  Sorry.  Good Luck. 3.</td>', 'Not a great entry for the "Best of" challenge.  The direct flash doesn''t work here nor does the composition.  My family does a lot of camping in Central Ontario and one of the highlights for the kids is feeding the chipmunks.  When capturing those images, I like to use a narrow DoF as well as include the expression of the kids as the chipmunk takes the peanut (or whatever) from their hand.   The image is well focused, but unforetunately, I do not see this scoring very well.  Sorry.  Good Luck. 3.', '2008-01-22 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415107, 634365, 58452, '<td valign="top">One we''ve all seen a thousand times before.... but there is something about the match of the sky with the stone and mortar of the building that really sets this one apart for me.  Very nice.</td>', 'One we''ve all seen a thousand times before.... but there is something about the match of the sky with the stone and mortar of the building that really sets this one apart for me.  Very nice.', '2008-01-22 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
