(4415119, 633714, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of a lovely lady. The skin tones are beautiful.  I wish what ever reflected light that accented her nose jewelry could have been reduced.  Either turn her head and celebrate the pin... or at least make it not look like a dust speck. But that''s just a nit pick on a very beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of a lovely lady. The skin tones are beautiful.  I wish what ever reflected light that accented her nose jewelry could have been reduced.  Either turn her head and celebrate the pin... or at least make it not look like a dust speck. But that''s just a nit pick on a very beautiful portrait.', '2008-01-22 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415124, 634128, 19982, '<td valign="top">Oh ... I''m in love!<br/> <br/>The colors are gorgeous, the definition of the silhouette perfect, the ambience beautifully rendered. <br/> <br/>I don''t care who wins, this one goes straight to the top of my list!</td>', 'Oh ... I''m in love! The colors are gorgeous, the definition of the silhouette perfect, the ambience beautifully rendered.  I don''t care who wins, this one goes straight to the top of my list!', '2008-01-22 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
