(4415159, 636216, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is a little dull and grainy.  Composition is nothing special with standard middle of the image result. I would have cropped to have less water and more sky.  DPCers seem to get excited about sky''s that are dynamic and full of cloulds and blue sky and with the clear day and bleaching near the top this may not score very high.  Sorry.  Good Luck. 3.</td>', 'Image is a little dull and grainy.  Composition is nothing special with standard middle of the image result. I would have cropped to have less water and more sky.  DPCers seem to get excited about sky''s that are dynamic and full of cloulds and blue sky and with the clear day and bleaching near the top this may not score very high.  Sorry.  Good Luck. 3.', '2008-01-22 21:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415164, 635693, 82985, '<td valign="top">I lived in AZ and did large format film work--I got so tired of seeing slot canyon shots: I LIKE this one!!  I especially appreciate that you did not go the extreme saturation false color route that seems to be de rigeur for slot canyon shots.  This looks REAL and LOVELY at the same time, with no supernatural supersaturation needed.  Thanks for doing this differently.</td>', 'I lived in AZ and did large format film work--I got so tired of seeing slot canyon shots: I LIKE this one!!  I especially appreciate that you did not go the extreme saturation false color route that seems to be de rigeur for slot canyon shots.  This looks REAL and LOVELY at the same time, with no supernatural supersaturation needed.  Thanks for doing this differently.', '2008-01-22 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415170, 635740, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great compistion, cropping, expression and like the conversion to B&amp;W (light serpia feel).  The downfall IMO is that the foucs is a little too soft for my liking and may impact the outcome.  Regardless, this is a good capture and a nice image to always reflect on.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Great compistion, cropping, expression and like the conversion to B&W (light serpia feel).  The downfall IMO is that the foucs is a little too soft for my liking and may impact the outcome.  Regardless, this is a good capture and a nice image to always reflect on.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-22 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415173, 635229, 58452, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful bird. Excellent texture on yellow and most of the black feathers. Lovely bokeh, but my only nit pick would be the white areas top right. I still think this will be blue.</td>', 'Such a beautiful bird. Excellent texture on yellow and most of the black feathers. Lovely bokeh, but my only nit pick would be the white areas top right. I still think this will be blue.', '2008-01-22 21:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
