(4415286, 635863, 29477, '<td valign="top">What an absolute wonderful capture.  Great wing span and a different perspective on the typical Eagle shot on its perch.  But, you have absolutely destroyed the result with the processing and it looks almost cartoonish and unnatural.  I would love to see this image with some adjustments in levels for some contrast, USM and some minor burining of the sky.  This should be an 8-10, but the processing drops it to a 5-6 IMO.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'What an absolute wonderful capture.  Great wing span and a different perspective on the typical Eagle shot on its perch.  But, you have absolutely destroyed the result with the processing and it looks almost cartoonish and unnatural.  I would love to see this image with some adjustments in levels for some contrast, USM and some minor burining of the sky.  This should be an 8-10, but the processing drops it to a 5-6 IMO.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-22 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
