(4415299, 635083, 58452, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain what I like about this one.  Well, other than my obvious bias towards green. :) The reflections in the waves take on a multi-angular colored jumble that look like they come straight from a Picasso painting! It gives me a very peaceful feeling.  The flow of time will go on forever. I don''t usually think frames add much but this one is perfect for the subject. Bumping this one up to a nine.  A ribbon in a perfect world.  At DPC I bet a top 50.  Congrats.</td>', 'I can''t explain what I like about this one.  Well, other than my obvious bias towards green. :) The reflections in the waves take on a multi-angular colored jumble that look like they come straight from a Picasso painting! It gives me a very peaceful feeling.  The flow of time will go on forever. I don''t usually think frames add much but this one is perfect for the subject. Bumping this one up to a nine.  A ribbon in a perfect world.  At DPC I bet a top 50.  Congrats.', '2008-01-22 22:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
