(4415313, 634973, 58452, '<td valign="top">I really like how the spirit rises up through the beam of light above. Management of exposure in such a situation is difficult. I wish the large expanse of darker rock to the right could have been a bit lighter.  But that''s just a nit pick, it doesn''t take away much from such an excellent composition.  Congrats.</td>', 'I really like how the spirit rises up through the beam of light above. Management of exposure in such a situation is difficult. I wish the large expanse of darker rock to the right could have been a bit lighter.  But that''s just a nit pick, it doesn''t take away much from such an excellent composition.  Congrats.', '2008-01-22 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415317, 636148, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, however with so much emphasis on the sky, your title (I am assuming in reference to the Lord of the Rings - middle earth) covers so little of the image.  I would have tried to include more of the silhouetted foreground to tie better to your title. Good Luck. 5. <br/> <br/>NOTE: I had to search your title as I wasn''t sure what the reference was.</td>', 'I like the colours, however with so much emphasis on the sky, your title (I am assuming in reference to the Lord of the Rings - middle earth) covers so little of the image.  I would have tried to include more of the silhouetted foreground to tie better to your title. Good Luck. 5.  NOTE: I had to search your title as I wasn''t sure what the reference was.', '2008-01-22 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
