(4415547, 634295, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I really like the simplicity of objects blended with the complexity of the geometry.</td>', 'Nice.  I really like the simplicity of objects blended with the complexity of the geometry.', '2008-01-22 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415548, 636027, 73115, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, like the DoF but to me it seems like it could have a hint more color for someone sitting out on a nice bright day... in particular on her face.</td>', 'Nice shot, like the DoF but to me it seems like it could have a hint more color for someone sitting out on a nice bright day... in particular on her face.', '2008-01-22 23:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415550, 632976, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured here.....</td>', 'Nicely captured here.....', '2008-01-22 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415555, 635677, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is a little soft and the lighting is not working for me.  Your title tries to direct my focus to the lips but I get drawn to her left check where all the light is being absorbed.  Based on the pose, the light should be coming from the left of the image bouncing of the front of the face and adding some life to the lips.  Cropping is a too tight and does not work for me.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'Image is a little soft and the lighting is not working for me.  Your title tries to direct my focus to the lips but I get drawn to her left check where all the light is being absorbed.  Based on the pose, the light should be coming from the left of the image bouncing of the front of the face and adding some life to the lips.  Cropping is a too tight and does not work for me.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-22 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415560, 635819, 29477, '<td valign="top">Here is one where the processing works well for me here.  Like the rustic feel and result you achieved. Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Here is one where the processing works well for me here.  Like the rustic feel and result you achieved. Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-22 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415562, 636118, 65234, '<td valign="top">The light on this is gorgeous!  Beautiful golden grass and blue sky, too.</td>', 'The light on this is gorgeous!  Beautiful golden grass and blue sky, too.', '2008-01-22 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415564, 633950, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and texture; very 3-dimensional.</td>', 'Nice lighting and texture; very 3-dimensional.', '2008-01-22 23:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415567, 633680, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and eeriness conveyed here.  Well done. Good Luck. 8.</td>', 'Great lighting and eeriness conveyed here.  Well done. Good Luck. 8.', '2008-01-22 23:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415568, 633996, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely, dreamy, wonderful curvy path to lead me in.</td>', 'Lovely, dreamy, wonderful curvy path to lead me in.', '2008-01-22 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415573, 634882, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks very lonely out there.</td>', 'Looks very lonely out there.', '2008-01-22 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415587, 632940, 73115, '<td valign="top">Your picture is split at about the horizontal middle... where you see all gravel until the path starts. Bringing that down to the bottom third might have made this better. Otherwise, nice detail and color.</td>', 'Your picture is split at about the horizontal middle... where you see all gravel until the path starts. Bringing that down to the bottom third might have made this better. Otherwise, nice detail and color.', '2008-01-22 23:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415589, 635507, 71244, '<td valign="top">love the editorial look of this shot.</td>', 'love the editorial look of this shot.', '2008-01-22 23:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415608, 636148, 71244, '<td valign="top">the eye is on you frodo baggins...very appropriate title!</td>', 'the eye is on you frodo baggins...very appropriate title!', '2008-01-22 23:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415614, 635217, 55621, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this a lot higher but the crop really takes away from the overall composition.</td>', 'I would have scored this a lot higher but the crop really takes away from the overall composition.', '2008-01-22 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415619, 634365, 73115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I think the building could be a little bit darker though, so it doesn''t blend in with the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I think the building could be a little bit darker though, so it doesn''t blend in with the sky.', '2008-01-22 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415624, 635554, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo.  The crop seems awkward but with the bird in flight you didn''t have a choice. 9</td>', 'This is an amazing photo.  The crop seems awkward but with the bird in flight you didn''t have a choice. 9', '2008-01-22 23:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415627, 634330, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice, just slightly washed out.</td>', 'Nice, just slightly washed out.', '2008-01-22 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415631, 634545, 55621, '<td valign="top">Works well in b/w.</td>', 'Works well in b/w.', '2008-01-22 23:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415638, 635558, 80859, '<td valign="top">very elegant</td>', 'very elegant', '2008-01-22 23:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415661, 635883, 87538, '<td valign="top">poorly edited.</td>', 'poorly edited.', '2008-01-22 23:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415664, 632921, 87538, '<td valign="top">You made me feel the pain.</td>', 'You made me feel the pain.', '2008-01-22 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415668, 635156, 87538, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you smoothed her so much....as the focal point should she really be this far out of focus?</td>', 'Not sure why you smoothed her so much....as the focal point should she really be this far out of focus?', '2008-01-22 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415675, 633304, 87538, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but it doesn''t give me a sense of two people in love....more just two people sitting in the grass waiting for the shutter to click</td>', 'nice photo, but it doesn''t give me a sense of two people in love....more just two people sitting in the grass waiting for the shutter to click', '2008-01-22 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415678, 634929, 87538, '<td valign="top">angels...as in plural and yet the horse''s face is almost gone.</td>', 'angels...as in plural and yet the horse''s face is almost gone.', '2008-01-22 23:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415681, 634955, 87538, '<td valign="top">nice capture...</td>', 'nice capture...', '2008-01-22 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415686, 634349, 87538, '<td valign="top">He should shoot the guy who painted the portrait.</td>', 'He should shoot the guy who painted the portrait.', '2008-01-22 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415730, 634711, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sweet moment between two beautifully powerful beings.</td>', 'Looks like a sweet moment between two beautifully powerful beings.', '2008-01-22 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415738, 634257, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light and DOF.</td>', 'Nice light and DOF.', '2008-01-22 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415742, 635713, 77838, '<td valign="top">By the thumbnail this photo should be call "Eggs N Bacon"!  The table looks like an egg and the red color of the chairs make them look like bacon, LOL.  I like your use of vignetting here also. -BB</td>', 'By the thumbnail this photo should be call "Eggs N Bacon"!  The table looks like an egg and the red color of the chairs make them look like bacon, LOL.  I like your use of vignetting here also. -BB', '2008-01-22 23:56:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4415744, 633458, 65234, '<td valign="top">The ducks add a nice bit of life to this.  Soothing scene with nice tones.</td>', 'The ducks add a nice bit of life to this.  Soothing scene with nice tones.', '2008-01-22 23:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415746, 633064, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose :-)</td>', 'Great pose :-)', '2008-01-22 23:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415755, 634165, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot at the Vatican Museum.</td>', 'Nice shot at the Vatican Museum.', '2008-01-22 23:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415762, 635229, 55621, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, too bad the beak is so damaged.</td>', 'Beautiful bird, too bad the beak is so damaged.', '2008-01-23 00:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415910, 634240, 57775, '<td valign="top">The horizon line looks a little crooked.</td>', 'The horizon line looks a little crooked.', '2008-01-23 00:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415929, 635917, 57775, '<td valign="top">Hahaha... reminds me of Liza Minelli.</td>', 'Hahaha... reminds me of Liza Minelli.', '2008-01-23 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4415949, 635717, 41116, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but the peice of purple plastic on the bottom right completely ruins the feel of this photo.</td>', 'Just my opinion, but the peice of purple plastic on the bottom right completely ruins the feel of this photo.', '2008-01-23 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416014, 635340, 73115, '<td valign="top">I love this... the shadow is unfortunate though.</td>', 'I love this... the shadow is unfortunate though.', '2008-01-23 01:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416022, 636053, 73115, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and great colors. What kind of birds are they?</td>', 'Nice capture and great colors. What kind of birds are they?', '2008-01-23 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416045, 632911, 21816, '<td valign="top">Nice use of minimal lighting. Nice work!</td>', 'Nice use of minimal lighting. Nice work!', '2008-01-23 01:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416053, 632911, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but soft on the focus.</td>', 'Nice composition but soft on the focus.', '2008-01-23 01:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416083, 634196, 55621, '<td valign="top">Not as sharp as your blue but still a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Not as sharp as your blue but still a beautiful photo.', '2008-01-23 01:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416090, 635812, 55621, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, the Basilica is amazing at night.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, the Basilica is amazing at night.', '2008-01-23 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416099, 633224, 55621, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  Great contrast between the cliffs and sky.</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  Great contrast between the cliffs and sky.', '2008-01-23 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416106, 634714, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo.  Simple but very expressive.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo.  Simple but very expressive.', '2008-01-23 01:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416110, 633487, 55621, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter, but extremely washed out.</td>', 'Great subject matter, but extremely washed out.', '2008-01-23 01:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416122, 634973, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image, securely this will be in a very good final position</td>', 'great image, securely this will be in a very good final position', '2008-01-23 01:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416123, 636088, 55621, '<td valign="top">Besides a small amount of movement in the tail, you managed to stop all motion.  Great work!  The lighting is perfect. 9</td>', 'Besides a small amount of movement in the tail, you managed to stop all motion.  Great work!  The lighting is perfect. 9', '2008-01-23 01:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416129, 633157, 55621, '<td valign="top">Simple but very descriptive.</td>', 'Simple but very descriptive.', '2008-01-23 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416130, 632984, 55621, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the bunny, but a very cool photo.</td>', 'Don''t get the bunny, but a very cool photo.', '2008-01-23 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416135, 635558, 55956, '<td valign="top">ouch! a great wow effect here.</td>', 'ouch! a great wow effect here.', '2008-01-23 01:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416140, 633970, 55621, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. Glad he had the goggles on.</td>', 'Very cool capture. Glad he had the goggles on.', '2008-01-23 01:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416145, 635267, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph.  Probably has a thousand stories to tell.</td>', 'This is a great photograph.  Probably has a thousand stories to tell.', '2008-01-23 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416157, 634279, 55621, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize the Hubble telescope had sold.  One hell of a telephoto lens is all I can say...</td>', 'I didn''t realize the Hubble telescope had sold.  One hell of a telephoto lens is all I can say...', '2008-01-23 02:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416160, 634244, 55621, '<td valign="top">You nose how to use your camera.  Cool close up.</td>', 'You nose how to use your camera.  Cool close up.', '2008-01-23 02:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416165, 636096, 55621, '<td valign="top">Just a little more air and he would have made Lions Gate.  Another wonderful photo.</td>', 'Just a little more air and he would have made Lions Gate.  Another wonderful photo.', '2008-01-23 02:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416171, 633442, 55621, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. 10</td>', 'Beautiful composition. 10', '2008-01-23 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416210, 634951, 55621, '<td valign="top">This is almost an optical illusion.  Amazing contrast between the valley fog and the sun in the clouds. 10</td>', 'This is almost an optical illusion.  Amazing contrast between the valley fog and the sun in the clouds. 10', '2008-01-23 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416217, 634375, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, where are the basalt formations located?</td>', 'Nice photo, where are the basalt formations located?', '2008-01-23 02:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416273, 632946, 55621, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the biblical reference, but the photograph is perfect all the way down to the red border.  10</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the biblical reference, but the photograph is perfect all the way down to the red border.  10', '2008-01-23 03:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416275, 635883, 55621, '<td valign="top">Wow, an amazing photograph.</td>', 'Wow, an amazing photograph.', '2008-01-23 03:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416278, 635926, 57775, '<td valign="top">I just voted on 100% of this challenge, and this is one of seven 10''s I gave out.  Love the simplicity of the lines and colors. Beautiful.</td>', 'I just voted on 100% of this challenge, and this is one of seven 10''s I gave out.  Love the simplicity of the lines and colors. Beautiful.', '2008-01-23 03:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416279, 634973, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is amazing.  The light looks like a waterfall.  I only gave out seven 10''s after voting on 100% of this challenge and this is one of them.</td>', 'This is amazing.  The light looks like a waterfall.  I only gave out seven 10''s after voting on 100% of this challenge and this is one of them.', '2008-01-23 03:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416281, 633315, 57775, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  Amazing, gorgeous, ethereal photo.  Adding to favorites.<br/> <br/>Edit:  after voting on 100% of the challenge, this photo is my favorite.  The best of the best.  I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'WOW!!!  Amazing, gorgeous, ethereal photo.  Adding to favorites. Edit:  after voting on 100% of the challenge, this photo is my favorite.  The best of the best.  I hope you ribbon.', '2008-01-23 03:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416283, 635617, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is just amazingly beautiful!  I''m curious to see how it will do in the <br/>Best of 2007, which will no doubt be dominated with spectacular landscape shots.  But this shot really has character - I can practically feel her skin.  Would love to hear your post processing steps on this one.</td>', 'This is just amazingly beautiful!  I''m curious to see how it will do in the Best of 2007, which will no doubt be dominated with spectacular landscape shots.  But this shot really has character - I can practically feel her skin.  Would love to hear your post processing steps on this one.', '2008-01-23 03:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416284, 633996, 57775, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful!  Looks so otherworldly.  10.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful!  Looks so otherworldly.  10.', '2008-01-23 03:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416288, 634282, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is one of only seven 10''s I gave out after voting on 100% of the challenge.  Gorgeous shot.</td>', 'This is one of only seven 10''s I gave out after voting on 100% of the challenge.  Gorgeous shot.', '2008-01-23 03:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416290, 636200, 30791, '<td valign="top">ever seen the movie ''death proof''?<br/>this looks like a scene from it. great exposure control and editing</td>', 'ever seen the movie ''death proof''?this looks like a scene from it. great exposure control and editing', '2008-01-23 03:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416291, 635679, 57775, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the complimentary colors here, and the rule of thirds put into action.  Usually crooked horizon lines bother me (even when it''s only a centimeter off, like this one), but I think it works here - the picture has a natural grace and a strange beauty.  10.</td>', 'I LOVE the complimentary colors here, and the rule of thirds put into action.  Usually crooked horizon lines bother me (even when it''s only a centimeter off, like this one), but I think it works here - the picture has a natural grace and a strange beauty.  10.', '2008-01-23 03:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416294, 635982, 57775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Could easily be sold for a horse calendar or photo book.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Could easily be sold for a horse calendar or photo book.', '2008-01-23 03:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416302, 634994, 57032, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful colours and sky here!  A bit more contrast in the sky might help it pop a bit more, but I really like this.</td>', 'Just beautiful colours and sky here!  A bit more contrast in the sky might help it pop a bit more, but I really like this.', '2008-01-23 03:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416303, 635730, 57032, '<td valign="top">Well, I think I need to start using a square crop; there''s so much to look at!  THe colours are beautiful here, and all the greens complement each other nicely.  The reflection is nice but not blown out, and the rock arch helps keep the eye in the picture.  Nice job.</td>', 'Well, I think I need to start using a square crop; there''s so much to look at!  THe colours are beautiful here, and all the greens complement each other nicely.  The reflection is nice but not blown out, and the rock arch helps keep the eye in the picture.  Nice job.', '2008-01-23 03:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416305, 636081, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours.  The oranges and greens look great together, and the exposure is great from near-whites to rich blacks.  Good control.</td>', 'Very nice colours.  The oranges and greens look great together, and the exposure is great from near-whites to rich blacks.  Good control.', '2008-01-23 03:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416306, 635697, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great job of framing the castle here to draw the eye toward it.  The reds, greens, and yellows in the trees are stunning, and the castle is nicely sharpened.  Great control of exposure, too.</td>', 'Great job of framing the castle here to draw the eye toward it.  The reds, greens, and yellows in the trees are stunning, and the castle is nicely sharpened.  Great control of exposure, too.', '2008-01-23 03:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416308, 636034, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition of the boat, and a good job of maintaining most of the detail.  I can''t help but wonder what this would look like with some added contrast in the sky and trees.</td>', 'Very nice composition of the boat, and a good job of maintaining most of the detail.  I can''t help but wonder what this would look like with some added contrast in the sky and trees.', '2008-01-23 03:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416309, 636175, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the sky, with good contrast in the steam.  The foreground elements really help add something to this picture.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice colours in the sky, with good contrast in the steam.  The foreground elements really help add something to this picture.  Good job.', '2008-01-23 03:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416310, 636049, 57032, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get a lot of "too dark" comments on this one, but I think it has potential.  The lighting on the face is actually quite good, and it is a very emotionally-driven image.  I think a tighter crop on the face (leaving the light and blinds out altogether) would have been extremely effective.</td>', 'You''ll probably get a lot of "too dark" comments on this one, but I think it has potential.  The lighting on the face is actually quite good, and it is a very emotionally-driven image.  I think a tighter crop on the face (leaving the light and blinds out altogether) would have been extremely effective.', '2008-01-23 03:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416311, 635033, 57032, '<td valign="top">Simple, but nice colour contrast and good lines.  It gets me thinking about what it is, which is good.</td>', 'Simple, but nice colour contrast and good lines.  It gets me thinking about what it is, which is good.', '2008-01-23 03:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416316, 636214, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice, cool tones and great contrast throughout.  The sky here is gorgeous, especially with the split between cirrus and cumulus clouds.  My eyes are drawn to the dark black rock in the top-right of the image--nicely composed!</td>', 'Nice, cool tones and great contrast throughout.  The sky here is gorgeous, especially with the split between cirrus and cumulus clouds.  My eyes are drawn to the dark black rock in the top-right of the image--nicely composed!', '2008-01-23 03:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416318, 635172, 57032, '<td valign="top">A nice, gentle softness that works well for a portrait of a child this age.  Gorgeous warm tones!  In a perfect world I might try to compose without that grass or shadow behind her, but overall you''ve shown great portrait skills.</td>', 'A nice, gentle softness that works well for a portrait of a child this age.  Gorgeous warm tones!  In a perfect world I might try to compose without that grass or shadow behind her, but overall you''ve shown great portrait skills.', '2008-01-23 03:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416319, 636035, 57032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful find!  I''d probably walk right past a scene like this, but you''ve captured it and shown its beauty.  Excellent job of framing in a way to pull my eye down the path.</td>', 'Beautiful find!  I''d probably walk right past a scene like this, but you''ve captured it and shown its beauty.  Excellent job of framing in a way to pull my eye down the path.', '2008-01-23 03:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416320, 635507, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  The noise works well here in the sky (it would otherwise be quite bland), and all three expressions are well-captured.  Would be nice if the faces were a bit more visible, but the message gets across.</td>', 'Great timing.  The noise works well here in the sky (it would otherwise be quite bland), and all three expressions are well-captured.  Would be nice if the faces were a bit more visible, but the message gets across.', '2008-01-23 03:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416330, 634647, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent. My favorite thus far, to bad about the flare obscuring her face. 8</td>', 'Excellent. My favorite thus far, to bad about the flare obscuring her face. 8', '2008-01-23 03:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416331, 633703, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure.</td>', 'Nice exposure.', '2008-01-23 03:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416336, 635734, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. I love the exposure and PP.</td>', 'This is fantastic. I love the exposure and PP.', '2008-01-23 03:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416337, 635819, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice PP</td>', 'Nice PP', '2008-01-23 03:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416343, 634375, 54645, '<td valign="top">Is this Devil''s Postpile?</td>', 'Is this Devil''s Postpile?', '2008-01-23 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416344, 635714, 41116, '<td valign="top">She really is beautiful. I think the crop is a little too tight at the bottom, I''m undecided as to if it would have been better to not cut off the top of her head or not. I like the way you lit this though.</td>', 'She really is beautiful. I think the crop is a little too tight at the bottom, I''m undecided as to if it would have been better to not cut off the top of her head or not. I like the way you lit this though.', '2008-01-23 03:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416348, 634112, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Wonderful light, I love her expression</td>', 'Fantastic. Wonderful light, I love her expression', '2008-01-23 03:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416403, 633288, 41116, '<td valign="top">Nice! Love how you captured the Zebra in the dust. I like the centered composition, as there are lots of interst in the photo. Black and White was definately the way to go with this.</td>', 'Nice! Love how you captured the Zebra in the dust. I like the centered composition, as there are lots of interst in the photo. Black and White was definately the way to go with this.', '2008-01-23 04:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4416420, 633077, 19831, '<td valign="top">I remember this photo! Loved it then, love it now!</td>', 'I remember this photo! Loved it then, love it now!', '2008-01-23 05:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
