(4417538, 634899, 2553, '<td valign="top">Talk about a triple threat - horse, child, kittens!! Oh my goodness, you shouldn''t go wrong with this!  Really adorable, and WHAT a gorgeous horse.</td>', 'Talk about a triple threat - horse, child, kittens!! Oh my goodness, you shouldn''t go wrong with this!  Really adorable, and WHAT a gorgeous horse.', '2008-01-23 11:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
