(4417547, 635819, 2553, '<td valign="top">This has the feel of a painting, and it suits it well.  Interested to see your PP when challenge is done.  Really a cool image.</td>', 'This has the feel of a painting, and it suits it well.  Interested to see your PP when challenge is done.  Really a cool image.', '2008-01-23 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417548, 634702, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly compelling image, I must say.  The chains are so huge and stark looking that, along with the title, it really hits you.  I must say that about 90% of the time, the title on images doesn''t really "tie into" the image for me, but here it is integral.  Very creative thought process also, zeroing in on this, where most people would just make a shot of the whole creature.</td>', 'This is a fairly compelling image, I must say.  The chains are so huge and stark looking that, along with the title, it really hits you.  I must say that about 90% of the time, the title on images doesn''t really "tie into" the image for me, but here it is integral.  Very creative thought process also, zeroing in on this, where most people would just make a shot of the whole creature.', '2008-01-23 11:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
