(4417709, 636046, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice Framing and composition.  I am starting to dabble in Wedding photography and one of my concerns is the bleaching in the dress as you go to processing.  Unforetunately I do not have an answer other than shooting in NEF (RAW) has you have better control of the white balance during post shot processing. Other then the bleaching in the dress, this is still a good image.  Nice lighting and focus.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Nice Framing and composition.  I am starting to dabble in Wedding photography and one of my concerns is the bleaching in the dress as you go to processing.  Unforetunately I do not have an answer other than shooting in NEF (RAW) has you have better control of the white balance during post shot processing. Other then the bleaching in the dress, this is still a good image.  Nice lighting and focus.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-23 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417715, 632949, 29477, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the foreground...the sky is a little over the top in processing, but still lovely colours.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Absolutely love the foreground...the sky is a little over the top in processing, but still lovely colours.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-23 12:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
