(4417764, 634647, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great angle and silhouette, however looks like you have water spots (understandible) or light spots on the subject which is too bad.  It would have been nice to seen a slightly different angle/cropping with the subject on the right third of the image with more open water to her left.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Great angle and silhouette, however looks like you have water spots (understandible) or light spots on the subject which is too bad.  It would have been nice to seen a slightly different angle/cropping with the subject on the right third of the image with more open water to her left.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-23 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417769, 635102, 84124, '<td valign="top">Great contrasting color.  a few suggestions, lighten up the foreground a hair, and increase your f-stop (increase exposure time) to increase your depth of focus.  Also, a lower perspective would have given us the child''s view, that may add to the shot.</td>', 'Great contrasting color.  a few suggestions, lighten up the foreground a hair, and increase your f-stop (increase exposure time) to increase your depth of focus.  Also, a lower perspective would have given us the child''s view, that may add to the shot.', '2008-01-23 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417772, 635309, 84124, '<td valign="top">Sad photo, but it tells a story, I like it alot.</td>', 'Sad photo, but it tells a story, I like it alot.', '2008-01-23 12:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417776, 635622, 84124, '<td valign="top">Ooooo.... very well done, one of my favorites of the challenge!</td>', 'Ooooo.... very well done, one of my favorites of the challenge!', '2008-01-23 12:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417780, 633004, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but the processing is very poor (other than the eye...nice job there).  I struggle with lion shots as well espeically with the bleaching that occurs around the mouth and chest.  The forced effor to narrow the DoF is poor especially between the chin and right hind leg and around the face and backside.  Focus on the subject is great.  If the image only had some minor adjustments to the curves (contrast), sharpness and tweaking of the eye, this could be a 6-8, but with the result I have to give it a 5.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Nice capture but the processing is very poor (other than the eye...nice job there).  I struggle with lion shots as well espeically with the bleaching that occurs around the mouth and chest.  The forced effor to narrow the DoF is poor especially between the chin and right hind leg and around the face and backside.  Focus on the subject is great.  If the image only had some minor adjustments to the curves (contrast), sharpness and tweaking of the eye, this could be a 6-8, but with the result I have to give it a 5.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-23 12:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417791, 632922, 29477, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful capture, would have really preferred this in colour and the B&amp;W does not work for me, unless you had some major Ansel Adams processing with more contrast.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Such a wonderful capture, would have really preferred this in colour and the B&W does not work for me, unless you had some major Ansel Adams processing with more contrast.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-23 12:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4417795, 633762, 29477, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective, nice conversion to B&amp;W and well processed.  Great job. One of my favourites thus far. Good Luck. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective, nice conversion to B&W and well processed.  Great job. One of my favourites thus far. Good Luck. 9.', '2008-01-23 12:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
