(4418154, 636141, 66515, '<td valign="top">It would be nice to see the top of the building as well. I like the juxtaposition of old and new you create with the reflection. The sky looks great. My first thought regarding the traffic light is it is a distraction. However, I think it actually works here and helps put things in context.</td>', 'It would be nice to see the top of the building as well. I like the juxtaposition of old and new you create with the reflection. The sky looks great. My first thought regarding the traffic light is it is a distraction. However, I think it actually works here and helps put things in context.', '2008-01-23 14:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418160, 635432, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would consider cropping a bit off the top off the top which would effectively move the horizon up. It would also give the impression that there was more color in the scene and less stark blackness.</td>', 'I would consider cropping a bit off the top off the top which would effectively move the horizon up. It would also give the impression that there was more color in the scene and less stark blackness.', '2008-01-23 14:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418164, 632976, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really well framed and you got relatively good focus on the eyes of the one deer. It looks like your camera used the nose as the focus point but with the depth of field you got I don''t think it really hurts the image much.</td>', 'Really well framed and you got relatively good focus on the eyes of the one deer. It looks like your camera used the nose as the focus point but with the depth of field you got I don''t think it really hurts the image much.', '2008-01-23 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418169, 636088, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I like how you have the poles lined up creating leading lines to the horse and rider.</td>', 'Great action shot. I like how you have the poles lined up creating leading lines to the horse and rider.', '2008-01-23 15:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418170, 633309, 73115, '<td valign="top">Wow... I hope no frogs were injured during this shoot. ;-)</td>', 'Wow... I hope no frogs were injured during this shoot. ;-)', '2008-01-23 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418177, 635339, 73115, '<td valign="top">I think color may have been better and either using the rule of thirds so its not right in the center or cropped the right and left so the flower filled the frame. I do like the fine detail you can see on the petals.</td>', 'I think color may have been better and either using the rule of thirds so its not right in the center or cropped the right and left so the flower filled the frame. I do like the fine detail you can see on the petals.', '2008-01-23 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418275, 634861, 89338, '<td valign="top">I just became a member of this forum.  I''m a young portrait photographer looking to learn new techniques and possibly share a little of what I''ve done. But your portrait stopped me in my tracks.  I had to let you know how much I adore your work. This photo is very tender and loving.  The color tone you chose works well for this type of shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I just became a member of this forum.  I''m a young portrait photographer looking to learn new techniques and possibly share a little of what I''ve done. But your portrait stopped me in my tracks.  I had to let you know how much I adore your work. This photo is very tender and loving.  The color tone you chose works well for this type of shot.  Great job!', '2008-01-23 15:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418317, 635699, 54878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot apart from the border, that colour is horrible and quite a distraction.</td>', 'Nice shot apart from the border, that colour is horrible and quite a distraction.', '2008-01-23 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
