(4418684, 635010, 57032, '<td valign="top">Stunning sky!  I really like the composition, and you''ve weighted between the ground and sky perfectly.  I bet this would look great as a huge 20" x 30" print.</td>', 'Stunning sky!  I really like the composition, and you''ve weighted between the ground and sky perfectly.  I bet this would look great as a huge 20" x 30" print.', '2008-01-23 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
