(4418713, 636177, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great timing here.  A bit soft, but that doesn''t break an image if it carries emotion.  It''s a shame about Collins in the background (surrounding Bigby''s leg), but there''s little you could do about that; it''s just good that you caught the moment.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great timing here.  A bit soft, but that doesn''t break an image if it carries emotion.  It''s a shame about Collins in the background (surrounding Bigby''s leg), but there''s little you could do about that; it''s just good that you caught the moment.  Nice job.', '2008-01-23 18:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
