(4418730, 636023, 42013, '<td valign="top">I figured hotp was the lizard head rock, now I''m not so sure. Or is this goodman? Anyway, whoever it is, charming smile, charming picture, 8 for the dimple.<br/> <br/>Ahhhh, I can''t place her face but I think she was in a ribbon winner in 07. Jumping around with a scarf or something???</td>', 'I figured hotp was the lizard head rock, now I''m not so sure. Or is this goodman? Anyway, whoever it is, charming smile, charming picture, 8 for the dimple. Ahhhh, I can''t place her face but I think she was in a ribbon winner in 07. Jumping around with a scarf or something???', '2008-01-23 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418734, 635186, 21304, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. A little bit too much contrast in my opinion, but awesome nonetheless!</td>', 'Beautiful shot. A little bit too much contrast in my opinion, but awesome nonetheless!', '2008-01-23 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418737, 635048, 57032, '<td valign="top">Wow!  From a nice, soft landscape shot to a close-up of a snake''s face!<br/> <br/>The lines are perfect, and have me searching all around the image looking at the different varieties of greens.  The sharpness in the eye is perfect.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow!  From a nice, soft landscape shot to a close-up of a snake''s face! The lines are perfect, and have me searching all around the image looking at the different varieties of greens.  The sharpness in the eye is perfect.  Nice job.', '2008-01-23 18:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418738, 635813, 89345, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject. Lovely light and reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful subject. Lovely light and reflection.', '2008-01-23 18:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418740, 635964, 89345, '<td valign="top">Love the clean lines.</td>', 'Love the clean lines.', '2008-01-23 18:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418742, 636230, 89345, '<td valign="top">Love the colour and detail. Is that a rainbow?</td>', 'Love the colour and detail. Is that a rainbow?', '2008-01-23 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418745, 634119, 89345, '<td valign="top">Great moves. Love macro.</td>', 'Great moves. Love macro.', '2008-01-23 18:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418747, 634686, 57032, '<td valign="top">Cool shot that looks good in black and white.  New Orleans makes me think of "colourful", though, and I can''t help but wonder what this looked like with the colourful feathers and outfits.  Eliminating colour out of a picture reduces it to its tones only, so one has to be even more careful about composition, contrast, etc.  I think this image is a bit too busy, and makes it difficult to take it all in.  That can work sometimes, as it requires the viewer to analyze everything, but other times the viewer will just go on to the next image.<br/> <br/>I might suggest a tighter crop on what you think is the most interesting aspect of the image, leaving the viewer to guess more as to what the rest of the event was all about.</td>', 'Cool shot that looks good in black and white.  New Orleans makes me think of "colourful", though, and I can''t help but wonder what this looked like with the colourful feathers and outfits.  Eliminating colour out of a picture reduces it to its tones only, so one has to be even more careful about composition, contrast, etc.  I think this image is a bit too busy, and makes it difficult to take it all in.  That can work sometimes, as it requires the viewer to analyze everything, but other times the viewer will just go on to the next image. I might suggest a tighter crop on what you think is the most interesting aspect of the image, leaving the viewer to guess more as to what the rest of the event was all about.', '2008-01-23 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418757, 635463, 89345, '<td valign="top">Nice place, great sunset. Cool colours.</td>', 'Nice place, great sunset. Cool colours.', '2008-01-23 18:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418758, 635086, 56658, '<td valign="top">the colors seem strange but I like it. interesting subject as well.</td>', 'the colors seem strange but I like it. interesting subject as well.', '2008-01-23 18:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418763, 632949, 89345, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent colour.  Well done.', '2008-01-23 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418768, 635696, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, attractive photo. Nicely composed and/or cropped. My only complaint is that, lacking a clear view of the girls'' faces, we don''t get as much of a human connection with the image. Excellent job of capturing a nice moment.</td>', 'Very sweet, attractive photo. Nicely composed and/or cropped. My only complaint is that, lacking a clear view of the girls'' faces, we don''t get as much of a human connection with the image. Excellent job of capturing a nice moment.', '2008-01-23 18:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418769, 633438, 89345, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Think I''ve been there.</td>', 'Not bad. Think I''ve been there.', '2008-01-23 18:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418771, 634368, 19978, '<td valign="top">Excellent animal portrait. Great composition/crop and remarkable detail visible throughout. The photo really would have popped if it was just a bit brighter and if the eye was a little more "pimped." Excellent job!</td>', 'Excellent animal portrait. Great composition/crop and remarkable detail visible throughout. The photo really would have popped if it was just a bit brighter and if the eye was a little more "pimped." Excellent job!', '2008-01-23 18:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418778, 634364, 19978, '<td valign="top">There''s a tension here between the closeness of the woman''s face and the negative space on either side. The space tends to direct the eye into the face, but I''m left longing for more of her. I love the hint of texture in her eye makeup and lipstick. I love the hint of hairline, the barely visible ears. Overall I think it''s very effective image and one that would make an excellent print. Her facial expression is mysterious and intriguing. This second look for a comment also gets a bump in score...</td>', 'There''s a tension here between the closeness of the woman''s face and the negative space on either side. The space tends to direct the eye into the face, but I''m left longing for more of her. I love the hint of texture in her eye makeup and lipstick. I love the hint of hairline, the barely visible ears. Overall I think it''s very effective image and one that would make an excellent print. Her facial expression is mysterious and intriguing. This second look for a comment also gets a bump in score...', '2008-01-23 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418794, 636215, 57032, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky and nice, glassy water.  I like the contrast between the blues and the brown of the dock, and the slight warm tone in the highlights of the sky help to top everything off.  The composition of the dock is good, too; it draws the eye on a nice diagonal toward the tree in the water and into the rest of the image.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky and nice, glassy water.  I like the contrast between the blues and the brown of the dock, and the slight warm tone in the highlights of the sky help to top everything off.  The composition of the dock is good, too; it draws the eye on a nice diagonal toward the tree in the water and into the rest of the image.', '2008-01-23 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418798, 635174, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition of the tree and waterfall.  I love the detail in the bridge and the plants bordering on the sides.  I can''t help but wonder how this would look with some strong high pass sharpening.</td>', 'Very nice composition of the tree and waterfall.  I love the detail in the bridge and the plants bordering on the sides.  I can''t help but wonder how this would look with some strong high pass sharpening.', '2008-01-23 18:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418807, 635508, 57032, '<td valign="top">I love the colour given to the sky and the extreme contrast between the "whites" of the trees and the dark water.  Nice and crisp throughout.  This likely would have been too busy or low in contrast in a regular image, so IR is probably a good choice here.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=4517" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Marbo</a> was the first person I added to my favourites when I signed up on DPChallenge; I couldn''t believe the incredible look of IR, which I had never seen before.  After a while, they do tend to look a bit alike, but the composition here is still nice.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the colour given to the sky and the extreme contrast between the "whites" of the trees and the dark water.  Nice and crisp throughout.  This likely would have been too busy or low in contrast in a regular image, so IR is probably a good choice here.   Marbo was the first person I added to my favourites when I signed up on DPChallenge; I couldn''t believe the incredible look of IR, which I had never seen before.  After a while, they do tend to look a bit alike, but the composition here is still nice.  Good job.', '2008-01-23 18:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418820, 635565, 56658, '<td valign="top">cute kids but the shot doesn''t really strike me.</td>', 'cute kids but the shot doesn''t really strike me.', '2008-01-23 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418821, 633082, 57032, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely timed shot and very likely holds some emotional impact to you.  From a technical standpoint, it seems to be oversharpened, to the point where the writing becomes a bit difficult to read (although it does help boost contrast and bring out the texture of the stone).<br/> <br/>I like the composition of the girl and the flag, and the flag pole draws the eye nicely into the bee trail, which then draws the eye toward the name on the large plaque/tombstone.  I can''t quite tell if it''s maybe just a shadow, but the selective desaturation looks messy in the bottom stripe of the flag.<br/> <br/>Overall, a nice, emotional image.</td>', 'This is a nicely timed shot and very likely holds some emotional impact to you.  From a technical standpoint, it seems to be oversharpened, to the point where the writing becomes a bit difficult to read (although it does help boost contrast and bring out the texture of the stone). I like the composition of the girl and the flag, and the flag pole draws the eye nicely into the bee trail, which then draws the eye toward the name on the large plaque/tombstone.  I can''t quite tell if it''s maybe just a shadow, but the selective desaturation looks messy in the bottom stripe of the flag. Overall, a nice, emotional image.', '2008-01-23 18:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418839, 632927, 57032, '<td valign="top">There''s one major aspect of this image that works, and that''s timing.  You''ve captured a moment at the perfect time.<br/> <br/>However, there are many things that unfortunately work against my experience viewing this image.  For one thing, the black stripe along the top makes it look like the bird is about to fly into a wall, and doesn''t signify the "open skies" of being set free.  You haven''t utilized the maximum image size, which prevents the viewer from seeing a lot of detail.  I''d love to see the expression on the face of the person letting go of the bird.  Even the man and woman to the left might be good to include, too.</td>', 'There''s one major aspect of this image that works, and that''s timing.  You''ve captured a moment at the perfect time. However, there are many things that unfortunately work against my experience viewing this image.  For one thing, the black stripe along the top makes it look like the bird is about to fly into a wall, and doesn''t signify the "open skies" of being set free.  You haven''t utilized the maximum image size, which prevents the viewer from seeing a lot of detail.  I''d love to see the expression on the face of the person letting go of the bird.  Even the man and woman to the left might be good to include, too.', '2008-01-23 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418849, 636228, 57032, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, but one that proves the maxim that moving just an inch or two can sometimes make or break an image.  The fact that the moon is tight against the edge of the wall--and slightly behind the barbed wire--seems to indicate that you wanted to include it in the image, but didn''t consider how you wanted it composed.  Moving a bit back and to the right would have brought the moon out into the open sky, making it more prominent.  Or, you could have moved forward a bit, putting the moon behind the fence, which might be a personification of urban oppression (or some other theme).<br/> <br/>The detail in the brick is nice in the bottom left corner.  A bit of high pass sharpening might have really boosted the local contrast in this image.</td>', 'This is an interesting image, but one that proves the maxim that moving just an inch or two can sometimes make or break an image.  The fact that the moon is tight against the edge of the wall--and slightly behind the barbed wire--seems to indicate that you wanted to include it in the image, but didn''t consider how you wanted it composed.  Moving a bit back and to the right would have brought the moon out into the open sky, making it more prominent.  Or, you could have moved forward a bit, putting the moon behind the fence, which might be a personification of urban oppression (or some other theme). The detail in the brick is nice in the bottom left corner.  A bit of high pass sharpening might have really boosted the local contrast in this image.', '2008-01-23 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418856, 634880, 42013, '<td valign="top">Your focus and exposure is good. IMO its score will suffer for a couple of reasons. 1) While it has some ''cute'' factor, the chipmunk is too small to really get max impact. 2) The direct flash(on board i''m guessing) takes the mystery out of the situation. Think of some cross lighting raking accross the guy, just giving him some shape and illuminating the person''s hand.<br/> <br/>Think next time about your shooting angle. Lay down on the ground. Get close! We all like chipmunks so show us an intimate portrait! ;)</td>', 'Your focus and exposure is good. IMO its score will suffer for a couple of reasons. 1) While it has some ''cute'' factor, the chipmunk is too small to really get max impact. 2) The direct flash(on board i''m guessing) takes the mystery out of the situation. Think of some cross lighting raking accross the guy, just giving him some shape and illuminating the person''s hand. Think next time about your shooting angle. Lay down on the ground. Get close! We all like chipmunks so show us an intimate portrait! ;)', '2008-01-23 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418861, 635730, 73115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... where is that?</td>', 'Beautiful... where is that?', '2008-01-23 18:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418862, 634239, 2553, '<td valign="top">Breathtakingly beautiful.  I cannot imagine living somewhere with such dramatic landscapes.  Really lovely composition - I just love how the eye follows the creek right into the image and to the mountain.</td>', 'Breathtakingly beautiful.  I cannot imagine living somewhere with such dramatic landscapes.  Really lovely composition - I just love how the eye follows the creek right into the image and to the mountain.', '2008-01-23 18:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418870, 634492, 42013, '<td valign="top">focus and lighting is nice. A bump in contrast might be good but manely(:)) you need something other than a formed concrete wall as a background. Maybe they could let him out for a few minutes while you shoot! ;)</td>', 'focus and lighting is nice. A bump in contrast might be good but manely(:)) you need something other than a formed concrete wall as a background. Maybe they could let him out for a few minutes while you shoot! ;)', '2008-01-23 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418874, 632945, 42013, '<td valign="top">Pretty light and good exposure. Looks like a place I would enjoy! It suffers some from DPC''s size restrictions.</td>', 'Pretty light and good exposure. Looks like a place I would enjoy! It suffers some from DPC''s size restrictions.', '2008-01-23 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418875, 634702, 73115, '<td valign="top">So sad. Fabulous detail.</td>', 'So sad. Fabulous detail.', '2008-01-23 19:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418882, 632955, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nothing blown on the whites and good detail in the shadow areas of the feathers. Doesn''t really grab me from a subject or compositional standpoint but it is technically sound.</td>', 'Nothing blown on the whites and good detail in the shadow areas of the feathers. Doesn''t really grab me from a subject or compositional standpoint but it is technically sound.', '2008-01-23 19:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418885, 635309, 2553, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a image that "wows" me, I find that it does have a certain appeal.  The details of it - the gingerbread on the house, the spanish moss in the trees - these are what draw my attention here.  I find that there is more than enough going on in the image to keep my eyes moving around.  I really do like the PP, it suits the image well.</td>', 'While this isn''t a image that "wows" me, I find that it does have a certain appeal.  The details of it - the gingerbread on the house, the spanish moss in the trees - these are what draw my attention here.  I find that there is more than enough going on in the image to keep my eyes moving around.  I really do like the PP, it suits the image well.', '2008-01-23 19:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418895, 636031, 73115, '<td valign="top">The over exposed lights keep drawing my attention away from the rest of the picture.</td>', 'The over exposed lights keep drawing my attention away from the rest of the picture.', '2008-01-23 19:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418901, 635378, 73115, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.</td>', 'Nice macro.', '2008-01-23 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418920, 635972, 56658, '<td valign="top">interesting crop. I like the black and white treatment. nice job.</td>', 'interesting crop. I like the black and white treatment. nice job.', '2008-01-23 19:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418954, 635681, 73115, '<td valign="top">That gave me a big WOW when the page came up. Nicely done.</td>', 'That gave me a big WOW when the page came up. Nicely done.', '2008-01-23 19:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418960, 633004, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal, but the viewing angle and the composition don''t quite work for me. The fact that part of her body is hidden behind the head/neck, and the relative centeredness of the composition make for a slightly weaker feel than if you had captured the sprawl of the body from the front, paws out, head thrown back, etc. I like the detail visible on the face and the scruff of the neck, and the glint of green in her eye is lovely. Could have been much stronger, but a very nice shot as is.</td>', 'Beautiful animal, but the viewing angle and the composition don''t quite work for me. The fact that part of her body is hidden behind the head/neck, and the relative centeredness of the composition make for a slightly weaker feel than if you had captured the sprawl of the body from the front, paws out, head thrown back, etc. I like the detail visible on the face and the scruff of the neck, and the glint of green in her eye is lovely. Could have been much stronger, but a very nice shot as is.', '2008-01-23 19:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418973, 634956, 7743, '<td valign="top">I think the crop to square is a good choice for this image but I think it should be tighter as the blurry bits around the right and bottom edes are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think the crop to square is a good choice for this image but I think it should be tighter as the blurry bits around the right and bottom edes are a bit distracting.', '2008-01-23 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418975, 636146, 55838, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  Beautifully converted to b&amp;w and a magnificent "everyday" sort of composition.  Perfect.  Back to bump you up to 10 and adding to favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful image!  Beautifully converted to b&w and a magnificent "everyday" sort of composition.  Perfect.  Back to bump you up to 10 and adding to favorites.', '2008-01-23 19:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418978, 635788, 55838, '<td valign="top">Love the exuberence portrayed in this shot.  Fun!  Nice in b&amp;w.  Back to bump you up to 9.</td>', 'Love the exuberence portrayed in this shot.  Fun!  Nice in b&w.  Back to bump you up to 9.', '2008-01-23 19:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418984, 634672, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the boats to the sky and water though feel that some of the whites are a little too bright.  Also, the sky with the few stars and clouds, to me, is more interesting than the water so including more sky and less water would improve the image.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the boats to the sky and water though feel that some of the whites are a little too bright.  Also, the sky with the few stars and clouds, to me, is more interesting than the water so including more sky and less water would improve the image.', '2008-01-23 19:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418985, 636096, 56658, '<td valign="top">excellent shot. I like the version with him upside down better, but this is great as well.</td>', 'excellent shot. I like the version with him upside down better, but this is great as well.', '2008-01-23 19:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4418992, 634220, 56658, '<td valign="top">Interesting little guy. The whites seem a bit bright to me, but I like the detail in the bird.</td>', 'Interesting little guy. The whites seem a bit bright to me, but I like the detail in the bird.', '2008-01-23 19:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419014, 634861, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably beautiful capture.  Exposure is just so dead-on.  Bet you have clients lining up around the block if this is representative of your work.</td>', 'Unbelievably beautiful capture.  Exposure is just so dead-on.  Bet you have clients lining up around the block if this is representative of your work.', '2008-01-23 19:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419015, 634453, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, however I think the wind turbines are too small to have any impact in the image and the rock/hill in the foreground takes up too much space.</td>', 'Interesting idea, however I think the wind turbines are too small to have any impact in the image and the rock/hill in the foreground takes up too much space.', '2008-01-23 19:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419021, 635463, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good use of diagonals and the colours in the sky are beautiful.  However, there seems to be some haloing around the people, maybe a little heavy handed on the sharpening.</td>', 'Good use of diagonals and the colours in the sky are beautiful.  However, there seems to be some haloing around the people, maybe a little heavy handed on the sharpening.', '2008-01-23 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419022, 636153, 56658, '<td valign="top">love it. gritty, daunting, spooky, scarry and a light at the end of the tunnel, what more can you want?</td>', 'love it. gritty, daunting, spooky, scarry and a light at the end of the tunnel, what more can you want?', '2008-01-23 19:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419034, 635932, 7743, '<td valign="top">Exposure looks good and you''ve got good catch lights in the eyes.  However, I think a tighter crop on the sides would make for more impact.</td>', 'Exposure looks good and you''ve got good catch lights in the eyes.  However, I think a tighter crop on the sides would make for more impact.', '2008-01-23 19:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419036, 634148, 42013, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture--reminiscent(sp) of Librodo''s lady from last year.</td>', 'Lovely texture--reminiscent(sp) of Librodo''s lady from last year.', '2008-01-23 19:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419039, 635156, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good mood, strong image.</td>', 'Good mood, strong image.', '2008-01-23 19:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419042, 634695, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  If possible though I think it would be better showing more of the outfield.  Also, the colours seem a bit off, the area around the bases seems a bit too orange.</td>', 'I like the idea.  If possible though I think it would be better showing more of the outfield.  Also, the colours seem a bit off, the area around the bases seems a bit too orange.', '2008-01-23 19:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419043, 635164, 42013, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice. I''d prefer to see either more detail on the mid-ground rocks or a little less on the foreground ones. I like the shapes.</td>', 'Simple but nice. I''d prefer to see either more detail on the mid-ground rocks or a little less on the foreground ones. I like the shapes.', '2008-01-23 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419048, 636141, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the drama in the clouds, however I think a more vertical crop would improve the image.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the drama in the clouds, however I think a more vertical crop would improve the image.', '2008-01-23 19:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419050, 634758, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great layering. soft light with just a hint of the BG.</td>', 'Great layering. soft light with just a hint of the BG.', '2008-01-23 19:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419056, 635717, 56658, '<td valign="top">interesting. I like that he is in the shadows and his being framed by the door.</td>', 'interesting. I like that he is in the shadows and his being framed by the door.', '2008-01-23 19:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419059, 635420, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the mood set by this image.  However, I think more beach (less sky) and a slightly lower angle would give the image more impact.</td>', 'I like the mood set by this image.  However, I think more beach (less sky) and a slightly lower angle would give the image more impact.', '2008-01-23 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419065, 635808, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good placement of the boat however I think using a landscape presentation with a leading line of the beach to the boat would give more impact.</td>', 'Good placement of the boat however I think using a landscape presentation with a leading line of the beach to the boat would give more impact.', '2008-01-23 19:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419109, 634394, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oooh, an image with sound, I can hear it.  A dark image like this will always suffer, scorewise, from poor-voter-monitor-calibration-syndrome.  You took a risk.  I wish the lovely silouette didn''t compete with so many other lines like the horizon and the docks, so I will imagine they aren''t there and score the image-that-cold-have-been, a perfect sillouette on the water and the sky at sunset with the gentle sound of recorder music.  8 without the dock</td>', 'Oooh, an image with sound, I can hear it.  A dark image like this will always suffer, scorewise, from poor-voter-monitor-calibration-syndrome.  You took a risk.  I wish the lovely silouette didn''t compete with so many other lines like the horizon and the docks, so I will imagine they aren''t there and score the image-that-cold-have-been, a perfect sillouette on the water and the sky at sunset with the gentle sound of recorder music.  8 without the dock', '2008-01-23 20:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419113, 634489, 2764, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there in the day time.  Why does it look more powerful at night in your photo?  Maybe because the black and white isolates the crushing power of the water and makes the humans on the edge look very fragile?  You made the falls beautiful but pretty scarey too.</td>', 'I''ve been there in the day time.  Why does it look more powerful at night in your photo?  Maybe because the black and white isolates the crushing power of the water and makes the humans on the edge look very fragile?  You made the falls beautiful but pretty scarey too.', '2008-01-23 20:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419114, 633413, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours are beautiful.  Putting the beach on more of a diagonal I think would add to the impact of the image.  The people are a nice addition in the foreground.</td>', 'The colours are beautiful.  Putting the beach on more of a diagonal I think would add to the impact of the image.  The people are a nice addition in the foreground.', '2008-01-23 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419117, 635159, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice soft background though maybe just a little more DOF to help with the sharpness of the bird.  Good placement of the flower in the frame and wonderful stop action for the bird.  Not too sure about the plastic look of the flowers though.</td>', 'Nice soft background though maybe just a little more DOF to help with the sharpness of the bird.  Good placement of the flower in the frame and wonderful stop action for the bird.  Not too sure about the plastic look of the flowers though.', '2008-01-23 20:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419121, 635473, 7743, '<td valign="top">Though the perspective is wonky due to the use of an ultra wide angle lens, I like it.  Good drama in the sky too.  The horse may be taking up a bit too much space though, as it competes too much with the barn (red roof) and the sky for attention.</td>', 'Though the perspective is wonky due to the use of an ultra wide angle lens, I like it.  Good drama in the sky too.  The horse may be taking up a bit too much space though, as it competes too much with the barn (red roof) and the sky for attention.', '2008-01-23 20:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419159, 635123, 57032, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing of the water by the greenery.  Not too sure I like the halo around the tops of the trees, but it does help add some depth between them and the mountains.  Very nice sharpness to the mountains and a great, glassy reflection.</td>', 'I really like the framing of the water by the greenery.  Not too sure I like the halo around the tops of the trees, but it does help add some depth between them and the mountains.  Very nice sharpness to the mountains and a great, glassy reflection.', '2008-01-23 20:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419161, 632966, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the thick border for this image, even though it leaves less "image" space to work with.  The sky is gorgeous, and the sidewalk is beautifully composed in a nice S to pull the eye throughout the image.  In addition, the trees on the left nicely keep the eye within the image.  A simple image, but nice to look at and it would probably look great up on the wall.</td>', 'I like the thick border for this image, even though it leaves less "image" space to work with.  The sky is gorgeous, and the sidewalk is beautifully composed in a nice S to pull the eye throughout the image.  In addition, the trees on the left nicely keep the eye within the image.  A simple image, but nice to look at and it would probably look great up on the wall.', '2008-01-23 20:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419164, 635503, 57032, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice B&amp;W portrait, with great sharpness throughout the face and gorgeous skin.  Nice job of keeping the exposure in check.</td>', 'This is a really nice B&W portrait, with great sharpness throughout the face and gorgeous skin.  Nice job of keeping the exposure in check.', '2008-01-23 20:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419169, 633288, 57032, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  If the dust wasn''t there, it would be much too cluttered.  However, you''ve used the dust as a natural backdrop behind the zebra.  Great contrast to the image, and nice composition; I think including the heads of the zebras on the right helps to show there are more to come, without panning out to show everything (which would lose all the detail).</td>', 'This is a great shot.  If the dust wasn''t there, it would be much too cluttered.  However, you''ve used the dust as a natural backdrop behind the zebra.  Great contrast to the image, and nice composition; I think including the heads of the zebras on the right helps to show there are more to come, without panning out to show everything (which would lose all the detail).', '2008-01-23 20:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419171, 633056, 57032, '<td valign="top">One of the nice things about photography is that you can see things that you wouldn''t see with our unassisted vision alone.  We cannot "see" a water droplet frozen in time, nor can we see such a close-up of an insect without the help of lenses.<br/> <br/>You''ve done a great job of capturing this extreme macro.  Absolutely beautiful saturated colours, and nice sharpness where it needs to be.  Good job.</td>', 'One of the nice things about photography is that you can see things that you wouldn''t see with our unassisted vision alone.  We cannot "see" a water droplet frozen in time, nor can we see such a close-up of an insect without the help of lenses. You''ve done a great job of capturing this extreme macro.  Absolutely beautiful saturated colours, and nice sharpness where it needs to be.  Good job.', '2008-01-23 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419179, 634540, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and I think the black borders on the sides help reinforce the "Big brother" idea of the huge mural  "watching over" the child.  Nice exposure throughout and good detail in the bricks.<br/> <br/>I think just as interesting would be a tight crop in on the child and the doll it looks like she just dropped.</td>', 'Great composition, and I think the black borders on the sides help reinforce the "Big brother" idea of the huge mural  "watching over" the child.  Nice exposure throughout and good detail in the bricks. I think just as interesting would be a tight crop in on the child and the doll it looks like she just dropped.', '2008-01-23 20:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419187, 633382, 57032, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t figure out whether the title was some sort of double entendre to the guy with the phone (or maybe the couple together), or if it was simply a last minute title based only on the store in the background.<br/> <br/>Good use of foreground, middle ground, and background elements.  The contrast is good here, too.</td>', 'I couldn''t figure out whether the title was some sort of double entendre to the guy with the phone (or maybe the couple together), or if it was simply a last minute title based only on the store in the background. Good use of foreground, middle ground, and background elements.  The contrast is good here, too.', '2008-01-23 20:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419198, 635829, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice scene, but I can''t help thinking that it could use a bit of processing help. some simple levels would help a good bit IMO.</td>', 'nice scene, but I can''t help thinking that it could use a bit of processing help. some simple levels would help a good bit IMO.', '2008-01-23 20:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419199, 634257, 57032, '<td valign="top">I really like the emotion in her eyes here.  It''s a shame she didn''t have her head tilted up slightly, as it might have put more life into her eyes.  Nonetheless, she still looks ready to come at you, so you''ve done a great job of capturing an emotional moment.<br/> <br/>The image is well titled, has nice colours, and good focus.  Great job.</td>', 'I really like the emotion in her eyes here.  It''s a shame she didn''t have her head tilted up slightly, as it might have put more life into her eyes.  Nonetheless, she still looks ready to come at you, so you''ve done a great job of capturing an emotional moment. The image is well titled, has nice colours, and good focus.  Great job.', '2008-01-23 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419202, 635151, 56658, '<td valign="top">very nice. I really like the pastel colors and the composition as well. good job.</td>', 'very nice. I really like the pastel colors and the composition as well. good job.', '2008-01-23 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419220, 634278, 7969, '<td valign="top">I have not idea what you have done here, tho I think you have come up with a creative image that really works. It looks like it has depth.  Hope you tell us what this is :  )</td>', 'I have not idea what you have done here, tho I think you have come up with a creative image that really works. It looks like it has depth.  Hope you tell us what this is :  )', '2008-01-23 20:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419222, 635178, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, I love how crisp the image is.</td>', 'Very nice focus, I love how crisp the image is.', '2008-01-23 20:54:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4419223, 634491, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, I have to wonder if he is real or even alive.</td>', 'Cool perspective, I have to wonder if he is real or even alive.', '2008-01-23 20:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419225, 635670, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow looks very cold. I like the coloring.</td>', 'Wow looks very cold. I like the coloring.', '2008-01-23 20:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419226, 636118, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice capture your timing was right on here!</td>', 'Nice capture your timing was right on here!', '2008-01-23 20:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419227, 634430, 19978, '<td valign="top">Incredible. From "head to toe," an absolutely perfect shot. I can''t imagine who she is or what she''s thinking, but I want to know! This shot seems to oooze personality and charm. The flexing toes, the hands in the pockets, the slightly cocked angle of the head and ooh, that facial expression. This shot is a tour de force. Larger than life. Whoever she is, I hope the parents have a framed 16x24 on their wall!!</td>', 'Incredible. From "head to toe," an absolutely perfect shot. I can''t imagine who she is or what she''s thinking, but I want to know! This shot seems to oooze personality and charm. The flexing toes, the hands in the pockets, the slightly cocked angle of the head and ooh, that facial expression. This shot is a tour de force. Larger than life. Whoever she is, I hope the parents have a framed 16x24 on their wall!!', '2008-01-23 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419228, 635146, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good use of the foreground.  The colors look very nice.</td>', 'Good use of the foreground.  The colors look very nice.', '2008-01-23 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419229, 635663, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent find in this large expanse of wheat.  The house contrasts beautifully against the field and the sky.  I like the burning in the sky you''ve done here, and the sepia works very well.</td>', 'Excellent find in this large expanse of wheat.  The house contrasts beautifully against the field and the sky.  I like the burning in the sky you''ve done here, and the sepia works very well.', '2008-01-23 20:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419232, 635994, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, I love how the colors are so strong yet the image is so soft.</td>', 'Nice macro, I love how the colors are so strong yet the image is so soft.', '2008-01-23 20:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419235, 634672, 41802, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflection.  The coloring is wonderful.  Good night time shot.</td>', 'Awesome reflection.  The coloring is wonderful.  Good night time shot.', '2008-01-23 20:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419237, 635967, 41802, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece.  I like how the image is composed.</td>', 'Interesting piece.  I like how the image is composed.', '2008-01-23 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419242, 634491, 57032, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is one nasty looking bug.<br/> <br/>Nonetheless, you''ve captured it perfectly.  You''ve framed it in a way that makes me believe the bug is actually checking out the view (great title, by the way) and enjoying it!<br/> <br/>Colours are great, contrast is excellent, and the sharpness is bang-on.  Very well done.</td>', 'Wow.  That is one nasty looking bug. Nonetheless, you''ve captured it perfectly.  You''ve framed it in a way that makes me believe the bug is actually checking out the view (great title, by the way) and enjoying it! Colours are great, contrast is excellent, and the sharpness is bang-on.  Very well done.', '2008-01-23 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419243, 636216, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I wish there was a little more focus so we could see the buildings in a little more detail.</td>', 'Nice shot, I wish there was a little more focus so we could see the buildings in a little more detail.', '2008-01-23 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419244, 633077, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very intense, an in-your-face shot. I love the close crop. The colors are just as stunning as the expression on her face. The eyes are a little too sharp and well defined, but oh, what eyes! Startlingly good!</td>', 'Very intense, an in-your-face shot. I love the close crop. The colors are just as stunning as the expression on her face. The eyes are a little too sharp and well defined, but oh, what eyes! Startlingly good!', '2008-01-23 20:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419246, 634975, 41802, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the boats, I would be curious to see this shot from a little lower of an angle.</td>', 'I like the capture of the boats, I would be curious to see this shot from a little lower of an angle.', '2008-01-23 20:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419248, 635736, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice job creating visual dissonance. What are they doing there??</td>', 'Very nice job creating visual dissonance. What are they doing there??', '2008-01-23 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419249, 634400, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of black and white, it really draws out the lines of the photo.</td>', 'Nice choice of black and white, it really draws out the lines of the photo.', '2008-01-23 20:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419253, 634329, 19978, '<td valign="top">For DPC old-timers, this is a theme that has proven its worth time and time again, yet you''ve brought a fresh look and feel to it. I love the golden hues and the overall colors. It''s a stunner for sure. Great job, bumping up!</td>', 'For DPC old-timers, this is a theme that has proven its worth time and time again, yet you''ve brought a fresh look and feel to it. I love the golden hues and the overall colors. It''s a stunner for sure. Great job, bumping up!', '2008-01-23 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419255, 635300, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the eyes.  I am curious as to the subtle lines running horizontally through the photo.</td>', 'Nice focus on the eyes.  I am curious as to the subtle lines running horizontally through the photo.', '2008-01-23 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419257, 635693, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow another great shot, I can''t wait to go here one day.  Nice capture of the lines and the natural flow.</td>', 'Wow another great shot, I can''t wait to go here one day.  Nice capture of the lines and the natural flow.', '2008-01-23 21:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419261, 636081, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow you have made such a fierce creator look soft and cuddly.</td>', 'Wow you have made such a fierce creator look soft and cuddly.', '2008-01-23 21:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419265, 636046, 41802, '<td valign="top">I really like the image, maybe it is me but it looks like the bride and girl have a green tint.</td>', 'I really like the image, maybe it is me but it looks like the bride and girl have a green tint.', '2008-01-23 21:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419266, 635256, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I love how smooth everything is.</td>', 'Cool shot, I love how smooth everything is.', '2008-01-23 21:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419272, 634701, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  You have nailed the environment.  The photo looks like something on a poster.</td>', 'Great capture.  You have nailed the environment.  The photo looks like something on a poster.', '2008-01-23 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419276, 635432, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, it looks so prefect it almost looks unreal.  Nice job capturing the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Very nice shot, it looks so prefect it almost looks unreal.  Nice job capturing the reflection in the water.', '2008-01-23 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419282, 633443, 7969, '<td valign="top">really lovely shot, my only sort of critique would be I wish the horizon was not so in the middle.</td>', 'really lovely shot, my only sort of critique would be I wish the horizon was not so in the middle.', '2008-01-23 21:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419283, 635508, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  I still love seeing these.  I like the little island you were able to capture.</td>', 'Cool photo.  I still love seeing these.  I like the little island you were able to capture.', '2008-01-23 21:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419290, 634295, 41802, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot because it feels incomplete.  Great use of lines and color.</td>', 'I really like this shot because it feels incomplete.  Great use of lines and color.', '2008-01-23 21:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419295, 635841, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great shot being able to use natural lighting to create a photo.  The coloring is wonderful.</td>', 'Great shot being able to use natural lighting to create a photo.  The coloring is wonderful.', '2008-01-23 21:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419302, 635863, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow amazing timing.  I like the composition it really allows us to focus in.</td>', 'Wow amazing timing.  I like the composition it really allows us to focus in.', '2008-01-23 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419304, 634128, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I like the include of the foreground to give us more depth.</td>', 'Great capture.  I like the include of the foreground to give us more depth.', '2008-01-23 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419316, 634861, 41802, '<td valign="top">What a cute baby.  I bet this a shot mom and family will treasure forever.</td>', 'What a cute baby.  I bet this a shot mom and family will treasure forever.', '2008-01-23 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419320, 635834, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice job of putting the viewer right in the environment.  I would maybe crop the sky down some and play up the rule of thirds. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice job of putting the viewer right in the environment.  I would maybe crop the sky down some and play up the rule of thirds. Nice work.', '2008-01-23 21:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419323, 636135, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I wish the reflection of the beat up truck wasn''t in the door panel.  Good use of color.</td>', 'Nice shot, I wish the reflection of the beat up truck wasn''t in the door panel.  Good use of color.', '2008-01-23 21:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419330, 633932, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like how sharp the focus is.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like how sharp the focus is.', '2008-01-23 21:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419334, 634112, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great use of elements to create a feeling, the coloring matches up perfectly.</td>', 'Great use of elements to create a feeling, the coloring matches up perfectly.', '2008-01-23 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419338, 634385, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great vintage shot, I really love the overall effect.  I would have probably score a point higher if the line in the wall wasn''t on the right side it just takes away from the image a little.</td>', 'Great vintage shot, I really love the overall effect.  I would have probably score a point higher if the line in the wall wasn''t on the right side it just takes away from the image a little.', '2008-01-23 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419340, 634108, 41802, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the guys in this shot.  I wish the flower was in focus as well.</td>', 'Excellent focus on the guys in this shot.  I wish the flower was in focus as well.', '2008-01-23 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419342, 634988, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool shot from above.  The coloring is prefect.  I might try and crop the image more so we have it on the thirds but nice work.</td>', 'Cool shot from above.  The coloring is prefect.  I might try and crop the image more so we have it on the thirds but nice work.', '2008-01-23 21:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419345, 633652, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow absolutely awesome! I hope you get a score that you deserver.  This shot seems prefect to me!</td>', 'Wow absolutely awesome! I hope you get a score that you deserver.  This shot seems prefect to me!', '2008-01-23 21:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419348, 636005, 41802, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot to express how important lighting is in the photography world.  Great choice of black and white!</td>', 'What a cool shot to express how important lighting is in the photography world.  Great choice of black and white!', '2008-01-23 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419359, 635824, 41802, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, the border really grabbed my attention.</td>', 'I like the photo, the border really grabbed my attention.', '2008-01-23 21:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419364, 634912, 7743, '<td valign="top">I think you have the start of a good idea here.  The leading line of the furrow isn''t quite prominent enough (IMO) but could be if the image were taken from a higher angle.  Also, there would be more emphasis on the hay bale if the sky were cloudless.  Somethings you have no control over though. ;o)</td>', 'I think you have the start of a good idea here.  The leading line of the furrow isn''t quite prominent enough (IMO) but could be if the image were taken from a higher angle.  Also, there would be more emphasis on the hay bale if the sky were cloudless.  Somethings you have no control over though. ;o)', '2008-01-23 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419365, 636163, 41802, '<td valign="top">What an excellent shot! WOW I love how crisp this piece is.</td>', 'What an excellent shot! WOW I love how crisp this piece is.', '2008-01-23 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419369, 632946, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of the image.  Good expression on the lion''s face and I think it was a good choice to have the fence partly visible.</td>', 'I like the mood of the image.  Good expression on the lion''s face and I think it was a good choice to have the fence partly visible.', '2008-01-23 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419373, 634348, 41802, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus.  Great job squaring up the subject.</td>', 'Excellent focus.  Great job squaring up the subject.', '2008-01-23 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419374, 636023, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love the tight crop on this.</td>', 'I love the tight crop on this.', '2008-01-23 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419377, 636230, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! The coloring is awesome!</td>', 'Nice shot! The coloring is awesome!', '2008-01-23 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419378, 634679, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers and a beautiful photo of them. I always love diagonal compositions.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers and a beautiful photo of them. I always love diagonal compositions.', '2008-01-23 21:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419380, 635229, 43774, '<td valign="top">So colourful and detailed. Very nice composition.</td>', 'So colourful and detailed. Very nice composition.', '2008-01-23 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419381, 634128, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful, especially the colours.</td>', 'Really beautiful, especially the colours.', '2008-01-23 21:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419382, 636114, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and reflections. If only it were that calm around here!</td>', 'Lovely colours and reflections. If only it were that calm around here!', '2008-01-23 21:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419383, 636163, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stop action photography, so clear.</td>', 'Wonderful stop action photography, so clear.', '2008-01-23 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419384, 634365, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the high key effect here.  One nitpick though, the little bush on the left.  If you could have, one step to the right would probably have provided the separation needed between the bush and the building.</td>', 'I like the high key effect here.  One nitpick though, the little bush on the left.  If you could have, one step to the right would probably have provided the separation needed between the bush and the building.', '2008-01-23 21:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419385, 635923, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the focus is very nice.  I love the expression.</td>', 'Great shot, the focus is very nice.  I love the expression.', '2008-01-23 21:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419386, 635450, 43774, '<td valign="top">So dramatic!</td>', 'So dramatic!', '2008-01-23 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419389, 634462, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow cool composition.  Great timing on the shot.</td>', 'Wow cool composition.  Great timing on the shot.', '2008-01-23 21:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419391, 634672, 43774, '<td valign="top">That blue is just beautiful, the ships are lovely and all look illuminated.</td>', 'That blue is just beautiful, the ships are lovely and all look illuminated.', '2008-01-23 21:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419392, 635461, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, awe inspiring scenery, captured well.</td>', 'Beautiful, awe inspiring scenery, captured well.', '2008-01-23 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419395, 633144, 43774, '<td valign="top">Exposure on the water is perfect, a wonderful, beautiful photo.</td>', 'Exposure on the water is perfect, a wonderful, beautiful photo.', '2008-01-23 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419396, 634509, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very interesting to have one in light and one not.</td>', 'Nice shot, very interesting to have one in light and one not.', '2008-01-23 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419399, 633476, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait.  Good use of lighting and composition.</td>', 'Cool portrait.  Good use of lighting and composition.', '2008-01-23 21:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
