(4419710, 632976, 29477, '<td valign="top">The hot on the rump on the left is very distracting.  Still a wonderful capture.  Wish the DoF was a little deeper allowing for all four to be nice and crisp.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'The hot on the rump on the left is very distracting.  Still a wonderful capture.  Wish the DoF was a little deeper allowing for all four to be nice and crisp.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-23 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419715, 635926, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very neat looking. Perhaps a closer crop may have had a bit more "pow", but it still very good.</td>', 'Very neat looking. Perhaps a closer crop may have had a bit more "pow", but it still very good.', '2008-01-23 23:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419719, 636114, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great deep colors. This belongs on a calendar.</td>', 'Great deep colors. This belongs on a calendar.', '2008-01-23 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419722, 633167, 76217, '<td valign="top">I like how you kept the detail on the pole, particularly the butt end, to give the silhouetted fisherman depth. I think the plastic bag hurts the image (or at least the fact that it looks like a plastic bag).</td>', 'I like how you kept the detail on the pole, particularly the butt end, to give the silhouetted fisherman depth. I think the plastic bag hurts the image (or at least the fact that it looks like a plastic bag).', '2008-01-23 23:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419727, 634861, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and executed.  An image that will always be a very special memory.  Focus is bang on.  I may have tried to minimize the wasted space on the right and ensure that the mother''s entire head was captured.  The pose will have filed the entire image and still supported the rule of thirds.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'Nicely composed and executed.  An image that will always be a very special memory.  Focus is bang on.  I may have tried to minimize the wasted space on the right and ensure that the mother''s entire head was captured.  The pose will have filed the entire image and still supported the rule of thirds.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-23 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419728, 635555, 76217, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF in this image. I even like the whites in the eyes.</td>', 'I like the DOF in this image. I even like the whites in the eyes.', '2008-01-23 23:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4419735, 634148, 29477, '<td valign="top">Incredible stories this lady has to tell.  Great emotion and I like the cropping.  Unforetunately, the focus is not has crisp as I would like to see to score really high. Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Incredible stories this lady has to tell.  Great emotion and I like the cropping.  Unforetunately, the focus is not has crisp as I would like to see to score really high. Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-23 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
