(4420915, 633288, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge, as I love the way the zebras seem to fade into the mist. I think it might even be stronger with a squarish-crop (without the two zebra heads coming in on the right) but that is a stylistic choice, not really a nit. Anyway, wonderful work! 9.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge, as I love the way the zebras seem to fade into the mist. I think it might even be stronger with a squarish-crop (without the two zebra heads coming in on the right) but that is a stylistic choice, not really a nit. Anyway, wonderful work! 9.', '2008-01-24 10:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420916, 635734, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Look at all those colors. 9 because it looks just a tad over-processed to me, but a breathtaking scene with wonderful DOF.</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Look at all those colors. 9 because it looks just a tad over-processed to me, but a breathtaking scene with wonderful DOF.', '2008-01-24 10:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
