(4420951, 636214, 2764, '<td valign="top">MMM - My first 10!  This is amazing!  All those shapes!  Little crystals up front, slabs of ice contasting with the rounder rocks with the little round cloud shapes on the distance.  Perfect colors, blacks for the ice. white for the sky .  nevermind, I''m not saying anything you don''t know - I love it.</td>', 'MMM - My first 10!  This is amazing!  All those shapes!  Little crystals up front, slabs of ice contasting with the rounder rocks with the little round cloud shapes on the distance.  Perfect colors, blacks for the ice. white for the sky .  nevermind, I''m not saying anything you don''t know - I love it.', '2008-01-24 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4420952, 633779, 66597, '<td valign="top">Scalvert? Beautiful lighting on Stonehenge - makes for a magical capture. 8.</td>', 'Scalvert? Beautiful lighting on Stonehenge - makes for a magical capture. 8.', '2008-01-24 10:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
