(4422515, 634349, 65234, '<td valign="top">He''s aged well!  Nice angle to get the painting in the shot.  White balance looks a little yellow but that''s translating as a warm light, which is kind of nice.</td>', 'He''s aged well!  Nice angle to get the painting in the shot.  White balance looks a little yellow but that''s translating as a warm light, which is kind of nice.', '2008-01-24 18:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
