(4422523, 635828, 8637, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!  Very nice.  Composition is great.</td>', 'Oh yeah!  Very nice.  Composition is great.', '2008-01-24 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4422524, 634717, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice color and I like the cloud formations and composition.  The white of the buildings is very bright and really draws my eye, but then there''s not much detail there so I don''t know if you want my eye drawn there.</td>', 'Nice color and I like the cloud formations and composition.  The white of the buildings is very bright and really draws my eye, but then there''s not much detail there so I don''t know if you want my eye drawn there.', '2008-01-24 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
