(4424503, 633984, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think an appropriate background for this would have helped add more interest, like perhaps a burlap sack. The capture of the beans though, is really good. You caught a lot of great detail and the whole appearance of them is appealing. I want a cup of coffee now.</td>', 'I think an appropriate background for this would have helped add more interest, like perhaps a burlap sack. The capture of the beans though, is really good. You caught a lot of great detail and the whole appearance of them is appealing. I want a cup of coffee now.', '2008-01-25 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4424511, 636172, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of these. Very sharp and clear, though as artistic photography, it''s not doing it for me. Perhaps by cropping in on just one of the fawns. Maybe. I dunno.</td>', 'I like the capture of these. Very sharp and clear, though as artistic photography, it''s not doing it for me. Perhaps by cropping in on just one of the fawns. Maybe. I dunno.', '2008-01-25 13:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4424514, 634462, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot - i love the title - the placement to the far most right really works - especially with the lines leading to its head</td>', 'Wonderful shot - i love the title - the placement to the far most right really works - especially with the lines leading to its head', '2008-01-25 13:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4424527, 634509, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette, but the rear end of the other horse distracts me from it. I think a closer crop would work better, but overall, this is good and a unique view.</td>', 'I like the silhouette, but the rear end of the other horse distracts me from it. I think a closer crop would work better, but overall, this is good and a unique view.', '2008-01-25 13:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
