(4424552, 635721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like brushstrokes!  The bits of the white birds really stand out nicely in contrast.  The egrets (I think they are) seem somewhat envious of the bird flying over.  Really quite an interesting photograph.</td>', 'Like brushstrokes!  The bits of the white birds really stand out nicely in contrast.  The egrets (I think they are) seem somewhat envious of the bird flying over.  Really quite an interesting photograph.', '2008-01-25 13:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
