(4424613, 633095, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those three pine trees just seem so perfect - acting kind of like guards to the cabin, or at least keeping it company.  What a lovely place!</td>', 'Those three pine trees just seem so perfect - acting kind of like guards to the cabin, or at least keeping it company.  What a lovely place!', '2008-01-25 13:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
