(4424623, 634709, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here. I hope you make some notes that I can sse after this challenge is over. This is just awesome.  One of my infrequent 10''s.</td>', 'There''s a story here. I hope you make some notes that I can sse after this challenge is over. This is just awesome.  One of my infrequent 10''s.', '2008-01-25 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
