(4424675, 633007, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit busy, the subject is not clear. I think putting the boat a little off center to the right might help. Also appears to be not terribly crisp, as if it is a severe crop.</td>', 'A bit busy, the subject is not clear. I think putting the boat a little off center to the right might help. Also appears to be not terribly crisp, as if it is a severe crop.', '2008-01-25 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
