(4425029, 635664, 56658, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The colors are nice and subtle. Too bad the lighting was not so great and you got the noise int he shadows. not photo killing noise though. I think I would have either cropped the person on the left or burned them some more. Although we have learned from past DQs that you can''t burn them completly though so maybe a crop is you best bet.</td>', 'I like the composition. The colors are nice and subtle. Too bad the lighting was not so great and you got the noise int he shadows. not photo killing noise though. I think I would have either cropped the person on the left or burned them some more. Although we have learned from past DQs that you can''t burn them completly though so maybe a crop is you best bet.', '2008-01-25 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
