(4425064, 632923, 66515, '<td valign="top">This has a great painterly feeling to it. I love the clouds. Monochrome really works well here! Moody and dark while still retaining good detail throughout. <br/>I''d definitely be happy to have this up on my wall. (This one actually gave me shivers when I saw it!)</td>', 'This has a great painterly feeling to it. I love the clouds. Monochrome really works well here! Moody and dark while still retaining good detail throughout. I''d definitely be happy to have this up on my wall. (This one actually gave me shivers when I saw it!)', '2008-01-25 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425065, 635488, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that the monochrome works here. I would suspect that there is some great colors in the sky and in the water that are probably quite nice. The composition works well here and takes the eye throughout the frame.</td>', 'I am not sure that the monochrome works here. I would suspect that there is some great colors in the sky and in the water that are probably quite nice. The composition works well here and takes the eye throughout the frame.', '2008-01-25 17:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425066, 634583, 66515, '<td valign="top">The clouds are almost oversharpened. Not quite though... The result is great. I would clone out the bird on the left hand side above the horizon as it just looks like a distracting speck from this distance.</td>', 'The clouds are almost oversharpened. Not quite though... The result is great. I would clone out the bird on the left hand side above the horizon as it just looks like a distracting speck from this distance.', '2008-01-25 17:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
