(4425269, 636157, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image doesn''t appeal to me. Sorry.  It is a little flat and the focus is soft.  If possible, I think I may have liked to see the road cover more of the image, i.e. start in the bottom left and move to the upper right, but I am assuming that is possible.  Also, since the title pulls my attention to the road, I may have gotten a little dirty and got really low to expand the perception of the road and have the horizion higher in the image.  Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'Image doesn''t appeal to me. Sorry.  It is a little flat and the focus is soft.  If possible, I think I may have liked to see the road cover more of the image, i.e. start in the bottom left and move to the upper right, but I am assuming that is possible.  Also, since the title pulls my attention to the road, I may have gotten a little dirty and got really low to expand the perception of the road and have the horizion higher in the image.  Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-25 20:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
