(4425275, 635576, 29477, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this image a few times now and still struggle with how to score it.  I like the colour of the building and the focus is good.  I find there isn''t enough contrast between the building and the sky and they kind of bleed into each other.I am really not one for overprocessing of the sky, but some burning and added contast may have punched up the building.  Good Luck. 5.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 00:24:30.</i></td>', 'I have looked at this image a few times now and still struggle with how to score it.  I like the colour of the building and the focus is good.  I find there isn''t enough contrast between the building and the sky and they kind of bleed into each other.I am really not one for overprocessing of the sky, but some burning and added contast may have punched up the building.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-25 20:53:33.000000', '2008-01-28 00:24:30.000000', 1),
(4425277, 635628, 74979, '<td valign="top">intersting image...without your title I never would have worked that out mentally<br/>very nice abstract, almost ice like in its appearance, and the bg colors give this depth as well as a sense of testures as the rain distorts the items</td>', 'intersting image...without your title I never would have worked that out mentallyvery nice abstract, almost ice like in its appearance, and the bg colors give this depth as well as a sense of testures as the rain distorts the items', '2008-01-25 20:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
