(4425295, 635306, 74979, '<td valign="top">good choice for B&amp;W, this image.  I like the mixed emotions among the faces, and the varying degrees of attention, including the "salute", but all are taking a moment to acknowledge freedom, and possibly the cost of being "free"</td>', 'good choice for B&W, this image.  I like the mixed emotions among the faces, and the varying degrees of attention, including the "salute", but all are taking a moment to acknowledge freedom, and possibly the cost of being "free"', '2008-01-25 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425296, 636163, 51747, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Should make a cover for a magazine.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Should make a cover for a magazine.', '2008-01-25 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425297, 634561, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great reflection in the water.  May have had the horizon a little higher with a small amount of sky as the the focus is definitely on the reflection.  Also the mountain needs some contrast as a lot of sections are  a little bleached, especially on the left side of the image.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Great reflection in the water.  May have had the horizon a little higher with a small amount of sky as the the focus is definitely on the reflection.  Also the mountain needs some contrast as a lot of sections are  a little bleached, especially on the left side of the image.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-25 21:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425300, 635717, 29477, '<td valign="top">Good use of thirds,  may have pulled back a bit to include the entire surface that he is working from.  Some curve adjustments and tweaking of the shadows could have added some more contrast.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Good use of thirds,  may have pulled back a bit to include the entire surface that he is working from.  Some curve adjustments and tweaking of the shadows could have added some more contrast.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-25 21:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425302, 633413, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful sunset;  the couple in the corner, the title, hmm, seems kinda dramatic for such an itherwise lovely &amp; peaceful moment</td>', 'beautiful sunset;  the couple in the corner, the title, hmm, seems kinda dramatic for such an itherwise lovely & peaceful moment', '2008-01-25 21:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425304, 636153, 51747, '<td valign="top">Real nice image of E.S.P. I actually like the tilt.</td>', 'Real nice image of E.S.P. I actually like the tilt.', '2008-01-25 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425305, 633382, 29477, '<td valign="top">Your title wants me to focus on the sign, but your image has me focus on the backs of the people...backs aren''t very exciting unless they are naked with some side lighting and shadows.  Nothing exciting here.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'Your title wants me to focus on the sign, but your image has me focus on the backs of the people...backs aren''t very exciting unless they are naked with some side lighting and shadows.  Nothing exciting here.  Sorry. Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-25 21:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425314, 634210, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and great perspective. The flash grabs to much of the ramp on the left wich draws me away from the subject.  Definitely should have burned that area to tone down the brigthness.  Still a great effort.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'Nicely captured and great perspective. The flash grabs to much of the ramp on the left wich draws me away from the subject.  Definitely should have burned that area to tone down the brigthness.  Still a great effort.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-25 21:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
