(4425319, 634230, 74979, '<td valign="top">love the PP and event he tones to this image, just not sure why he is wearing eyeshades LOL</td>', 'love the PP and event he tones to this image, just not sure why he is wearing eyeshades LOL', '2008-01-25 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425325, 635737, 29477, '<td valign="top">This image does nothing for me.  Sorry.  The sky definitely has some depth, but the capture of the bird is so far away that it just looks like a snapshot. I understand that the title wants to show the isolation, but you need to have some more details.  Also, it looks like the bird is flying from the left to the right.  Use of thirds and place the bird on the left giving a better perspective of where the bird is going may have helped.  Good Luck. 3.</td>', 'This image does nothing for me.  Sorry.  The sky definitely has some depth, but the capture of the bird is so far away that it just looks like a snapshot. I understand that the title wants to show the isolation, but you need to have some more details.  Also, it looks like the bird is flying from the left to the right.  Use of thirds and place the bird on the left giving a better perspective of where the bird is going may have helped.  Good Luck. 3.', '2008-01-25 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425326, 634871, 74979, '<td valign="top">OH!! excellent capture of living in the city..i love the textures and the lines, the age of the building, the grafitti, Sal himself, this has so many stories in it<br/>really well done and well seen!</td>', 'OH!! excellent capture of living in the city..i love the textures and the lines, the age of the building, the grafitti, Sal himself, this has so many stories in itreally well done and well seen!', '2008-01-25 21:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425330, 636181, 29477, '<td valign="top">This is like those images where if you stare at it long enough crazy things begin to happen.  Nicely done.  Very simple and decent result.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'This is like those images where if you stare at it long enough crazy things begin to happen.  Nicely done.  Very simple and decent result.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-25 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425335, 635283, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and convesion to B&amp;W...Sky looks unnatural and bleached, takes away from your result.  Focus could be a little sharper as well.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Nice angle and convesion to B&W...Sky looks unnatural and bleached, takes away from your result.  Focus could be a little sharper as well.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-25 21:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
