(4425615, 633161, 29477, '<td valign="top">Thanks for using thirds with the horizon...way to many images with the horizon across the middle. Nice colours and sky.  Image is too blurry for DPCers.  Did you use a tripod?  If not, then recomend you invest in one as it will dramtically improve these shots.  If you did, then you may want to get a remote (if availible) so you aren''t touching the shutter on the camera.  Good Luck. 5.</td>', 'Thanks for using thirds with the horizon...way to many images with the horizon across the middle. Nice colours and sky.  Image is too blurry for DPCers.  Did you use a tripod?  If not, then recomend you invest in one as it will dramtically improve these shots.  If you did, then you may want to get a remote (if availible) so you aren''t touching the shutter on the camera.  Good Luck. 5.', '2008-01-25 23:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
