(4425632, 634733, 29477, '<td valign="top">The one drawback to me unforetunately is the Blue Eyes.  You have captured a <b>beautiful image </b>and if it was her eyes you wanted to capture then you should have left it in colour and tweaked the blues. I personally would have done the B&amp;W and tried to punch up the contrast a little more.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'The one drawback to me unforetunately is the Blue Eyes.  You have captured a beautiful image and if it was her eyes you wanted to capture then you should have left it in colour and tweaked the blues. I personally would have done the B&W and tried to punch up the contrast a little more.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-25 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
