(4425697, 635463, 29477, '<td valign="top">I saw the thumbnail and got excited, however the full image is a little disappointing.  Would have preferred no people of one (the child) or maybe two (i.e. a couple).  The image seems grainy and the processing is bleaching sections of the sky. If there was not people, I may have lowered the horizon a little more to capture additonal sky.  The B&amp;W border is not necessary when you are trying to emphasize the rich yellows and oranges IMO.  Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'I saw the thumbnail and got excited, however the full image is a little disappointing.  Would have preferred no people of one (the child) or maybe two (i.e. a couple).  The image seems grainy and the processing is bleaching sections of the sky. If there was not people, I may have lowered the horizon a little more to capture additonal sky.  The B&W border is not necessary when you are trying to emphasize the rich yellows and oranges IMO.  Good Luck. 6.', '2008-01-25 23:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
