(4425746, 634368, 29477, '<td valign="top">I love eagles!!! Great focuse and detail.  Wish the lighting was a little better to make the yellow in the beak and eye pop out.  Still a good job.  Good Luck. 7.</td>', 'I love eagles!!! Great focuse and detail.  Wish the lighting was a little better to make the yellow in the beak and eye pop out.  Still a good job.  Good Luck. 7.', '2008-01-26 00:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
