(4425819, 632911, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the persons look/jewelry. The light seems a little bright on her forehead and I wonder if a touch of fill under her nose chin would have been nice. Not so much to soften the light, just to give a little more shape to her jaw line. 7</td>', 'I like the pose and the persons look/jewelry. The light seems a little bright on her forehead and I wonder if a touch of fill under her nose chin would have been nice. Not so much to soften the light, just to give a little more shape to her jaw line. 7', '2008-01-26 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
