(4425908, 634280, 15407, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that the very bright lights distract somewhat for me yet the price you pay is worth it for the wonderful reflection on the ''polished'' stone walkway. The warmth youve added to the tone of the picture works very well also.</td>', 'It''s too bad that the very bright lights distract somewhat for me yet the price you pay is worth it for the wonderful reflection on the ''polished'' stone walkway. The warmth youve added to the tone of the picture works very well also.', '2008-01-26 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
