(4425911, 634701, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure I care for the distorted perspective, but I really like the processing effects to show off the details.</td>', 'Not sure I care for the distorted perspective, but I really like the processing effects to show off the details.', '2008-01-26 03:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4425913, 635156, 15407, '<td valign="top">Why in the woods?  Dressed like this and with that title makes one wonder what the ''theme'' was. As attractive as the model is perhaps a "Red Riding Hood" outfit with a selective desat may have given it more of a theme.  It is a very nice photo the lighting works well... I have given it some real thought as to what you may have tried to covey with this photo and have to believe that it may have been your intent to leave that bit of wonderment to the viewer... If that is the case you have accomplished that with me.</td>', 'Why in the woods?  Dressed like this and with that title makes one wonder what the ''theme'' was. As attractive as the model is perhaps a "Red Riding Hood" outfit with a selective desat may have given it more of a theme.  It is a very nice photo the lighting works well... I have given it some real thought as to what you may have tried to covey with this photo and have to believe that it may have been your intent to leave that bit of wonderment to the viewer... If that is the case you have accomplished that with me.', '2008-01-26 03:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
