(4426326, 635274, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally wish the horse''s shilouette was maybe at a slighly different angle, and thus more defined and clear. On the other hand, I do appreciate your creativity here, and that this is not the typical profile silhouette. But, although I immediately reckognized the figures as a horse and a person, I wish I could see a more defined shape of the horse. Right now he''s a mass of black shapes and hair. Perhaps if the horse''s head had been turned towards the person... but yes, I know, you can''t just ask the horse, "Will you please tilt your head this way... no, more. Up a little, now with more of an angle... yes, just like that..." ;D <br/> <br/>Just a thought. overall I really like this image a lot, and the colors are lovely! :)</td>', 'I personally wish the horse''s shilouette was maybe at a slighly different angle, and thus more defined and clear. On the other hand, I do appreciate your creativity here, and that this is not the typical profile silhouette. But, although I immediately reckognized the figures as a horse and a person, I wish I could see a more defined shape of the horse. Right now he''s a mass of black shapes and hair. Perhaps if the horse''s head had been turned towards the person... but yes, I know, you can''t just ask the horse, "Will you please tilt your head this way... no, more. Up a little, now with more of an angle... yes, just like that..." ;D  Just a thought. overall I really like this image a lot, and the colors are lovely! :)', '2008-01-26 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
