(4427640, 635340, 29477, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that the long shadow came into to play (obviously something you couldn''t control. Focus is not has sharp as I would like especially for Elephant shots.  Good Luck. 4.</td>', 'It''s too bad that the long shadow came into to play (obviously something you couldn''t control. Focus is not has sharp as I would like especially for Elephant shots.  Good Luck. 4.', '2008-01-26 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
