(4427938, 635526, 18197, '<td valign="top">The composition well follows classic rule-of-thirds guidelines. I like high contrast images, generally, and the contrast appeals to me. Technicals (focus, DOF, et al) are fine. My personal issue with the image is the subject, which isn''t very interesting to me ... or at least doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'The composition well follows classic rule-of-thirds guidelines. I like high contrast images, generally, and the contrast appeals to me. Technicals (focus, DOF, et al) are fine. My personal issue with the image is the subject, which isn''t very interesting to me ... or at least doesn''t hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427943, 635269, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual perspective on a lighthouse. Focus is good. DOF is good. The halo effect may be from the sun behind it, but IMO detracts. Saturation is good. Contrast is good. My personal issue with it is that the subject is weak, or at least fails to hold my interest.</td>', 'This is an unusual perspective on a lighthouse. Focus is good. DOF is good. The halo effect may be from the sun behind it, but IMO detracts. Saturation is good. Contrast is good. My personal issue with it is that the subject is weak, or at least fails to hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427945, 634295, 18197, '<td valign="top">I very much like the colors and the reflections! It conveys an impressionistic feeling which I like. But compared to other entries, the subject feels weak to me, or at least fails to hold my interest.</td>', 'I very much like the colors and the reflections! It conveys an impressionistic feeling which I like. But compared to other entries, the subject feels weak to me, or at least fails to hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427946, 635954, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, I get the shell, the bottom, the water. Light on the bottom is nice. Colors on the shell are nice. Composition is okay. But the subject fails to hold my interest.</td>', 'Okay, I get the shell, the bottom, the water. Light on the bottom is nice. Colors on the shell are nice. Composition is okay. But the subject fails to hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427950, 633754, 18197, '<td valign="top">I live in Seattle and find the subject familiar and pleasing. But it isn''t a subject that holds my interest. Turn your photography skills toward a stronger subject, and I think you''ll do well here.</td>', 'I live in Seattle and find the subject familiar and pleasing. But it isn''t a subject that holds my interest. Turn your photography skills toward a stronger subject, and I think you''ll do well here.', '2008-01-27 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
