(4427955, 635651, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait, pretty model, good composition. It might be just a bit over exposed, and I can''t ignore the distracting catchlights in her eyes.</td>', 'Interesting portrait, pretty model, good composition. It might be just a bit over exposed, and I can''t ignore the distracting catchlights in her eyes.', '2008-01-27 01:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427959, 636177, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot ... right place, right time. Degree of difficulty is great. In the end, it feels flat to me, however. If focus were sharper on the players, it would go up several points in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice action shot ... right place, right time. Degree of difficulty is great. In the end, it feels flat to me, however. If focus were sharper on the players, it would go up several points in my opinion.', '2008-01-27 01:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427964, 633001, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can see why you liked this subject, I like it too! But it looks to me like you''ve gone overboard with editing ... possibly an HDR experiment ... leaving distracting halos around the building and to a lesser degree, the wagon. HDR seems to be the wave of the future, but I''d suggest backing off a bit.</td>', 'I can see why you liked this subject, I like it too! But it looks to me like you''ve gone overboard with editing ... possibly an HDR experiment ... leaving distracting halos around the building and to a lesser degree, the wagon. HDR seems to be the wave of the future, but I''d suggest backing off a bit.', '2008-01-27 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427969, 634033, 18197, '<td valign="top">This evoked a strong emotional reaction in me.  The focus and exposure on the dolls is perfect. Perhaps it was on purpose, but the model feels a bit over exposed. If her focus and exposure were as good as the dolls, it would go up a couple of notches for me.</td>', 'This evoked a strong emotional reaction in me.  The focus and exposure on the dolls is perfect. Perhaps it was on purpose, but the model feels a bit over exposed. If her focus and exposure were as good as the dolls, it would go up a couple of notches for me.', '2008-01-27 01:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427971, 633273, 18197, '<td valign="top">Evocative of childhood dreams. Nicely done.</td>', 'Evocative of childhood dreams. Nicely done.', '2008-01-27 01:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427974, 633098, 48963, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. 10</td>', 'Awesome photo. 10', '2008-01-27 01:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427975, 633999, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, colors, saturation, focus, ... This feels like a painting to me ... maybe an impressionist, Gaugan perhaps? ... but the editing has taken it beyond the realm of a photograph. It will certainly have a strong following, but not a wide one I fear.</td>', 'Very nice composition, colors, saturation, focus, ... This feels like a painting to me ... maybe an impressionist, Gaugan perhaps? ... but the editing has taken it beyond the realm of a photograph. It will certainly have a strong following, but not a wide one I fear.', '2008-01-27 01:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427980, 633309, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cleaver idea. Composition is very good. Focus is good. But the choice of subject fails to hold my interest.</td>', 'Cleaver idea. Composition is very good. Focus is good. But the choice of subject fails to hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427983, 635227, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fibonacci would be proud. As a math guy, I can appreciate it. The degree of difficulty here is fairly high and you pulled it off vry well. But as an observer of your photo, I find it doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Fibonacci would be proud. As a math guy, I can appreciate it. The degree of difficulty here is fairly high and you pulled it off vry well. But as an observer of your photo, I find it doesn''t hold my interest.', '2008-01-27 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427989, 633054, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a photo that no one will have no opinion about. I like the velvet feel of the night. I like the stars. I like the composition. Bumping my previous score.</td>', 'This is a photo that no one will have no opinion about. I like the velvet feel of the night. I like the stars. I like the composition. Bumping my previous score.', '2008-01-27 01:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427991, 632978, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely lovely family photo. If I knew the people in the photo, it could become a treasured photo. Your title implies an ending, which would be superbly sad. But I don''t know the people or understand the context, and without that, it is less significant to me. Standing alone in the voting, I fear it will not score up to your emotional hopes for it.</td>', 'This is an absolutely lovely family photo. If I knew the people in the photo, it could become a treasured photo. Your title implies an ending, which would be superbly sad. But I don''t know the people or understand the context, and without that, it is less significant to me. Standing alone in the voting, I fear it will not score up to your emotional hopes for it.', '2008-01-27 01:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427994, 634686, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic cultural moment you''ve captured. But for me, too busy to fully appreciate.</td>', 'Fantastic cultural moment you''ve captured. But for me, too busy to fully appreciate.', '2008-01-27 01:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4427996, 635156, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good composition, but weak focus IMO.</td>', 'Good idea, good composition, but weak focus IMO.', '2008-01-27 01:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428000, 633065, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have taken so many pictures of buildings, looking up at them from the ground, ... as recently as two days ago. I always fall in love with the photo and fail to realize it''s just another building from the ground. Well executed, but subject lets you down.</td>', 'I have taken so many pictures of buildings, looking up at them from the ground, ... as recently as two days ago. I always fall in love with the photo and fail to realize it''s just another building from the ground. Well executed, but subject lets you down.', '2008-01-27 01:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428070, 635578, 48963, '<td valign="top">cool photo, but the eyes look a little fake or something.</td>', 'cool photo, but the eyes look a little fake or something.', '2008-01-27 03:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
