(4428491, 635174, 67258, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful!  i haven''t measured it, but the bridge does have the appeaance of sloping down to the right, which I find does slightly detract from the overall impression, but nonetheless, a lovely photo.<br/> <br/>Edit:  Back for some final views - I have measured the slope, which is non-existant and a figment of my imagination.  Time to get my eyes checked!  Bumped to 8.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful!  i haven''t measured it, but the bridge does have the appeaance of sloping down to the right, which I find does slightly detract from the overall impression, but nonetheless, a lovely photo. Edit:  Back for some final views - I have measured the slope, which is non-existant and a figment of my imagination.  Time to get my eyes checked!  Bumped to 8.', '2008-01-27 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428495, 636054, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a superb narrative there is articulated in this photo.  Excellent work -10!</td>', 'What a superb narrative there is articulated in this photo.  Excellent work -10!', '2008-01-27 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428499, 634278, 67258, '<td valign="top">An image I could look at again and again.  Works well for me.</td>', 'An image I could look at again and again.  Works well for me.', '2008-01-27 10:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428555, 634957, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shallow dof however I think this image would have more impact if it were in the vertical orientation.</td>', 'I like the use of shallow dof however I think this image would have more impact if it were in the vertical orientation.', '2008-01-27 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428556, 634679, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and use of diagonals.  The choice of black for the background makes the flowers stand out very well.</td>', 'I like the lighting and use of diagonals.  The choice of black for the background makes the flowers stand out very well.', '2008-01-27 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428558, 634462, 7743, '<td valign="top">All I can say is wonderful.  Perfect exposure on the whites.  You''ve managed to maintain a lot of detail.  The head of the bird may be just a little bit oversharpened though.</td>', 'All I can say is wonderful.  Perfect exposure on the whites.  You''ve managed to maintain a lot of detail.  The head of the bird may be just a little bit oversharpened though.', '2008-01-27 11:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428562, 635949, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice study of shape however I think the wall on the bottom left takes up a little too much of the frame.  It may work if the diagonal of the edge was more on the diagonal.</td>', 'Nice study of shape however I think the wall on the bottom left takes up a little too much of the frame.  It may work if the diagonal of the edge was more on the diagonal.', '2008-01-27 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428577, 634280, 53094, '<td valign="top">Great balance/composition, and the B&amp;W processing is very nice.</td>', 'Great balance/composition, and the B&W processing is very nice.', '2008-01-27 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428588, 634670, 53094, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are great.  I especially like the reflections in the water.</td>', 'The colors in this are great.  I especially like the reflections in the water.', '2008-01-27 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428591, 635487, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice scene though I think it would be better in a horizontal orientation.  Also, the processing seems a little over done (too cartoonish).</td>', 'Nice scene though I think it would be better in a horizontal orientation.  Also, the processing seems a little over done (too cartoonish).', '2008-01-27 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428593, 635839, 68956, '<td valign="top">I like the chaos of your image. My eye is kept as busy as those gulls, trying to find a point to rest on, there isn''t one, but I don''t think there has to be, you''ve engaged me and held me - well done :) I am wondering how this would look in black and white - have you given it a try?</td>', 'I like the chaos of your image. My eye is kept as busy as those gulls, trying to find a point to rest on, there isn''t one, but I don''t think there has to be, you''ve engaged me and held me - well done :) I am wondering how this would look in black and white - have you given it a try?', '2008-01-27 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428604, 636027, 68956, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed that you haven''t blown out the detail in that white top, lovely lighting :)</td>', 'I''m impressed that you haven''t blown out the detail in that white top, lovely lighting :)', '2008-01-27 11:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428610, 635340, 53094, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo is almost perfect.  The colors &amp; textures, the composition are sooooo nice.  What magnificent animals!</td>', 'To me, this photo is almost perfect.  The colors & textures, the composition are sooooo nice.  What magnificent animals!', '2008-01-27 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428614, 636122, 68956, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery, but the couple look wrong, as though they''ve been pasted on there :)</td>', 'Nice scenery, but the couple look wrong, as though they''ve been pasted on there :)', '2008-01-27 11:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428621, 635164, 53094, '<td valign="top">Incredible beauty!  The reflections in the calm water are beautiful.  The wide angle vantage points works very well.</td>', 'Incredible beauty!  The reflections in the calm water are beautiful.  The wide angle vantage points works very well.', '2008-01-27 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428641, 634368, 53094, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the eye and feathers.  Very good DOF.  I like the amount of saturation you''ve used in this photo.</td>', 'Nice detail in the eye and feathers.  Very good DOF.  I like the amount of saturation you''ve used in this photo.', '2008-01-27 11:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428647, 635617, 53094, '<td valign="top">Nice textures.  I think this would make a good B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'Nice textures.  I think this would make a good B&W as well.', '2008-01-27 11:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4428650, 634581, 87538, '<td valign="top">Kudzu, or ivy, is just not that exciting. A different angle might have rendered a more sparkling image.</td>', 'Kudzu, or ivy, is just not that exciting. A different angle might have rendered a more sparkling image.', '2008-01-27 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
