(4428671, 634033, 33535, '<td valign="top">the best of the lot!<br/>great concept and execution, I''ll come back to see who''s the genious<br/>10 and my blue!</td>', 'the best of the lot!great concept and execution, I''ll come back to see who''s the genious10 and my blue!', '2008-01-27 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
