(4428680, 636086, 77192, '<td valign="top">It might be the monitor, but his skin looks quite pale and harshly lit. Nice composition, contrasting between blue of eyes and the writing on the wall.</td>', 'It might be the monitor, but his skin looks quite pale and harshly lit. Nice composition, contrasting between blue of eyes and the writing on the wall.', '2008-01-27 12:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
