(4428942, 634385, 50695, '<td valign="top">That was the year I graduated. I meant to come back. But I couldn''t bear to look at where I''d been through that window. Sometimes, you would be so impatient for the phone to ring that you would stop staring at the phone and stare at the pole outside, as though you could catch a hint of the signal before it reached the house. We were both trapped. The window framed us both.</td>', 'That was the year I graduated. I meant to come back. But I couldn''t bear to look at where I''d been through that window. Sometimes, you would be so impatient for the phone to ring that you would stop staring at the phone and stare at the pole outside, as though you could catch a hint of the signal before it reached the house. We were both trapped. The window framed us both.', '2008-01-27 13:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
