(4429209, 634929, 2553, '<td valign="top">Just don''t know where I''m at with this one.  I''ve been back to look at it several times before I comment.  I like the overall softness with just the area of her head in focus, and the burned in corners, but really have trouble with the "black" aspect of it.  I would like to have seen the entire horse in the image, or alternatively, a much closer crop on her head/face and the horse''s head.  <br/> <br/>This seems to convey to me the concept of black/evil in the world, and I am not comfortable with that. Would I have been OK with a white horse and white angel?  Yes, most likely I would have been.  Is that ridiculous? Well, maybe to someone else, but that''s how I feel.  (I did not vote it "down" because of how it comes across to me, but rather on it''s effectiveness as an image (in my opinion), and gave it a 7).</td>', 'Just don''t know where I''m at with this one.  I''ve been back to look at it several times before I comment.  I like the overall softness with just the area of her head in focus, and the burned in corners, but really have trouble with the "black" aspect of it.  I would like to have seen the entire horse in the image, or alternatively, a much closer crop on her head/face and the horse''s head.   This seems to convey to me the concept of black/evil in the world, and I am not comfortable with that. Would I have been OK with a white horse and white angel?  Yes, most likely I would have been.  Is that ridiculous? Well, maybe to someone else, but that''s how I feel.  (I did not vote it "down" because of how it comes across to me, but rather on it''s effectiveness as an image (in my opinion), and gave it a 7).', '2008-01-27 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
