(4429326, 636146, 2553, '<td valign="top">Oh what a nice black and white image!  The composition seems perfect for this, and the men are nice and sharp, really draws your eye there. I love the whole mood of this image.</td>', 'Oh what a nice black and white image!  The composition seems perfect for this, and the men are nice and sharp, really draws your eye there. I love the whole mood of this image.', '2008-01-27 15:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429328, 634956, 2553, '<td valign="top">A beautifully done and very tender image.  Love the sharpness of their faces.</td>', 'A beautifully done and very tender image.  Love the sharpness of their faces.', '2008-01-27 15:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429329, 635794, 24550, '<td valign="top">i like the minimalistic feel, but the structure in the background is too soft to add to the image, and yet its presence detracts from the minimalistic feel. still, 7.</td>', 'i like the minimalistic feel, but the structure in the background is too soft to add to the image, and yet its presence detracts from the minimalistic feel. still, 7.', '2008-01-27 15:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429330, 635536, 74979, '<td valign="top">ooh what lovely colors on these 2 guys..sonice they play together even though they are diff species...</td>', 'ooh what lovely colors on these 2 guys..sonice they play together even though they are diff species...', '2008-01-27 15:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429331, 632911, 2553, '<td valign="top">While quite lovely, I feel this lacks some sharpness in the features to really make it a stand out image.</td>', 'While quite lovely, I feel this lacks some sharpness in the features to really make it a stand out image.', '2008-01-27 15:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429332, 635982, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love images of horses running and jumping, and this is very nice!  It doesn''t look like he is fenced in either - he must be a very good boy.</td>', 'I love images of horses running and jumping, and this is very nice!  It doesn''t look like he is fenced in either - he must be a very good boy.', '2008-01-27 15:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429333, 634543, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice image; really surprised that I like it in black and white.</td>', 'Very nice image; really surprised that I like it in black and white.', '2008-01-27 15:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429334, 635566, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful scene.  I am amazed at how orderly and organized everything looks.  The starburst-looking lights are really the kicker for this image.</td>', 'Quite a beautiful scene.  I am amazed at how orderly and organized everything looks.  The starburst-looking lights are really the kicker for this image.', '2008-01-27 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429335, 636081, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of this fine looking cat, and beautiful color. I like the OOF background, but I find all the lines there to be somewhat distracting - my eyes are drawn to that area of the image, and away from the main subject.</td>', 'Lovely capture of this fine looking cat, and beautiful color. I like the OOF background, but I find all the lines there to be somewhat distracting - my eyes are drawn to that area of the image, and away from the main subject.', '2008-01-27 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429336, 635967, 24550, '<td valign="top">since the cross here is the focal point of the image, it would have helped it if the image was rotated to level the horizontal bar of the cross.</td>', 'since the cross here is the focal point of the image, it would have helped it if the image was rotated to level the horizontal bar of the cross.', '2008-01-27 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429337, 635514, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, and I like the darkened edges, but would like to have seen just a teeny bit more light on the face.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, and I like the darkened edges, but would like to have seen just a teeny bit more light on the face.', '2008-01-27 15:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429338, 635696, 2553, '<td valign="top">Can I just say- adorable!  Love this capture.  It''s almost like you weren''t even there.</td>', 'Can I just say- adorable!  Love this capture.  It''s almost like you weren''t even there.', '2008-01-27 15:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429340, 634959, 2553, '<td valign="top">A very successful image IMO.  Nice lighting, coloring and comp.</td>', 'A very successful image IMO.  Nice lighting, coloring and comp.', '2008-01-27 15:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429344, 635317, 74979, '<td valign="top">amazing landscape</td>', 'amazing landscape', '2008-01-27 15:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429345, 633157, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this, but really had to look at it to decide what it was.  At first glance it looked like artists charcoals standing on a reflective surface.  I believe it to be pilings in the water.  This image has a somewhat mysterious feel to it for me.</td>', 'I like this, but really had to look at it to decide what it was.  At first glance it looked like artists charcoals standing on a reflective surface.  I believe it to be pilings in the water.  This image has a somewhat mysterious feel to it for me.', '2008-01-27 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429347, 634703, 24550, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors.</td>', 'wonderful colors.', '2008-01-27 15:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429348, 635669, 74979, '<td valign="top">ooh!  I have just seen and photgraphed these guys for the first time here in S Dakota!  really great shot!  I coul dnever get this close!</td>', 'ooh!  I have just seen and photgraphed these guys for the first time here in S Dakota!  really great shot!  I coul dnever get this close!', '2008-01-27 15:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429350, 632911, 24550, '<td valign="top">i like what you were going for, but the lighting on the face seems a bit too harsh to me. also, the thick border takes away from the photo, though i do like the blue color of the thin border that matches the beads around her neck.</td>', 'i like what you were going for, but the lighting on the face seems a bit too harsh to me. also, the thick border takes away from the photo, though i do like the blue color of the thin border that matches the beads around her neck.', '2008-01-27 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429351, 635487, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the PP, and would love to have seen the image with far less trees in it, they really distract me.  The boat/water/shoreline part is wonderful, and I feel like I would have cropped the upper trees out.</td>', 'Love the PP, and would love to have seen the image with far less trees in it, they really distract me.  The boat/water/shoreline part is wonderful, and I feel like I would have cropped the upper trees out.', '2008-01-27 15:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429352, 635529, 74979, '<td valign="top">wonder who tags these guys?? nice to see these!</td>', 'wonder who tags these guys?? nice to see these!', '2008-01-27 15:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429354, 636071, 24550, '<td valign="top">i wish this had been exposed a bit more so i could see the details in the surroundings.</td>', 'i wish this had been exposed a bit more so i could see the details in the surroundings.', '2008-01-27 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429357, 633430, 24550, '<td valign="top">seems a bit overprocessed to my eye. the police in the background do add an element of intrigue, however.</td>', 'seems a bit overprocessed to my eye. the police in the background do add an element of intrigue, however.', '2008-01-27 15:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429360, 635981, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely sky and water reflections...I''ve no doubt she is watching over you...<br/>I hope you are doing ok?<br/> <br/>best to you<br/>~Anni</td>', 'lovely sky and water reflections...I''ve no doubt she is watching over you...I hope you are doing ok? best to you~Anni', '2008-01-27 15:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429361, 635139, 24550, '<td valign="top">excellent sharp photo, with perhaps a bit too much glare on the eyes. still, technically great.</td>', 'excellent sharp photo, with perhaps a bit too much glare on the eyes. still, technically great.', '2008-01-27 15:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429363, 636102, 24550, '<td valign="top">haha hilarious capture.</td>', 'haha hilarious capture.', '2008-01-27 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4429364, 636114, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though this is quite beautiful, the "dead centered" comp doesn''t work for me, especially since it is nearly centered both horizontally and vertically.  Maybe a bit off of the right side and the foreground.</td>', 'Though this is quite beautiful, the "dead centered" comp doesn''t work for me, especially since it is nearly centered both horizontally and vertically.  Maybe a bit off of the right side and the foreground.', '2008-01-27 15:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429366, 634542, 74979, '<td valign="top">you captured this really well, the ighting looks like it could have been easy to not get right...great colors to this also.</td>', 'you captured this really well, the ighting looks like it could have been easy to not get right...great colors to this also.', '2008-01-27 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429369, 634672, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but very centered. Sometimes it''s great, but doesn''t work for me here.  Looks like really calm water.</td>', 'Very pretty, but very centered. Sometimes it''s great, but doesn''t work for me here.  Looks like really calm water.', '2008-01-27 15:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429370, 635635, 24550, '<td valign="top">this would be a lot better with the bottom of the window level with the photograph, and perhaps a bit more contrast. not sure what the black and white treatment is for, as i feel that the multicolored jackets of the children would make for a far more interesting foreground.</td>', 'this would be a lot better with the bottom of the window level with the photograph, and perhaps a bit more contrast. not sure what the black and white treatment is for, as i feel that the multicolored jackets of the children would make for a far more interesting foreground.', '2008-01-27 15:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429373, 634709, 74979, '<td valign="top">wonderful expression</td>', 'wonderful expression', '2008-01-27 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429374, 633762, 24550, '<td valign="top">fantastic symmetry and the dual tone processing gives it a "sci fi" feel. plus i am struggling to figure out what''s actually depicted here. perhaps an elevator shaft of some sort? well shot.</td>', 'fantastic symmetry and the dual tone processing gives it a "sci fi" feel. plus i am struggling to figure out what''s actually depicted here. perhaps an elevator shaft of some sort? well shot.', '2008-01-27 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429375, 635819, 74979, '<td valign="top">brings to mind Tater of <i>Cars</i>; i like how you PPd this  it suits the image well</td>', 'brings to mind Tater of Cars; i like how you PPd this  it suits the image well', '2008-01-27 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429378, 634679, 2553, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful flowers.  I like the border treatment, but don''t like the flowers outside the border - gives me an off-balance feeling.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful flowers.  I like the border treatment, but don''t like the flowers outside the border - gives me an off-balance feeling.', '2008-01-27 15:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429379, 635673, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and nice and sharp.  I cannot decide if the blue is water, or sky.  Water, I guess.  I''m interested to see where this was taken.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and nice and sharp.  I cannot decide if the blue is water, or sky.  Water, I guess.  I''m interested to see where this was taken.', '2008-01-27 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429380, 636096, 2553, '<td valign="top">Yikes, this makes my stomach do flips just looking at it.  Pretty cool capture though.</td>', 'Yikes, this makes my stomach do flips just looking at it.  Pretty cool capture though.', '2008-01-27 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429381, 635576, 24550, '<td valign="top">love the tones and the way the sky blends in with the architecture.</td>', 'love the tones and the way the sky blends in with the architecture.', '2008-01-27 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429382, 633443, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice in an abstract kind of way.  The b&amp;w treatment is perfect for it, and I do love all the lines and angles.</td>', 'Very nice in an abstract kind of way.  The b&w treatment is perfect for it, and I do love all the lines and angles.', '2008-01-27 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429383, 634232, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I like the tone, and the softness, but I guess I''m not certain about the "story" the image is trying to tell.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I like the tone, and the softness, but I guess I''m not certain about the "story" the image is trying to tell.', '2008-01-27 15:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429386, 635458, 74979, '<td valign="top">that is some old guitar!!  looks like it is full of memories...</td>', 'that is some old guitar!!  looks like it is full of memories...', '2008-01-27 15:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429388, 635554, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful catch.  Don''t care for the busyness of the grass, but what can you do?</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful catch.  Don''t care for the busyness of the grass, but what can you do?', '2008-01-27 15:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429390, 635955, 24550, '<td valign="top">is this a civil war re-enactment? could do with a lot more contrast between foreground and background, and the two-tone processing i feel takes away from the image. should be processed and shot in a way to make the "body" in the foreground pop.</td>', 'is this a civil war re-enactment? could do with a lot more contrast between foreground and background, and the two-tone processing i feel takes away from the image. should be processed and shot in a way to make the "body" in the foreground pop.', '2008-01-27 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429391, 634375, 2553, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I like this.  It seemed "cold" at first, but she has such a...well, look I guess... that it adds mystery to this.  She seems minimalized by the crop (perhaps the intention), but I would have cropped more off the left to give her more power in the image.</td>', 'For some reason, I like this.  It seemed "cold" at first, but she has such a...well, look I guess... that it adds mystery to this.  She seems minimalized by the crop (perhaps the intention), but I would have cropped more off the left to give her more power in the image.', '2008-01-27 15:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429392, 636118, 74979, '<td valign="top">great capture!  very soothing image with the natural tones to the colors</td>', 'great capture!  very soothing image with the natural tones to the colors', '2008-01-27 15:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429393, 634230, 2553, '<td valign="top">A curious image here.  I feel like this is the entrance to a church, and I wonder why the man would be sleeping in an open doorway like that, with what appears to be an eye mask on no less.  It seems very odd.  I like the feel of it, but perhaps not the centered-ness of it. Good color, good exposure, sharp, but leaves me with questions.</td>', 'A curious image here.  I feel like this is the entrance to a church, and I wonder why the man would be sleeping in an open doorway like that, with what appears to be an eye mask on no less.  It seems very odd.  I like the feel of it, but perhaps not the centered-ness of it. Good color, good exposure, sharp, but leaves me with questions.', '2008-01-27 15:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429395, 633013, 19978, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait like this really depends on the eyes to make it or break it. Since her eyes are too obscured by her expression, it loses something essential that could have really raised it to another level. I like the muted colors and her thoughtful expression. I wonder if you thought about tighter shots to her face, or even just framing it with the top of her head to the left arm? Lots of potential here, but not quite up to the transcendent level that many of these "character" studies seem to achieve.</td>', 'I think a portrait like this really depends on the eyes to make it or break it. Since her eyes are too obscured by her expression, it loses something essential that could have really raised it to another level. I like the muted colors and her thoughtful expression. I wonder if you thought about tighter shots to her face, or even just framing it with the top of her head to the left arm? Lots of potential here, but not quite up to the transcendent level that many of these "character" studies seem to achieve.', '2008-01-27 15:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429398, 634033, 19978, '<td valign="top">Definite points for concept, creativity, and effort!</td>', 'Definite points for concept, creativity, and effort!', '2008-01-27 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429400, 633971, 74979, '<td valign="top">very pretty girl, she looks very comfortable and in her element here</td>', 'very pretty girl, she looks very comfortable and in her element here', '2008-01-27 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429403, 635721, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like how most of the white birds are kind of watching what the gray/blue one is doing.  The crop doesn''t feel particularly dynamic, and though it''s a nice image, it doesn''t really jump out at me.</td>', 'I like how most of the white birds are kind of watching what the gray/blue one is doing.  The crop doesn''t feel particularly dynamic, and though it''s a nice image, it doesn''t really jump out at me.', '2008-01-27 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429404, 635882, 74979, '<td valign="top">i like thhe lighting on this little guy...and his friends in the bg, nicely composed too</td>', 'i like thhe lighting on this little guy...and his friends in the bg, nicely composed too', '2008-01-27 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429406, 633318, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hope you were using a long lens, they can be mean!  Nice capture, and I love how he posed for you.</td>', 'Hope you were using a long lens, they can be mean!  Nice capture, and I love how he posed for you.', '2008-01-27 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429407, 636177, 74979, '<td valign="top">ouch!  go Bigby!!   thats some stop action you caught there!</td>', 'ouch!  go Bigby!!   thats some stop action you caught there!', '2008-01-27 15:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429409, 635839, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this even though it seems a bit dark.  I would think all the branches in the background would distract me, but they don''t particularly.  I think because there is so much "motion" in the image - my eyes want to follow all the birds movements.  The very soft focus works for me in this.</td>', 'I like this even though it seems a bit dark.  I would think all the branches in the background would distract me, but they don''t particularly.  I think because there is so much "motion" in the image - my eyes want to follow all the birds movements.  The very soft focus works for me in this.', '2008-01-27 15:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429410, 636122, 74979, '<td valign="top">the couple here is convincing..the bg seems amost like a studio set..unbelievable water, though I have heard it is really like this...</td>', 'the couple here is convincing..the bg seems amost like a studio set..unbelievable water, though I have heard it is really like this...', '2008-01-27 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429411, 635174, 2553, '<td valign="top">Totally made my stomach drop.  Beautiful and scary.</td>', 'Totally made my stomach drop.  Beautiful and scary.', '2008-01-27 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429413, 632900, 74979, '<td valign="top">oh my goodness!  this is just adorable!  WHAT AN EXPRESSION...cant take the idea of drinking my own urine LOL..this is priceless!!</td>', 'oh my goodness!  this is just adorable!  WHAT AN EXPRESSION...cant take the idea of drinking my own urine LOL..this is priceless!!', '2008-01-27 15:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429414, 635737, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I like this idea, I think it needed more color or light in the background to give it more power and for it to really hold it''s own.</td>', 'Though I like this idea, I think it needed more color or light in the background to give it more power and for it to really hold it''s own.', '2008-01-27 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429418, 635846, 74979, '<td valign="top">excellent feel to this minimalist image..oh yes, it suure strikes me as cold...tho I think the black border takes away some</td>', 'excellent feel to this minimalist image..oh yes, it suure strikes me as cold...tho I think the black border takes away some', '2008-01-27 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429420, 633717, 24550, '<td valign="top">love the black and white and the solid white background. 7.</td>', 'love the black and white and the solid white background. 7.', '2008-01-27 16:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429421, 635498, 24550, '<td valign="top">sharp, intense eyes, good colors, and decent composition.</td>', 'sharp, intense eyes, good colors, and decent composition.', '2008-01-27 16:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429422, 633446, 24550, '<td valign="top">i like your choice of keeping the chainlink fence in the foreground. shows the isolation.</td>', 'i like your choice of keeping the chainlink fence in the foreground. shows the isolation.', '2008-01-27 16:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429424, 633007, 24550, '<td valign="top">seems overprocessed</td>', 'seems overprocessed', '2008-01-27 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429426, 634965, 24550, '<td valign="top">good night shot, exposed well, but the glare on the right side is unfortunate.</td>', 'good night shot, exposed well, but the glare on the right side is unfortunate.', '2008-01-27 16:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429427, 636172, 24550, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus.</td>', 'seems out of focus.', '2008-01-27 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429430, 632900, 24550, '<td valign="top">oh man that''s classic. too bad you couldn''t get a better view around that tree to the left ;)<br/>i can certainly see this fitting the bill for "Most Hilarious of 2007"</td>', 'oh man that''s classic. too bad you couldn''t get a better view around that tree to the left ;)i can certainly see this fitting the bill for "Most Hilarious of 2007"', '2008-01-27 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429442, 636187, 7743, '<td valign="top">Beautiful trees however I think there is not enough definition to make them stand out.  The ground luminance is too close to the luminance of the foliage.<br/> <br/>edit: to correct the fact that I think faster than I type<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-29 00:57:28.</i></td>', 'Beautiful trees however I think there is not enough definition to make them stand out.  The ground luminance is too close to the luminance of the foliage. edit: to correct the fact that I think faster than I type', '2008-01-27 16:08:52.000000', '2008-01-29 00:57:28.000000', 1),
(4429444, 633415, 74979, '<td valign="top">oh darling moment!!  this is a perfect announcement of the new little one!</td>', 'oh darling moment!!  this is a perfect announcement of the new little one!', '2008-01-27 16:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429446, 635116, 24550, '<td valign="top">i like the exposure and the viewpoin.</td>', 'i like the exposure and the viewpoin.', '2008-01-27 16:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429447, 636214, 24550, '<td valign="top">great sharpness and colors.</td>', 'great sharpness and colors.', '2008-01-27 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429448, 633996, 89401, '<td valign="top">I love this!! It''s looks like it is a still from a movie! Great Job!</td>', 'I love this!! It''s looks like it is a still from a movie! Great Job!', '2008-01-27 16:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429450, 635526, 89401, '<td valign="top">This is the Best of 2007?</td>', 'This is the Best of 2007?', '2008-01-27 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429452, 634975, 24550, '<td valign="top">it looks oversharpened to my eye.</td>', 'it looks oversharpened to my eye.', '2008-01-27 16:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429456, 633560, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty enough scene, and a breathtaking view, even the composition is pretty good but the image is lacking something for me.</td>', 'Pretty enough scene, and a breathtaking view, even the composition is pretty good but the image is lacking something for me.', '2008-01-27 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429459, 634207, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of "toning", but am not sure I really care for it in this instance.  I like the foggy scene and the trees, and I like the peaceful feeling of the image.</td>', 'I''m a fan of "toning", but am not sure I really care for it in this instance.  I like the foggy scene and the trees, and I like the peaceful feeling of the image.', '2008-01-27 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429462, 633321, 2553, '<td valign="top">There''s is so much to look at here that I have had to come back to this several times to get a better look at it before I commented.  I''m torn between wanting to see the window area closer up, and wanting the image to be a wider angle so I can see the scene in a larger context.   So many interesting textures and lines. My guess is that if you had a lot of shots of this area, you had trouble picking one for the challenge - it looks very interesting.</td>', 'There''s is so much to look at here that I have had to come back to this several times to get a better look at it before I commented.  I''m torn between wanting to see the window area closer up, and wanting the image to be a wider angle so I can see the scene in a larger context.   So many interesting textures and lines. My guess is that if you had a lot of shots of this area, you had trouble picking one for the challenge - it looks very interesting.', '2008-01-27 16:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429463, 636224, 2553, '<td valign="top">A nice image with great light, tone and texture, and very nostalgic feeling.</td>', 'A nice image with great light, tone and texture, and very nostalgic feeling.', '2008-01-27 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
