(4429773, 634239, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.  Just a couple of processing changes would have bumped your score up a ways I think.  I prefer it with more contrast, but no big deal there.  Mainly a touch of sharpening would really help.  Also, there is a lot of detail here.  I bet it would have helped quite a bit to use the full 200kb (this guy is 145kb).</td>', 'This is really beautiful.  Just a couple of processing changes would have bumped your score up a ways I think.  I prefer it with more contrast, but no big deal there.  Mainly a touch of sharpening would really help.  Also, there is a lot of detail here.  I bet it would have helped quite a bit to use the full 200kb (this guy is 145kb).', '2008-01-27 18:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
