(4429803, 636032, 52500, '<td valign="top">Everything looks so pristine with the snow and super smooth water, I think I would prefer it without the dog.  Regardless, fantastic image.  I really like the moon hanging out up there too.</td>', 'Everything looks so pristine with the snow and super smooth water, I think I would prefer it without the dog.  Regardless, fantastic image.  I really like the moon hanging out up there too.', '2008-01-27 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
