(4429905, 635507, 67258, '<td valign="top">this is a photo I have come back to time and time again.  It is intriguing and also vaguely disturbing in an undefined way.  There is a strong sense of narrative in the picture, and a curious play of inter-connected relationships.  The pose of the middle child is incredibly defensive, as though she is withdrawing into herself, and attempting to block the world  (and the photographer out) - this makes me uncomfortable, almost voyeuristic, and yet is strangely compelling.  Bumping to 10.</td>', 'this is a photo I have come back to time and time again.  It is intriguing and also vaguely disturbing in an undefined way.  There is a strong sense of narrative in the picture, and a curious play of inter-connected relationships.  The pose of the middle child is incredibly defensive, as though she is withdrawing into herself, and attempting to block the world  (and the photographer out) - this makes me uncomfortable, almost voyeuristic, and yet is strangely compelling.  Bumping to 10.', '2008-01-27 19:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
