(4429926, 634279, 77838, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot.  I could venture a guess...maybe 900-1000 sec?!  You have great color and framing here.  It makes me think of the DVD Louie Giglio produced that is called "How Great Is Our God".  I like this alot -BB<br/> <br/>P.S. Is this <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=84124" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jlanoue</a>?</td>', 'This is such a cool shot.  I could venture a guess...maybe 900-1000 sec?!  You have great color and framing here.  It makes me think of the DVD Louie Giglio produced that is called "How Great Is Our God".  I like this alot -BB P.S. Is this  jlanoue?', '2008-01-27 19:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429927, 633273, 77838, '<td valign="top">What a sweet silhouette.  His pose looks relaxed and enjoying some time to himself.  The lights in the lower left corner make this kinda feel as if he''s laying on a hill overlooking the city.  I like this. <br/> <br/>P.S. Is this <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=78516" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Wenders11</a>?</td>', 'What a sweet silhouette.  His pose looks relaxed and enjoying some time to himself.  The lights in the lower left corner make this kinda feel as if he''s laying on a hill overlooking the city.  I like this.  P.S. Is this  Wenders11?', '2008-01-27 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429932, 633970, 77838, '<td valign="top">You caught the action great!  I like how you can see him squinting as the ball hits his goggles.  This is what you could call "TAGGED!" Very cool -BB<br/> <br/>P.S. Is this <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=11510" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paintballjumper</a>?</td>', 'You caught the action great!  I like how you can see him squinting as the ball hits his goggles.  This is what you could call "TAGGED!" Very cool -BB P.S. Is this  paintballjumper?', '2008-01-27 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4429938, 633443, 77838, '<td valign="top">The black and white is very dramatic in this photo.  I like the jagged details of the rock too.  -BB<br/> <br/>P.S. Is this <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a>?</td>', 'The black and white is very dramatic in this photo.  I like the jagged details of the rock too.  -BB P.S. Is this  hotpasta?', '2008-01-27 19:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
