(4430518, 634973, 15407, '<td valign="top">Can you camp here ??? Ha just kidding... I dont see any garbage cans for the tourists to ignore!  Well I would like to ''camp here'' and set up the tripod to take a picture every 15 minutes of the day (June 22nd)... and see what I come up with... after all putting something ''attractive in front of the lens rarely hurts the photo.</td>', 'Can you camp here ??? Ha just kidding... I dont see any garbage cans for the tourists to ignore!  Well I would like to ''camp here'' and set up the tripod to take a picture every 15 minutes of the day (June 22nd)... and see what I come up with... after all putting something ''attractive in front of the lens rarely hurts the photo.', '2008-01-27 23:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430522, 633013, 15407, '<td valign="top">So very nice!</td>', 'So very nice!', '2008-01-27 23:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430525, 633950, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and the bokeh.  The sky is beautiful too.  This just evokes the feeling you get from a warm, sunny day!</td>', 'I love the perspective and the bokeh.  The sky is beautiful too.  This just evokes the feeling you get from a warm, sunny day!', '2008-01-27 23:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430535, 635832, 29009, '<td valign="top">First, congratulations on some solid technicals.  Focus/sharpening, DOF, composition, and decision to go black and white are spot-on.  With regard to the emotive aspect, this shot does tell a story to me and it makes me sad a little bit.  The animal looks abandoned and unloved and all alone, and he doesn''t even have a nice comfy spot to hang around in.  It''s the debris in the right side of the background that really adds to the scene.  Excellent work here!</td>', 'First, congratulations on some solid technicals.  Focus/sharpening, DOF, composition, and decision to go black and white are spot-on.  With regard to the emotive aspect, this shot does tell a story to me and it makes me sad a little bit.  The animal looks abandoned and unloved and all alone, and he doesn''t even have a nice comfy spot to hang around in.  It''s the debris in the right side of the background that really adds to the scene.  Excellent work here!', '2008-01-27 23:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430547, 635565, 61961, '<td valign="top">The charming subjects raise this slighty above an average snapshot.</td>', 'The charming subjects raise this slighty above an average snapshot.', '2008-01-27 23:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
