(4431297, 633996, 30982, '<td valign="top">You not only got north of 7.3, you took the blue in doing so!  A marvelous scene - very peaceful, very inviting, with a velvety finish.  What''s really neat is I can see being there - it''s very real, not manufactured.</td>', 'You not only got north of 7.3, you took the blue in doing so!  A marvelous scene - very peaceful, very inviting, with a velvety finish.  What''s really neat is I can see being there - it''s very real, not manufactured.', '2008-01-28 02:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
