(4431414, 635420, 68035, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful array of pastal colours and the reflection of the group of people in the wet sand works wonderfully.  This has the feel of an impressionist painting, so full of light. Super shot</td>', 'what a beautiful array of pastal colours and the reflection of the group of people in the wet sand works wonderfully.  This has the feel of an impressionist painting, so full of light. Super shot', '2008-01-28 03:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431415, 634385, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you entered this - thanks!</td>', 'I''m glad you entered this - thanks!', '2008-01-28 03:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431416, 633996, 20608, '<td valign="top">Wow Mark, nice blue ribbon congrats</td>', 'Wow Mark, nice blue ribbon congrats', '2008-01-28 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431420, 633717, 20608, '<td valign="top">Well I guess you fooled them all hahaha great shot well done.</td>', 'Well I guess you fooled them all hahaha great shot well done.', '2008-01-28 03:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431422, 635217, 68035, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not your best photo of 2007 but still a stand out shot.  Fantastic centred shot with the two outer escalators creating great diagonal leading lines.  I have to say I quite like the noise and movement in the shot as it compliments the urban atmosphere.  Very nice B&amp;W conversion which has picked out the metal work well</td>', 'Perhaps not your best photo of 2007 but still a stand out shot.  Fantastic centred shot with the two outer escalators creating great diagonal leading lines.  I have to say I quite like the noise and movement in the shot as it compliments the urban atmosphere.  Very nice B&W conversion which has picked out the metal work well', '2008-01-28 03:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431424, 633996, 23478, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon - I love the image!</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon - I love the image!', '2008-01-28 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431425, 634861, 47483, '<td valign="top">I did remember this shot but i could not connect your name to it.</td>', 'I did remember this shot but i could not connect your name to it.', '2008-01-28 04:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431426, 633717, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> Well I guess you fooled them all hahaha great shot well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>At least I was fooled into thinking it as MAK''s shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by MAK: Well I guess you fooled them all hahaha great shot well done.   At least I was fooled into thinking it as MAK''s shot.', '2008-01-28 04:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431428, 635581, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well for what its worth this scored a seven from me.  I love the fact that whist flowers are a popular subject in challenges this was such a different treatment to that normally seen.  Super sharpness and the B&amp;W conversion works really well to creat a deep black background against which the flowers themselves really pop<br/> <br/>Lovely shot</td>', 'Well for what its worth this scored a seven from me.  I love the fact that whist flowers are a popular subject in challenges this was such a different treatment to that normally seen.  Super sharpness and the B&W conversion works really well to creat a deep black background against which the flowers themselves really pop Lovely shot', '2008-01-28 04:17:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431429, 634462, 23478, '<td valign="top">gave this a 10 in the voting and I am delighted to see it here in the top 10 - congratulations.</td>', 'gave this a 10 in the voting and I am delighted to see it here in the top 10 - congratulations.', '2008-01-28 04:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431431, 634861, 23478, '<td valign="top">Love this image, congrats on the excellent finish.</td>', 'Love this image, congrats on the excellent finish.', '2008-01-28 04:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431434, 633652, 23478, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 10 in the voting - congrats on your strong finish.</td>', 'I gave it a 10 in the voting - congrats on your strong finish.', '2008-01-28 04:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431437, 634695, 68035, '<td valign="top">...my favourite misheard line ever!!!<br/> <br/>What a great picture of the K at night.  I have to say that nlike some people I really like the amount of sky at the top of the picture as it gives the pitch a symettrical balance<br/> <br/>Fantastic colours and generally makes me look forward to the long summer nights for the upcoming season</td>', '...my favourite misheard line ever!!! What a great picture of the K at night.  I have to say that nlike some people I really like the amount of sky at the top of the picture as it gives the pitch a symettrical balance Fantastic colours and generally makes me look forward to the long summer nights for the upcoming season', '2008-01-28 04:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431439, 634684, 30982, '<td valign="top">Eh, DQ is just an electronic thing - this is still an excellent composite and I''m certain the mom and dad will love it!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Eh, DQ is just an electronic thing - this is still an excellent composite and I''m certain the mom and dad will love it!  Nicely done.', '2008-01-28 04:22:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431440, 636023, 23478, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the excellent finish - wonderful, strong portrait - nicely done.</td>', 'Congrats on the excellent finish - wonderful, strong portrait - nicely done.', '2008-01-28 04:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431442, 635256, 23478, '<td valign="top">I really liked this in the voting and thought it would have finished better.</td>', 'I really liked this in the voting and thought it would have finished better.', '2008-01-28 04:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
