(4431553, 633906, 63267, '<td valign="top">Congrats on reaching your dream score, the top 20 finish, and most importantly on capturing such a wonderful photo!</td>', 'Congrats on reaching your dream score, the top 20 finish, and most importantly on capturing such a wonderful photo!', '2008-01-28 05:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431556, 633095, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots where I seem to have disagreed with most voters, since I was one of the two 9 votes.  I thought this was fantastic.  <br/> <br/>It seems like shots like this which seem to be about personal memories and family stories don''t do well since they often feel like those snapshots with little thought put into the composition and even less in the editing.  I love that this shot had that feel of something that probably meant a lot to the photographer, serving as a memory of a great evening with friends and family, yet it is beautiful and something worthy of hanging on a wall.  <br/> <br/>Yes, the editing feels just a bit overdone, but the scene is so wonderful that it doesn''t even matter.  And, seeing that original compared to your final image reminds me that so many shots that I would discard as useless probably have some hope and life in them.  Wonderful job with this shot!</td>', 'This is one of those shots where I seem to have disagreed with most voters, since I was one of the two 9 votes.  I thought this was fantastic.   It seems like shots like this which seem to be about personal memories and family stories don''t do well since they often feel like those snapshots with little thought put into the composition and even less in the editing.  I love that this shot had that feel of something that probably meant a lot to the photographer, serving as a memory of a great evening with friends and family, yet it is beautiful and something worthy of hanging on a wall.   Yes, the editing feels just a bit overdone, but the scene is so wonderful that it doesn''t even matter.  And, seeing that original compared to your final image reminds me that so many shots that I would discard as useless probably have some hope and life in them.  Wonderful job with this shot!', '2008-01-28 05:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431557, 633224, 63267, '<td valign="top">Good lord were you ever robbed on the voting of this image.  Those cliffs are just spectaculat. I can''t beleive they didn''t score you higher.  Still a wonderful image that I am sure would look great hanging in your office or living room.</td>', 'Good lord were you ever robbed on the voting of this image.  Those cliffs are just spectaculat. I can''t beleive they didn''t score you higher.  Still a wonderful image that I am sure would look great hanging in your office or living room.', '2008-01-28 05:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
