(4431568, 635083, 47852, '<td valign="top">I figured this shot wasn''t going to do so well, since abstracts seem to be misunderstood here on DPC, unless placed in the context of an Abstract challenge.  But 418th seems a bit low for such a gorgeous shot!  The lines and movement here, combined with the details of the leaves is superb.  The colors are fantastic, complimenting each other nicely.  Thank you for taking the risk of submitting this and sharing it with those of us who appreciate a great abstract shot.   Great job!</td>', 'I figured this shot wasn''t going to do so well, since abstracts seem to be misunderstood here on DPC, unless placed in the context of an Abstract challenge.  But 418th seems a bit low for such a gorgeous shot!  The lines and movement here, combined with the details of the leaves is superb.  The colors are fantastic, complimenting each other nicely.  Thank you for taking the risk of submitting this and sharing it with those of us who appreciate a great abstract shot.   Great job!', '2008-01-28 06:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
