(4432517, 633288, 75328, '<td valign="top">YEAH!<br/> <br/>i might of done something radical if this didn''t finish well.<br/>great job little man.</td>', 'YEAH! i might of done something radical if this didn''t finish well.great job little man.', '2008-01-28 11:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432520, 634230, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very urban feeling.</td>', 'Nice shot. Very urban feeling.', '2008-01-28 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432523, 634701, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice work Deb! I love the foreground figure.</td>', 'Nice work Deb! I love the foreground figure.', '2008-01-28 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432525, 635905, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very rhythmic feel to this. Nice.</td>', 'Very rhythmic feel to this. Nice.', '2008-01-28 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432526, 634701, 67697, '<td valign="top">I saw this in the challenge and I could not remember why it looked so familiar.  And now I know why!  The black and white make for a very striking contrast.  I love how the building reaches up into that beautiful sky.  Congrats on the high placement in the BEST OF!</td>', 'I saw this in the challenge and I could not remember why it looked so familiar.  And now I know why!  The black and white make for a very striking contrast.  I love how the building reaches up into that beautiful sky.  Congrats on the high placement in the BEST OF!', '2008-01-28 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432544, 634672, 23484, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like lines on a heart monitor. Very cool.</td>', 'Almost looks like lines on a heart monitor. Very cool.', '2008-01-28 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432548, 634491, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow Jon, almost a 6 in the BEST OF challenge - that is excellent!<br/> <br/>That is one freaky looking bug.  You did a great job with the focus on it and then using the border to tie it all together.  Look forward to seeing what you will be doing with photos this year!</td>', 'Wow Jon, almost a 6 in the BEST OF challenge - that is excellent! That is one freaky looking bug.  You did a great job with the focus on it and then using the border to tie it all together.  Look forward to seeing what you will be doing with photos this year!', '2008-01-28 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432549, 633415, 23484, '<td valign="top">Supurb shot. Black and White is perfect for this.</td>', 'Supurb shot. Black and White is perfect for this.', '2008-01-28 11:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432555, 634638, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very abstract feel. Nice job and respectable score.</td>', 'Very abstract feel. Nice job and respectable score.', '2008-01-28 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432564, 635498, 66267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by echoman:</b></div><hr/><i> the PLASTIC rose is too much and it''s PLASTIC. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Calm down, dude.</td>', 'Originally posted by echoman: the PLASTIC rose is too much and it''s PLASTIC.   Calm down, dude.', '2008-01-28 11:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432574, 633442, 29011, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Aurel78:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Techo:</b></div><hr/><i> This is wonderful. During what time of day was this taken? ND filters? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hello Techo, Yes it''s a neutral grey filter ref B+W ND 1000 (ND110) loss ten stops<br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Very cool! Thanks for the info :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Aurel78: Originally posted by Techo: This is wonderful. During what time of day was this taken? ND filters?  Hello Techo, Yes it''s a neutral grey filter ref B+W ND 1000 (ND110) loss ten stops:)   Very cool! Thanks for the info :)', '2008-01-28 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432577, 633077, 61961, '<td valign="top">One of my ten 10s.  I remember the original, too.  Very striking portrait.</td>', 'One of my ten 10s.  I remember the original, too.  Very striking portrait.', '2008-01-28 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432581, 633442, 66267, '<td valign="top">I just keep coming back to this!! Any chance of posting the original, and maybe some post processing steps for the rest of us learners?</td>', 'I just keep coming back to this!! Any chance of posting the original, and maybe some post processing steps for the rest of us learners?', '2008-01-28 11:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432585, 633066, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a sweet face!  I love seeing all that dirt all over his nose.  He has that look like he just got caught doing something bad lol.  Congrats on a 6+ photo in the BEST OF challenge!</td>', 'What a sweet face!  I love seeing all that dirt all over his nose.  He has that look like he just got caught doing something bad lol.  Congrats on a 6+ photo in the BEST OF challenge!', '2008-01-28 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432597, 635085, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 6th place photo in a tough field.  I thought this could have been a little sharper in the eyes, but I liked it so much I kept bumping it up until I had voted 10 on it anyway! Great face, I''m trying to think who he reminds me of.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 6th place photo in a tough field.  I thought this could have been a little sharper in the eyes, but I liked it so much I kept bumping it up until I had voted 10 on it anyway! Great face, I''m trying to think who he reminds me of.', '2008-01-28 11:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432610, 633224, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you entered this one - the magnificence and scale of this is wonderful to behold.  It''s quietly forceful, if that makes sense.</td>', 'I''m glad you entered this one - the magnificence and scale of this is wonderful to behold.  It''s quietly forceful, if that makes sense.', '2008-01-28 11:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432616, 635719, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=57032" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">geoffb</a> said.  I''d like to see a little less of those plants sticking up.  What I thought was cool about this photo was that the lower right branch looks like it''s making contact with the tree in the background.  Then that makes you look and realize that there are buildings back there.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'I have to agree with what  geoffb said.  I''d like to see a little less of those plants sticking up.  What I thought was cool about this photo was that the lower right branch looks like it''s making contact with the tree in the background.  Then that makes you look and realize that there are buildings back there.  Pretty cool.', '2008-01-28 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432617, 635267, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woefully neglected by voters, but at least appreciated by commenters.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Woefully neglected by voters, but at least appreciated by commenters.  Very nicely done.', '2008-01-28 11:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432618, 634861, 61961, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful photo.  The light and skintones are perfect, the white background doesn''t overwhelm, it''s got wonderful clarity without being oversharpened, and it''s not overprocessed in the least.  Lovely subjects, too.  I awarded ten 10s this round, and this was one of them.</td>', 'Really beautiful photo.  The light and skintones are perfect, the white background doesn''t overwhelm, it''s got wonderful clarity without being oversharpened, and it''s not overprocessed in the least.  Lovely subjects, too.  I awarded ten 10s this round, and this was one of them.', '2008-01-28 11:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432632, 633095, 67697, '<td valign="top">IS this the photo you were talking about?  It''s beautiful!  I love that the trees point to the gorgeous sky. You have done an amazing processing job.  What a wonderful place to spend a family vacation.  Looks like a fun area to explore.  Congrats on the 6+ score!</td>', 'IS this the photo you were talking about?  It''s beautiful!  I love that the trees point to the gorgeous sky. You have done an amazing processing job.  What a wonderful place to spend a family vacation.  Looks like a fun area to explore.  Congrats on the 6+ score!', '2008-01-28 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432633, 633714, 60701, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I''m reminded of the Vermeer painting "Girl with the pearl earring," especially the way the light reflects off the jewelry in her nose which is otherwise in shadow.  On the slight downside, I find the crop too tight - getting the impression that I''m being stared down, not just looked at.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I''m reminded of the Vermeer painting "Girl with the pearl earring," especially the way the light reflects off the jewelry in her nose which is otherwise in shadow.  On the slight downside, I find the crop too tight - getting the impression that I''m being stared down, not just looked at.', '2008-01-28 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432642, 634232, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t reach your dream score, but this is a great photo -- one of my 10s this round.  I sort of want to raise the camera half an inch, but I respect your composition.  Out of curiosity, would like to know what the black spot is above the deer on the left.  It looks like a bird is sitting on his back, but that couldn''t be so, could it?</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t reach your dream score, but this is a great photo -- one of my 10s this round.  I sort of want to raise the camera half an inch, but I respect your composition.  Out of curiosity, would like to know what the black spot is above the deer on the left.  It looks like a bird is sitting on his back, but that couldn''t be so, could it?', '2008-01-28 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432650, 634959, 61961, '<td valign="top">Jace, is this a time lapse?  It''s awesomely done no matter.  I was happy to give this one of the ten 10s I awarded this challenge (and trust me, I rarely pay much heed to flower photos!).</td>', 'Jace, is this a time lapse?  It''s awesomely done no matter.  I was happy to give this one of the ten 10s I awarded this challenge (and trust me, I rarely pay much heed to flower photos!).', '2008-01-28 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432657, 634711, 61961, '<td valign="top">As someone else said, sculptural.  I actually thought for a moment they might be statues.  This was one of the ten 10s I gave in this challenge.  Shocked to see you didn''t make the top 25 at least.</td>', 'As someone else said, sculptural.  I actually thought for a moment they might be statues.  This was one of the ten 10s I gave in this challenge.  Shocked to see you didn''t make the top 25 at least.', '2008-01-28 11:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
