(4432751, 634701, 55838, '<td valign="top">I''m sad to tell you that I sat on this image for a minute after voting on it (an 8 BTW) trying to decide whether to bump to 9 and I didn''t.  : (  Probably should have - it''s very cool - but an 8 is nothing to sneeze at!  Well done and congrats on top 40 in an impressive challenge!</td>', 'I''m sad to tell you that I sat on this image for a minute after voting on it (an 8 BTW) trying to decide whether to bump to 9 and I didn''t.  : (  Probably should have - it''s very cool - but an 8 is nothing to sneeze at!  Well done and congrats on top 40 in an impressive challenge!', '2008-01-28 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432759, 634385, 68956, '<td valign="top">Great picture - glad to have it in my favourites:)</td>', 'Great picture - glad to have it in my favourites:)', '2008-01-28 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
