(4432980, 635816, 68980, '<td valign="top">You must be kidding me. How did this end up all the way in the middle! Well, I love this shot..the gaze is mesmerizing and I love the high contrast whites..it was in my top five for this challenge for sure.</td>', 'You must be kidding me. How did this end up all the way in the middle! Well, I love this shot..the gaze is mesmerizing and I love the high contrast whites..it was in my top five for this challenge for sure.', '2008-01-28 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
