(4433036, 634121, 68980, '<td valign="top">cool comments people.. I love that I''m getting Goodman comparisons in my entries cause I just think she is amazing.. not sure how she feels about it but tough cause I''ll take it as a huge compliment!! ;)  It''s better than a ribbon I think..<br/> <br/>Thanks fer lookin.</td>', 'cool comments people.. I love that I''m getting Goodman comparisons in my entries cause I just think she is amazing.. not sure how she feels about it but tough cause I''ll take it as a huge compliment!! ;)  It''s better than a ribbon I think.. Thanks fer lookin.', '2008-01-28 13:28:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433046, 634232, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i>  Out of curiosity, would like to know what the black spot is above the deer on the left.  It looks like a bird is sitting on his back, but that couldn''t be so, could it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep. it certainly is a bird</td>', 'Originally posted by citymars:  Out of curiosity, would like to know what the black spot is above the deer on the left.  It looks like a bird is sitting on his back, but that couldn''t be so, could it?   Yep. it certainly is a bird', '2008-01-28 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433053, 633288, 68980, '<td valign="top">This is great! It''s a non typical shot of them and it really works for me.. I love Zebra''s.. such a kick ass and beautiful animal. When I was there (the Serengeti) the wildebeest and zebra were all hanging around confused because the rainy season started and then stopped.. so they were mid migration and standing around in need of a weather report!</td>', 'This is great! It''s a non typical shot of them and it really works for me.. I love Zebra''s.. such a kick ass and beautiful animal. When I was there (the Serengeti) the wildebeest and zebra were all hanging around confused because the rainy season started and then stopped.. so they were mid migration and standing around in need of a weather report!', '2008-01-28 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
