(4433623, 633224, 47906, '<td valign="top">Peter,<br/> <br/>Nice score on this lovely image, I love the feeling of power that is given by the mountains and the leading line made by the cliffs as they move away from you.<br/> <br/>I love all the details an the tones throughout the image, I was positive that it would have scored higher.<br/> <br/>Good shot,<br/>Rich</td>', 'Peter, Nice score on this lovely image, I love the feeling of power that is given by the mountains and the leading line made by the cliffs as they move away from you. I love all the details an the tones throughout the image, I was positive that it would have scored higher. Good shot,Rich', '2008-01-28 15:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433626, 635857, 57060, '<td valign="top">Good try here, I like the idea. As you can see from your comments both the colors and the noise detracted from your concept. A b&amp;W version, with improved contrast, and lower noise might be worth a try.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Good try here, I like the idea. As you can see from your comments both the colors and the noise detracted from your concept. A b&W version, with improved contrast, and lower noise might be worth a try. Jack', '2008-01-28 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
