(4433644, 634964, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, I thought I''d commented on this during voting, but apparently I do a lot of mental commenting and forget to come back.  I was glad to see you entered this - I think you have an outstanding talent for photographing people in real settings and this was one I quite liked when I first saw it.  It makes me smile - she looks slyly impish and radiates confidence.  Quite a joyful portrait!</td>', 'You know, I thought I''d commented on this during voting, but apparently I do a lot of mental commenting and forget to come back.  I was glad to see you entered this - I think you have an outstanding talent for photographing people in real settings and this was one I quite liked when I first saw it.  It makes me smile - she looks slyly impish and radiates confidence.  Quite a joyful portrait!', '2008-01-28 15:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
