(4433848, 634695, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot Charlene.  I think like others have said, this is something that would really benefit from a larger display.  There''s so much detail that had to get squashed to fit into the viewing area.  I love all the colorful colored fan dots.  The sky is beautiful and the color of the field is vibrant.  I love that there''s no blur too.</td>', 'This is a really good shot Charlene.  I think like others have said, this is something that would really benefit from a larger display.  There''s so much detail that had to get squashed to fit into the viewing area.  I love all the colorful colored fan dots.  The sky is beautiful and the color of the field is vibrant.  I love that there''s no blur too.', '2008-01-28 16:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433855, 635813, 32997, '<td valign="top">amazing that a shot that is a perfectly captured moment stands way down in line behind numerous technically strong headshots...<br/>and to be quite honest this shot does look like something I would like to have taken...<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s comment is a compliment...<br/>great shot Don...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 21:32:01.</i></td>', 'amazing that a shot that is a perfectly captured moment stands way down in line behind numerous technically strong headshots...and to be quite honest this shot does look like something I would like to have taken... Melethia''s comment is a compliment...great shot Don...', '2008-01-28 16:08:44.000000', '2008-01-28 21:32:01.000000', 0),
(4433856, 635420, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh I must have voted too fast because I do not remember this while voting.  I love the dreamy, soft effect.  It looks like the people there are floating on a cloud.  This is so cool!</td>', 'Oh I must have voted too fast because I do not remember this while voting.  I love the dreamy, soft effect.  It looks like the people there are floating on a cloud.  This is so cool!', '2008-01-28 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 0),
