(4433895, 632946, 77838, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zodiac:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a stunning image! And you gave it even more depth with the title, and the bars help with the meaning too. Thanks for sharing :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''ll have to agree totally with what was said before me.  The side profile POV is very nice.  To me your description and title are spot on!  Also the darkened bars are subtle enought that they do not distract the typical viewers eye.  Thanks for stepping out. -BB</td>', 'Originally posted by Zodiac: This is a stunning image! And you gave it even more depth with the title, and the bars help with the meaning too. Thanks for sharing :)  I''ll have to agree totally with what was said before me.  The side profile POV is very nice.  To me your description and title are spot on!  Also the darkened bars are subtle enought that they do not distract the typical viewers eye.  Thanks for stepping out. -BB', '2008-01-28 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
