(4434225, 636054, 55838, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this scored so well.  I see you are from Ithaca.  I grew up in tiny Groton, NY about 16 miles from Ithaca.  Graduated from Cornell University in 1994.  Are you attending school there by chance?  If so, TRY to stay warm!!!  : )</td>', 'I''m glad this scored so well.  I see you are from Ithaca.  I grew up in tiny Groton, NY about 16 miles from Ithaca.  Graduated from Cornell University in 1994.  Are you attending school there by chance?  If so, TRY to stay warm!!!  : )', '2008-01-28 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434230, 635788, 55838, '<td valign="top">Sad to see that this didn''t score much higher.  Great real photography - a lovely capture of a moment of life''s pleasure.  Adding to favorites.  Very well done (and it wouldn''t be the same without the blown back IMO).</td>', 'Sad to see that this didn''t score much higher.  Great real photography - a lovely capture of a moment of life''s pleasure.  Adding to favorites.  Very well done (and it wouldn''t be the same without the blown back IMO).', '2008-01-28 18:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
