(4434409, 633194, 49804, '<td valign="top">Really great job man, perfect exposure here, really nice work, gotta love this spot. added to faves.<br/> <br/>edit to add: This should have actually ribboned.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 19:11:32.</i></td>', 'Really great job man, perfect exposure here, really nice work, gotta love this spot. added to faves. edit to add: This should have actually ribboned.', '2008-01-28 19:10:29.000000', '2008-01-28 19:11:32.000000', 0),
(4434423, 634891, 49804, '<td valign="top">not sure how this did so poorly, i gave this an 8 during voting, yeah maybe the foreground is a little dark but it makes it feel surreal, a really nice job, and i was expecting 6.5+ from it, but what can you do, great shot here, very nicely done, adding to faves.</td>', 'not sure how this did so poorly, i gave this an 8 during voting, yeah maybe the foreground is a little dark but it makes it feel surreal, a really nice job, and i was expecting 6.5+ from it, but what can you do, great shot here, very nicely done, adding to faves.', '2008-01-28 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434425, 635832, 48697, '<td valign="top">I just saw this and can''t believe it got the score it did, imo it should have fared at least in the sixes.  I love the b&amp;w treatment on this shot, it really enhances the feel and emotion of the shot. Composition is nice and the focus is perfect with the background fading to smooth bokeh. I think a slight vignette on the edges might have helped a bit and a slight burning of the log to tone it down as it draws a bit of attention.  All around a nice really cool shot that you should be proud of, congrats.</td>', 'I just saw this and can''t believe it got the score it did, imo it should have fared at least in the sixes.  I love the b&w treatment on this shot, it really enhances the feel and emotion of the shot. Composition is nice and the focus is perfect with the background fading to smooth bokeh. I think a slight vignette on the edges might have helped a bit and a slight burning of the log to tone it down as it draws a bit of attention.  All around a nice really cool shot that you should be proud of, congrats.', '2008-01-28 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434440, 635788, 19708, '<td valign="top">Magic.<br/>Not much else I can add to this other than saying it again.<br/>Magic.</td>', 'Magic.Not much else I can add to this other than saying it again.Magic.', '2008-01-28 19:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434446, 634973, 14620, '<td valign="top">Well Done Eric!! :)</td>', 'Well Done Eric!! :)', '2008-01-28 19:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434450, 634695, 1024, '<td valign="top">If I had been thinking, I might have known this was yours.  I almost feel like I am right there.  I can actually hear the crack of the bat.</td>', 'If I had been thinking, I might have known this was yours.  I almost feel like I am right there.  I can actually hear the crack of the bat.', '2008-01-28 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
