(4434612, 635123, 6519, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JustinM:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JustinM:</b></div><hr/><i> This almost looks like processing that came from that new beta software "project wukong"  I''m probably wrong however. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Wow I was right </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL yes you were - try as I might to keep it "real", it still had a bit of that HDR look to it anyway. Perhaps I''ll get better with it some day, perhaps some photos simply turn out that way.</td>', 'Originally posted by JustinM: Originally posted by JustinM: This almost looks like processing that came from that new beta software "project wukong"  I''m probably wrong however.  Wow I was right  LOL yes you were - try as I might to keep it "real", it still had a bit of that HDR look to it anyway. Perhaps I''ll get better with it some day, perhaps some photos simply turn out that way.', '2008-01-28 20:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434683, 635813, 53814, '<td valign="top">Yes... this is why we have cameras.</td>', 'Yes... this is why we have cameras.', '2008-01-28 20:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434715, 635846, 36470, '<td valign="top">This is an AMAZING shot!!!!!!!!!  I would have given it a 10 for sure.</td>', 'This is an AMAZING shot!!!!!!!!!  I would have given it a 10 for sure.', '2008-01-28 20:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434754, 634365, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sonifo:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, you got that right.. (thing of beauty).  Love the tones. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These tones are on purpose, there was no other way to make it out of ordinary. I made three versions of this tone (very subtle difference) and asked my wife if she liked any. She said she did not like any of them. Well but I knew this is the right one. :-D</td>', 'Originally posted by Sonifo: Wow, you got that right.. (thing of beauty).  Love the tones.   These tones are on purpose, there was no other way to make it out of ordinary. I made three versions of this tone (very subtle difference) and asked my wife if she liked any. She said she did not like any of them. Well but I knew this is the right one. :-D', '2008-01-28 20:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4434816, 634920, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, hey.  Look at that commenter vote and you gotta love getting more 10s than 9s! Sixth best score ever, too.  Glad you entered it? :)</td>', 'Hey, hey.  Look at that commenter vote and you gotta love getting more 10s than 9s! Sixth best score ever, too.  Glad you entered it? :)', '2008-01-28 21:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
