(4434876, 635186, 32997, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful portrait, the background makes it that much more grounded for me than a studio set-up, and she is so relaxed with an element of being aware of the photographer and having the grace to know and accept herself as the subject...lovely work!</td>', 'this is a beautiful portrait, the background makes it that much more grounded for me than a studio set-up, and she is so relaxed with an element of being aware of the photographer and having the grace to know and accept herself as the subject...lovely work!', '2008-01-28 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
