(4434925, 635503, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you have the same/similar values of what really is important and submitted what YOU wanted, rather than going for the score. There is a certain thing about what we leave behind as a statement of us, in the way of sharing photographs, moments, emotions &amp; sentimental imaging should all our portfolios go poof and someone were to look at what is left - permanent challenges images as a signature. Best wishes to both of you in the years to come.<br/> <br/>Forgot to add that this is a stunning image - the connection to the person behind the eyes is strong.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 21:27:10.</i></td>', 'Nice to see you have the same/similar values of what really is important and submitted what YOU wanted, rather than going for the score. There is a certain thing about what we leave behind as a statement of us, in the way of sharing photographs, moments, emotions & sentimental imaging should all our portfolios go poof and someone were to look at what is left - permanent challenges images as a signature. Best wishes to both of you in the years to come. Forgot to add that this is a stunning image - the connection to the person behind the eyes is strong.', '2008-01-28 21:25:52.000000', '2008-01-28 21:27:10.000000', 0),
(4434932, 633468, 48115, '<td valign="top">fín mynd.. bara smá klaufa villa :D haltu áfram að pósta..</td>', 'fín mynd.. bara smá klaufa villa :D haltu áfram að pósta..', '2008-01-28 21:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
