(4443176, 636071, 60862, '<td valign="top">Yes, do keep entering edgy photos that you like.<br/> <br/>But you might want to back off a bit on your anger at the voters.  They''re entitled to their opinions.<br/> <br/>Putting those two together, enter shots like this to share them with others and see what kind of reaction you get, not for the score.<br/> <br/>BTW, in case you don''t know who Joey Lawrence is, you should be very pleased he faved this, esp. during the challenge.</td>', 'Yes, do keep entering edgy photos that you like. But you might want to back off a bit on your anger at the voters.  They''re entitled to their opinions. Putting those two together, enter shots like this to share them with others and see what kind of reaction you get, not for the score. BTW, in case you don''t know who Joey Lawrence is, you should be very pleased he faved this, esp. during the challenge.', '2008-01-31 11:04:33.000000', NULL, 0),
