(4443997, 635620, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  I think you did fairly well with the lighting.  I think there are some unfortunate highlights on the detrius around the flowers.  I like the diagonal composition though.  It is possible you could have gotten away from a mild "snapshot" feel by getting lower and shooting a little more "across" the flowers.  I like the juxtaposition of the flowers and the dead leaves, but would have preferred a different color on the leaves.  A dark brown would have been nicer.  Don''t know if they would have gone that color if you had wet things down.  Look at a picture of mine called "reincarnation" and notice the rich browns these dead leaves gave.<br/> <br/>The feel:  like I said, I like the juxtaposition between life and death.  However, appealwise, the dead leaves take away from the picture.  One possibility is to burn around the edges to make them darker.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-31 16:30:35.</i></td>', 'Technicals:  I think you did fairly well with the lighting.  I think there are some unfortunate highlights on the detrius around the flowers.  I like the diagonal composition though.  It is possible you could have gotten away from a mild "snapshot" feel by getting lower and shooting a little more "across" the flowers.  I like the juxtaposition of the flowers and the dead leaves, but would have preferred a different color on the leaves.  A dark brown would have been nicer.  Don''t know if they would have gone that color if you had wet things down.  Look at a picture of mine called "reincarnation" and notice the rich browns these dead leaves gave. The feel:  like I said, I like the juxtaposition between life and death.  However, appealwise, the dead leaves take away from the picture.  One possibility is to burn around the edges to make them darker.', '2008-01-31 16:28:08.000000', '2008-01-31 16:30:35.000000', 0),
(4444057, 633077, 62787, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 during voting. Heh, and I thought it was by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27482" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Larus</a> :)<br/>Stunning portrait work - absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 during voting. Heh, and I thought it was by  Larus :)Stunning portrait work - absolutely beautiful.', '2008-01-31 16:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
