(4444634, 636068, 23002, '<td valign="top">Hi there and greetings from the critique club. :)<br/> <br/>First of all congratulations on choosing a challenging idea to photograph.  The out of focus background is wonderful, however the large amount of stem on the left I do find distracting.  The waterdrop itself is well lit, however the hotspot to the right of it a little bit harsh.<br/> <br/>with those things considered, it is a nice minimalist photo.<br/> <br/>Ernie</td>', 'Hi there and greetings from the critique club. :) First of all congratulations on choosing a challenging idea to photograph.  The out of focus background is wonderful, however the large amount of stem on the left I do find distracting.  The waterdrop itself is well lit, however the hotspot to the right of it a little bit harsh. with those things considered, it is a nice minimalist photo. Ernie', '2008-01-31 21:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
