(4446905, 634400, 61651, '<td valign="top">Love that crazy zigzag going up the center of the stairs.  Leading lines all over the place!  Nice.</td>', 'Love that crazy zigzag going up the center of the stairs.  Leading lines all over the place!  Nice.', '2008-02-01 13:44:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4446925, 635719, 61651, '<td valign="top">Agreeing a bit with earlier commenters - a little less of the foreground and a bit more of the sky might have punctuated the sense of desolation in this shot even more than you have done here (and don''t ask me why, because honestly I don''t know, it just feels that way :) )  But this is a fine expression of those cold grey winter days, when you think all the world has packed up and left you standing there.</td>', 'Agreeing a bit with earlier commenters - a little less of the foreground and a bit more of the sky might have punctuated the sense of desolation in this shot even more than you have done here (and don''t ask me why, because honestly I don''t know, it just feels that way :) )  But this is a fine expression of those cold grey winter days, when you think all the world has packed up and left you standing there.', '2008-02-01 13:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4447170, 635713, 19708, '<td valign="top">Toning and point of view on this are outstanding!<br/>I should take lessons from you: Quality, not quantity.</td>', 'Toning and point of view on this are outstanding!I should take lessons from you: Quality, not quantity.', '2008-02-01 14:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
