(4770231, 635815, 49804, '<td valign="top">Nailed the composition, however the tones are a bit lacking and the water is a bit distracting. I think one think that could add a lot would have been to do a long exposure to smooth the water, also maybe brightening up the heron, or completely making him a silhouette, right now you can still see just a little bit of detail in him. It needs to be one or the other, nice job with the shot though.</td>', 'Nailed the composition, however the tones are a bit lacking and the water is a bit distracting. I think one think that could add a lot would have been to do a long exposure to smooth the water, also maybe brightening up the heron, or completely making him a silhouette, right now you can still see just a little bit of detail in him. It needs to be one or the other, nice job with the shot though.', '2008-06-15 22:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
