(4988573, 633309, 75585, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jettyimages:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a fantastic shot, I love it! Is it really a real frog, and how did you get it to do that? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh yes, this is our little froggy .... we have two - Frogger and Trickster :-)  It was a challenge getting him to do that - but alas, it worked out... lots of pee, crickets and burned images :-)  LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by jettyimages: This is a fantastic shot, I love it! Is it really a real frog, and how did you get it to do that?   Oh yes, this is our little froggy .... we have two - Frogger and Trickster :-)  It was a challenge getting him to do that - but alas, it worked out... lots of pee, crickets and burned images :-)  LOL', '2008-10-03 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
