(4997186, 633095, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this shot. I love the colors and the whole cabin-in-the-mountains theme. <br/> <br/>I smiled when I found that it was in Minturn, Co. For the last decade some school friends and I do a backpacking/fly fishing trip up into the Holy Cross Wilderness. The diner in Minturn (Turnstyle Diner?...it has a train theme) is always our last stop before venturing off into the wilderness. Beautiful area of the country. You really captured that with this shot. I have three shots of this area in my portfolio - on two I tried HDR for the first time to bring out the colors - but it looks a bit cartoon-ish.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really enjoy this shot. I love the colors and the whole cabin-in-the-mountains theme.  I smiled when I found that it was in Minturn, Co. For the last decade some school friends and I do a backpacking/fly fishing trip up into the Holy Cross Wilderness. The diner in Minturn (Turnstyle Diner?...it has a train theme) is always our last stop before venturing off into the wilderness. Beautiful area of the country. You really captured that with this shot. I have three shots of this area in my portfolio - on two I tried HDR for the first time to bring out the colors - but it looks a bit cartoon-ish. ', '2008-10-07 17:28:21.000000', NULL, 0),
