(5055516, 635413, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=842957" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> thread I find it both interesting and sad that this is the first image that has ''hit'' me. <br/> <br/>Sorry to hijack your image Chromeydome but I started the above thread to try and distract myself from sitting here alone remembering the events of 2 years ago. When I viewed this image for the first time it was almost two years to the minute that I received the call from hospital that I should return as my daughter <a href="//www.rosemcgill.co.uk" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Rose</a> was not going to survive till morning.<br/> <br/>This is comment # 1,000 here at dpc, sadly I''ve renamed the image ''Cancer''<br/> <br/></td>', 'Coming from this thread I find it both interesting and sad that this is the first image that has ''hit'' me.  Sorry to hijack your image Chromeydome but I started the above thread to try and distract myself from sitting here alone remembering the events of 2 years ago. When I viewed this image for the first time it was almost two years to the minute that I received the call from hospital that I should return as my daughter Rose was not going to survive till morning. This is comment # 1,000 here at dpc, sadly I''ve renamed the image ''Cancer'' ', '2008-11-10 18:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
