(5260200, 633906, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image with great perspective and lines. Captures the feel of The Wave exceptionally well.<br/> <br/>This is nitpicking but "The Wave" is actually in the Vermillion Cliffs National Monument just over into the Arizona side of the border. The expansive Grand Staircase-Escalante National Monument is next door on the Utah side of the border.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image with great perspective and lines. Captures the feel of The Wave exceptionally well. This is nitpicking but "The Wave" is actually in the Vermillion Cliffs National Monument just over into the Arizona side of the border. The expansive Grand Staircase-Escalante National Monument is next door on the Utah side of the border.', '2009-02-17 09:37:48.000000', NULL, 0),
