(5573395, 632939, 80096, '<td valign="top">This goes back a few years. Very intense eyes and amazing detail!! I wasn''t yet a member when this was submitted so I couldn''t vote but I definitely would have given this a 10. Excellent!</td>', 'This goes back a few years. Very intense eyes and amazing detail!! I wasn''t yet a member when this was submitted so I couldn''t vote but I definitely would have given this a 10. Excellent!', '2009-07-14 19:52:52.000000', NULL, 0),
