(5577182, 635507, 68504, '<td valign="top">Just saw this.  This is one great photo/capture!  Wonderful depth, fabulous feel, and I do love The Three very different Graces.  (Well, ok, it also reminds me of one time my brother and I and a friend swam from our dock in Maine out to a tiny island and back, and my dad had us stand for some pictures all dripping wet and freezing, but we were much bigger).</td>', 'Just saw this.  This is one great photo/capture!  Wonderful depth, fabulous feel, and I do love The Three very different Graces.  (Well, ok, it also reminds me of one time my brother and I and a friend swam from our dock in Maine out to a tiny island and back, and my dad had us stand for some pictures all dripping wet and freezing, but we were much bigger).', '2009-07-17 00:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5597024, 633970, 108544, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I know how hard paintball is to shoot. Especially getting shots like that. I am planning on doing the same type of shoot in the future.In studio though. Yeah, it will be a mess. Don''t worry, the neighbours are cool about the noise.  lol<br/>I would imagine your friends shocker was coated! You guys must have had fun! Keep it up!</td>', 'Great shot! I know how hard paintball is to shoot. Especially getting shots like that. I am planning on doing the same type of shoot in the future.In studio though. Yeah, it will be a mess. Don''t worry, the neighbours are cool about the noise.  lolI would imagine your friends shocker was coated! You guys must have had fun! Keep it up!', '2009-08-03 13:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605128, 634709, 100335, '<td valign="top">The thumb looked like a pirate, but i guess not :( i love it though now that i am looking at it. Great shot.</td>', 'The thumb looked like a pirate, but i guess not :( i love it though now that i am looking at it. Great shot.', '2009-08-09 20:18:46.000000', NULL, 0),
