(5642214, 634861, 47483, '<td valign="top">yesterday bought this lense. Surprised to see there is only one pic from it. It is sharp as people say and this pic shows.</td>', 'yesterday bought this lense. Surprised to see there is only one pic from it. It is sharp as people say and this pic shows.', '2009-09-09 15:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643687, 634365, 25355, '<td valign="top">Not quite a cliche shot! Cliche shots of the Taj Mahal are looking at it from straight on down the centre of the reflecting pools - yours is to the side, and that makes a difference. Plus the tones, which look great even on this crappy monitor at school.</td>', 'Not quite a cliche shot! Cliche shots of the Taj Mahal are looking at it from straight on down the centre of the reflecting pools - yours is to the side, and that makes a difference. Plus the tones, which look great even on this crappy monitor at school.', '2009-09-11 00:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5643991, 634365, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pug-H:</b></div><hr/><i> Not quite a cliche shot! Cliche shots of the Taj Mahal are looking at it from straight on down the centre of the reflecting pools - yours is to the side, and that makes a difference. Plus the tones, which look great even on this crappy monitor at school. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment, very much appreciated.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pug-H: Not quite a cliche shot! Cliche shots of the Taj Mahal are looking at it from straight on down the centre of the reflecting pools - yours is to the side, and that makes a difference. Plus the tones, which look great even on this crappy monitor at school.   Thanks for the comment, very much appreciated.', '2009-09-11 11:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
