(5781710, 636103, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m half tempted to go look at the 197 shots that were supposed to be better than this.  Its beautiful and well treated.</td>', 'I''m half tempted to go look at the 197 shots that were supposed to be better than this.  Its beautiful and well treated.', '2009-12-26 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5791287, 633315, 29748, '<td valign="top">OMG.  I love this photo.  Its so dramatic and perfect.  It reminds me of a fairy tale.</td>', 'OMG.  I love this photo.  Its so dramatic and perfect.  It reminds me of a fairy tale.', '2010-01-02 12:11:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5812751, 636224, 98339, '<td valign="top">I too think this should have scored much higher...it is a wonderful shot....</td>', 'I too think this should have scored much higher...it is a wonderful shot....', '2010-01-15 09:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5979839, 634365, 116674, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! would have voted at least a 7.</td>', 'This is a great shot! would have voted at least a 7.', '2010-04-29 20:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6000836, 635274, 116674, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! love the colour change from top to bottom</td>', 'Great shot!! love the colour change from top to bottom', '2010-05-11 00:31:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6108211, 636164, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like starting around the 5.5 range because those are usually pictures that have promise, but lacked something to put them over the top.  The scene here is obviously interesting as well as colorful.  Overall I think the picture lacks some contrast (probably mainly in the sky).  I tend to like to burn the edges of shots like this to really zero in on the subject, although here you have two comepting subjects.  Although I wasn''t there and so don''t know what''s outside the picture, I would have thought about swinging around to the left for two purposes: 1) remove the background people who detract from the ambiance and 2) get more of the subject''s faces.  I can see why you chose it for Best of the Year.  The scene definitely had promise.</td>', 'I like starting around the 5.5 range because those are usually pictures that have promise, but lacked something to put them over the top.  The scene here is obviously interesting as well as colorful.  Overall I think the picture lacks some contrast (probably mainly in the sky).  I tend to like to burn the edges of shots like this to really zero in on the subject, although here you have two comepting subjects.  Although I wasn''t there and so don''t know what''s outside the picture, I would have thought about swinging around to the left for two purposes: 1) remove the background people who detract from the ambiance and 2) get more of the subject''s faces.  I can see why you chose it for Best of the Year.  The scene definitely had promise.', '2010-07-29 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186209, 634709, 53203, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2010-10-08 12:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6202852, 636224, 41337, '<td valign="top">Just submitted a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1038820" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">challenge suggestion </a>that was inspired by this.</td>', 'Just submitted a challenge suggestion that was inspired by this.', '2010-10-27 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6220605, 635274, 3214, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63269" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Haneck</a>, shot on the same day, with Cristy.  Same models.</td>', ' Haneck, shot on the same day, with Cristy.  Same models.', '2010-11-12 00:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6221190, 635576, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - it wasn''t nearly that purple when we were there.  You picked a great day!  :-)</td>', 'Wow - it wasn''t nearly that purple when we were there.  You picked a great day!  :-)', '2010-11-12 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6242729, 635463, 33769, '<td valign="top">I like the candid feel to this image of people mingling, the beach scene and explosion of color are ''wow'' to me- beautiful and amazing! the sun looks like an eye winking closed...while the sky above is touched with whites yellows, oranges, reds, pinks and even darker shades that border on rose and black... its beautiful thank u for sharing it</td>', 'I like the candid feel to this image of people mingling, the beach scene and explosion of color are ''wow'' to me- beautiful and amazing! the sun looks like an eye winking closed...while the sky above is touched with whites yellows, oranges, reds, pinks and even darker shades that border on rose and black... its beautiful thank u for sharing it', '2010-12-02 21:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6299077, 635663, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beutiful!  I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge as I gave it a very high score.  Lovely!</td>', 'Beutiful!  I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge as I gave it a very high score.  Lovely!', '2011-01-31 21:41:16.000000', NULL, 0),
